erve guard, broke his lower right leg in the first half of Louisville’s victory over Duke. The Cardinals used Ware’s injury as a rallying point.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/sports/ncaabasketball/kevin-wares-gruesome-injury-shakes-and-rallies-louisville.html', 'snippet': 'Kevin Ware, a sophomore reserve guard, broke his lower right leg in the first half of Louisville’s victory over Duke. The Cardinals used Ware’s injury as a rallying point.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — It happens in every game, thousands of times in the course of a season. A player breaks free for an open jumper. An off-the-ball defender jumps at him. Whether the shot falls or not, both players run back downcourt and play on.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/sports/MIDWESTSIDE/MIDWESTSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/01/sports/MIDWESTSIDE/MIDWESTSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/sports/MIDWESTSIDE/MIDWESTSIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/sports/MIDWESTSIDE/MIDWESTSIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1614, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/sports/MIDWESTSIDE/MIDWESTSIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/01/sports/MIDWESTSIDE/MIDWEST