n exiles, and looked toward home.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Breed of Cuban Dissident Finds Changed Miami', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Breed of Cuban Dissident Finds Changed Miami', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alvarez, Lizette', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cuban-Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Yoani', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Miami (Fla)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-01T01:57:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizette Alvarez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alvarez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/479f54e5-bd80-52a4-812b-21f94d940992', 'word_count': 905, 'uri': 'nyt://article/479f54e5-bd80-52a4-812b-21f94d940992'}, {'abstract': 'Banks and compensation experts say the complexity of the business justifies the pay, but critics say increased regulation has limited the ability of boards to perform important tasks.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/pay-for-boards-at-banks-soars-amid-cutbacks/', 'snippet': 'Banks and compensation experts say the complexity of the business justifies the pay, but critics say increased regulation has limited the ability of boards to perform important tasks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wall Street pay, while lucrative, isn’t what it used to be — unless you are a board member.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 's