ime achievement in the arts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The MacDowell Colony, the prestigious artists’ retreat in New Hampshire, has announced that the composer Stephen Sondheim will be awarded the 54th annual Edward MacDowell Medal for lifetime achievement in the arts. Mr. Sondheim will be the first artist from musical theater to receive the award. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sondheim to Receive MacDowell Medal', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sondheim to Receive MacDowell Medal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sondheim, Stephen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MacDowell Colony', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-01T02:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/097df74c-c5c0-5ddf-8ca5-9b747fdaa0d3', 'word_count': 113, 'uri': 'nyt://article/097df74c-c5c0-5ddf-8ca5-9b747fdaa0d3'}, {'abstract': 'Advocates of overhauling New York State’s political fund-raising laws will spend more than $800,000 on a new campaign so typical New Yorkers can have their voices heard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/nyregion/ads-to-urge-change-in-ny-state-campaign-financing.html', 'snippet': 'Advocates of overhauling New York State’s political fund-raising laws will spend more than $800,000 on a new campaign so typical New Yorkers can have their voices heard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — In an effort to build public support for reining in the flood of money in politics, advocates of overhauling New York State’s political fund-raising laws will spend o