 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e70f1dd-f12e-5185-9407-b65a4c835cd0'}, {'abstract': 'An ambitious exhibition on images of war and its aftermath captures a complex set of emotions, from sorrow and grief to compassion and even joy.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/from-combat-compassion/', 'snippet': 'An ambitious exhibition on images of war and its aftermath captures a complex set of emotions, from sorrow and grief to compassion and even joy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is there, in each of the photographs. The beauty. And the sorrow. The beautiful far-away stare of a young Israeli woman sitting on her bed. The sorrow of the tan skin suit that protects her badly burned torso. The beautiful joy of a soldier fencing with his sons using plastic light sabers, “Star Wars”-style. The sorrow of the prosthetic leg that extends from his rolled-up blue jeans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Combat, Compassion', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-01T09:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Dao', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dao', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb0ad302-9614-55c7-9564-a43104c890aa', 'word_count': 1255, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb0ad302-9614-55c7-9564-a43104c890aa'}, {'abstract': 'Who or what is guiding you as you prepare for life after high school?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/