urer’s effort to patent an amended version of a cancer drug expressed relief on Monday after India’s highest court rejected the patent, in a case that has been closely watched by pharmaceutical companies, makers of generic drugs and health care activists.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/world/asia/01-Novartis-IndiaInk/01-Novartis-IndiaInk-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline'