y Blodget, the Business Insider co-founder and a former Merrill Lynch analyst, has told Ken Auletta that some day he may explore trying to overturn a lifetime ban from the securities industry.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/after-dishonorable-discharge-blodget-muses-about-a-comeback-on-wall-st/', 'snippet': 'Henry Blodget, the Business Insider co-founder and a former Merrill Lynch analyst, has told Ken Auletta that some day he may explore trying to overturn a lifetime ban from the securities industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Henry Blodget is known these days for editing Business Insider, the online news outlet. But he first gained renown as a Wall Street stock analyst who fell from grace after the dot-com boom.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After ‘Dishonorable Discharge,’ Blodget Muses About a Wall Street Comeback', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blodget, Henry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Business Insider Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-01T14:51:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55760014-6b47-5486-a9a6-6539fc626db2', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55760014-6b47-5486-a9a6-6539fc626db2'}, {'abstract': 'It was sad but not entirely surprising when word came on Sunday of the passing of Pattycake, the Bronx Zoo gorilla who had long reigned as one of the city’s more acclaimed tourist attractions.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/remembering-patty-cake-the-bronx-zoos-beloved-gorilla-who-is-dead-at-40/', 'snippet': 'It was sad but not entirely surprising when word came on Sunday of the passing of Pattycake, the Bronx Zoo gorilla who had long reigned as one of the city’s more acclaimed tourist attractions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were problems with her heart that weren’t getting better. She weighed 320 pounds. One can only imagine the toll taken by so many years of cloying attention, all the beguiled admirers staring and cooing and craning to get close to her. The press was always sniffing around for new angles. Of course, there was her age.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/nyregion/01cityroom-pattycake/01cityroom-pattycake-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/01/nyregion/01cityroom-pattycake/01cityroom-pattycake-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/nyregion/01cityroom-pattycake/01cityroom-pattycake-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/nyregion/01cityroom-pattycake/01cityroom-pattycake-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/01/nyregion/01cityroom-pattycake/01cityroom-pattycake-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumb