ple, at least two groups of three will always be either all friends or all acquaintances. What about seven people? Eight?', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week we continue to celebrate the life of the mathematician Paul Erdos, who would have celebrated his 100th birthday on March 26. Our challenge will be to explore a classic often associated with Dr. Erdos — the Party Problem.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/crosswords/Party-Problem-Main/Party-Problem-Main-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 