rt disease and stroke.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1011, 'width': 1440, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/health/02brody/02brody-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sodium, Hiding in Plain Sight', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sodium, Hiding in Plain Sight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-01T16:02:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane E. Brody', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Brody', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/503e893e-adc3-5a67-9dff-24a9534b6fff', 'word_count': 1268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/503e893e-adc3-5a67-9dff-24a9534b6fff'}, {'abstract': 'Samples of questions Prof. Ronald Levant can answer about male sexuality problems, from men and from women.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/booming/taking-questions-about-middle-aged-male-sexuality.html', 'snippet': 'Samples of questions Prof. Ronald Levant can answer about male sexuality problems, from men and from women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s expert is Ronald F. Levant, who will be answering questions about male sexuality issues affecting middle-aged men and their partners. He is a professor of psychology at the University of Akron, was president of the American Psychological Association and is an author or editor of 14 books, including “Men and Sex: New Psychological Perspectives.” Following are samples of the kinds of questions he is prepared to answer — from men and from women about men. [Update: Answers are now posted here.]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/booming/03expert-booming-malesex/03expert-booming-malesex-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 268, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/booming/03expert-booming-malesex/03expert-booming-malesex-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 268, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image