63426'}, {'abstract': 'All the preseason doomsaying was forgotten, at least on Monday, as the Mets broke out their bats and walloped the San Diego Padres behind the pitching of Jon Niese.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/02/sports/baseball/happy-thoughts-for-a-day-mets-continue-habit-of-winning-openers.html', 'snippet': 'All the preseason doomsaying was forgotten, at least on Monday, as the Mets broke out their bats and walloped the San Diego Padres behind the pitching of Jon Niese.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All of the familiar opening day sights were present Monday afternoon at Citi Field: the clubhouse pleasantries and on-field pageantry, the overstuffed press box, the freshly trimmed grass and even some sporadic shreds of sun.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1456, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/02/sports/WEB-mets1/WEB-mets1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Happy Thoughts for a Day: Mets Continue Habit of Winning Openers', 'kicker': 'Mets 11, Padres 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Usual, Mets Bolt to the Front of a Marathon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Diego Padres', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-01T21:52:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b18135d-6bf8-5504-8c4c-2d7c64a4c992', 'word_count': 957, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b18135d-6bf8-5504-8c4c-2d7c64a4c992'}, {'abstract': 'The new law enforces a more rigid separation of sexes in schools and prohibits any relations with Israelis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/02/world/middleeast/hamas-imposes-new-restrictions-on-schools-in-gaza.html', 'snippet': 'The new law enforces a more rigid separation of sexes in schools and prohibits any relations with Israelis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GAZA — Hamas, the Islamic group that rules this Palestinian territory, has issued a new education law enforcing a more rigid separation of sexes in schools and prohibiting any relations with Israelis, in line with its strictly religious and nationa