umber since 2003, according to data from Thomson Reuters.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/01/mergers-slow-to-a-snails-pace-in-the-quarter-the-fewest-since-2003/', 'snippet': 'Only 8,115 deals were announced worldwide in the first quarter of 2013, the lowest number since 2003, according to data from Thomson Reuters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deal makers may want to keep the Champagne bottles on ice a while longer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mergers Slowed to a Snail’s Pace in the First Quarter, the Fewest Since 2003', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mergers Slowed to a Snail’s Pace in the Quarter, the Fewest Since 2003', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-02T01:06:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14289f86-da4a-5097-bc3b-dbec071f018e', 'word_count': 608, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14289f86-da4a-5097-bc3b-dbec071f018e'}, {'abstract': 'The mayor’s anger at two state senators who blocked expansion of red-light cameras is understandable and laudable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/02/nyregion/bloombergs-ire-on-defeat-of-red-light-cameras-is-justified.html', 'snippet': 'The mayor’s anger at two state senators who blocked expansion of red-light cameras is understandable and laudable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael R. Bloomberg can grow easily irritated, and he minces fewer wo