 the police was an objective.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/02/nyregion/kelly-intended-frisks-to-instill-fear-senator-testifies.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Eric Adams told a federal judge — and Police Commissioner Raymond W. Kelly denied — that Mr. Kelly had said making young minority men fear the police was an objective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During a legislative debate in 2010 over the Police Department’s use of stop-and-frisk encounters, the police commissioner, Raymond W. Kelly, met with the governor at the time, David A. Paterson, to defend the tactic’s importance as a crime-fighting tool.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kelly Said Street Stops Targeted Minorities, Senator Testifies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kelly Said Street Stops Targeted Minorities, Senator Testifies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paterson, David A', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adams, Eric L', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-02T02:37:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifi