8dd8'}, {'abstract': 'North Korea’s threat to put all its nuclear facilities to use, including a reactor shuttered in a disarmament deal, came after a series of bellicose statements.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/world/asia/north-korea-threatens-to-restart-nuclear-reactor.html', 'snippet': 'North Korea’s threat to put all its nuclear facilities to use, including a reactor shuttered in a disarmament deal, came after a series of bellicose statements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — North Korea announced plans on Tuesday to restart a mothballed nuclear reactor, the latest in a series of provocations by its leader, Kim Jong-un, to elicit a muted response from American officials, who believe they can wait out Mr. Kim’s threats until he realizes his belligerent behavior will not force South Korea or the United States into making any concessions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'North Korea Says It Will Restart Reactor to Expand Arsenal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'North Korea Says It Will Restart Mothballed Nuclear Reactor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landler, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim Jong-un', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-02T07:04:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Choe Sang-Hun and Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Choe', 'mi