The Nationals opened at home looking for all the world like the next superstar team. The Braves have launched a whole era by uniting the Upton brothers. Seattle’s Felix Hernandez pitched so well, people stopped minding that he needs a Brinks truck to bring home his new paycheck. And while New York slumped at the sight of the Yankees’ geriatric era, the Mets tried to inject a ray or two of sunshine by thinking almost aloud, “Hey, we might not be totally terrible!”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1490, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/baseball/03leadingpic/03leadingpic-thumbLarg