possible terrifying consequence.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/02/that-falling-feeling/', 'snippet': 'It’s an eternity before you hit the ground, long enough to recall every possible terrifying consequence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This has been a nasty winter for those of us afraid of falling. Recently, having left my dog alone far longer than expected, the call of nature required I take him out immediately on returning home — after yet another March snow. He is big, I am small, and in his urgency he yanked me down the unshoveled and unsalted porch steps. That was fall No. 1. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'That Falling Feeling', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Falls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-02T15:50:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Gross', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gross', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a08a6cf0-0723-5f58-acb9-b8073525dff0', 'word_count': 1000, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a08a6cf0-0723-5f58-acb9-b8073525dff0'}, {'abstract': 'In New York City, it just got a lot more difficult to hold a 5-year-old back from kindergarten for an extra year.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/02/kindergarten-redshirting-gets-tougher-in-n-y-c-with-repercussions/', 'snippet': 'In New York City, it just got a lot more difficult to hold a 5-year-old back from kindergarten for an extra year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We “redshirted” our son last year, and I’m so glad we 