'abstract': 'The Metropolitan Museum Artists celebrated their 10th anniversary with a performance on Friday in the Grace Rainey Rogers Auditorium.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/arts/music/metropolitan-museum-artists-10th-anniversary-concert.html', 'snippet': 'The Metropolitan Museum Artists celebrated their 10th anniversary with a performance on Friday in the Grace Rainey Rogers Auditorium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hard to believe a full decade has passed since Edward Arron, a skillful young cellist with a flair for programming and a knack for organization, convened a group of his peers for a new chamber music initiative, the Metropolitan Museum Artists in Concert. Formed in 2003 to help the museum celebrate its 50th anniversary as a concert presenter, the ensemble celebrated its own 10th anniversary with a concert in the museum’s Grace Rainey Rogers Auditorium on Friday night.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/MET/MET-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/MET/MET-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/MET/MET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/MET/MET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1439, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/MET/MET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':