seem to be few people remaining to come.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/world/americas/new-wave-of-mexican-immigrants-seems-unlikely.html', 'snippet': 'Some American lawmakers worry that a pathway to citizenship could encourage illegal immigration, but in some parts of Mexico there seem to be few people remaining to come.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EL CARGADERO, Mexico — The pretty houses in the hills here, with their bright paint and new additions, clearly display the material benefits of having millions of workers move to the United States over the past few decades. But these simple homes also reveal why another huge exodus would be unlikely: the bulk of them are empty.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Mexican Villages, Few Are Left to Dream of U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Mexican Villages, Few Left to Dream of U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cave, Damien', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Citizenship and Naturalization', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T00:52:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Damien Cave', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Damien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cave', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c9704df-fc57-5f5a-b3b4-dba850321f31', 'word_count': 1843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c9704df-fc57-5f5a-b3b4-dba850321f31'}, {'abstract': 'The deal is expected to make him the successor to Jay Leno of the “Tonight” show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/business/media/jimmy-fallon-said-to-have-extended-nbc-contract.html', 'snippet': 'The deal is expected to make him the successor to Jay Leno of the “Tonight” show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jimmy Fallon has signed a contract extension with NBC that will keep him at the network, executives with knowledge of the deal said Tuesday night. It is understood the deal will include that he will succeed Jay Leno as host of the “Tonight” show at some point, they said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jimmy Fallon Said to Have Extended NBC Contract', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fallon, Jimmy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leno, Jay', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T00:53:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8bfe6d69-19ed-52cd-9d52-a1648f3ee8c9', 'word_count': 187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8bfe6d69-19ed-52cd-9d52-a1648f3ee8c9'}, {'abstract': 'American lawmakers worry that  a pathway to citizenship could encourage illegal immigration, but in Mexico, there seem to be few left to come.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/04/02/world/americas/20130403-MEXICO.html