them, shoving them and throwing basketballs at them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/sports/ncaabasketball/rutgers-coach-mike-rice-facing-scrutiny-after-video-airs.html', 'snippet': 'In a video shown on ESPN, Rutgers basketball coach Mike Rice is seen yelling homophobic slurs at his players, kicking them, grabbing them, shoving them and throwing basketballs at them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a video shown Tuesday on ESPN, the Rutgers men’s basketball coach, Mike Rice, is seen yelling homophobic slurs at his players, kicking them, grabbing them and shoving them. He also throws basketballs at their legs, their heads and their bodies from point-blank range — as if he were playing dodge ball.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/y-RUTGERS/y-RUTGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/y-RUTGERS/y-RUTGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 554}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/y-RUTGERS/y-RUTGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 945, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/y-RUTGERS/y-RUTGERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1890, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/y-RUTGERS/y-RUTGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/03/sports/y-RUTGERS/y-RUTGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt