ulture has disappointed many people who once had hopes for it. Excluding, of course, those who’ve made money from it, appropriately represented in the public’s mind by Monsanto. That corporation, or at least its friends, recently managed to have an outrageous rider slipped into the 587-page funding bill Congress sent to President Obama.[1]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Do G.M.O.’s Need Protection?', 'kicker': 'Mark Bittman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetic Engineering', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AGRICULTURE DEPARTMENT', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T01:30:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Bittman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bittman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85e68f4e-47d3-5fdd-974e-c49e8a72c5dd', 'word_count': 1425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85e68f4e-47d3-5fdd-974e-c49e8a72c5dd'}, {'abstract': 'The lesson of Roe v. Wade is that the Supreme Court must not wait on fundamental rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/opinion/justice-ginsburgs-misdirection-ahead-of-the-gay-marriage-rulings.html', 'snippet': 'The lesson of Roe v. Wade is that the Supreme Court must not wait on fundamental rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With two same-sex marriage cases before the Supreme Court, numerous commentators have latched on to remarks by Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg critical of the court’s 1973 Roe v. Wade decision that legalized abortion nationwide. It is not the judgment that was wrong, but “it moved too far, too fast,” she said at Columbia Law School last year, a view she has expressed in various speeches and law review articles. As one of the court’s moderate liberals and a champion of women’s rights, she is now being routinely cited to argue for a timid resolution on the issue of same-sex marriage that would strike down California’s ban on such marriages, but would leave prohibitions standing in about 40 other states. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Justice Ginsburg’s Misdirection', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Justice Ginsburg&#8217;s Misdirection ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ginsburg, Ruth Bader', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roe v Wade (Supreme Court Decision)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T01:30:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a3468f3-40df-5863-a0a0-daa8d26b12b9', 'word_count': 627, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a3468f3-40df-5863-a0a0-daa8d26b12b9'}, {'abstract': 'Animal Planet’s live Internet stream is promoting 10 additional Web channels this week, including webcams for ants, penguins and even cockroaches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/business/media/addictive-animal-webcams-get-network-attention.html', 'snippet': 'Animal Planet’s live Internet stream is promoting 10 additional Web channels this week, including webcams for ants, penguins and even cockroaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The average visitor to the Kitten Cam on Animal Planet’s Web site has a hard time leaving. The live Internet stream of felines has been watched more than 25 million times since it started last September. The average person, seemingly transfixed by the cuteness, stays on the page for 18 minutes and 50 seconds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 358}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 611, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1221, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/business/ADCO-1/ADCO-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 