 who is now the subject of a Broadway play, was a flawed journalist who once falsely accused a rape victim of perpetrating a hoax.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/opinion/the-damage-done-by-a-lucky-guy.html', 'snippet': 'Mike McAlary, the newspaper columnist who is now the subject of a Broadway play, was a flawed journalist who once falsely accused a rape victim of perpetrating a hoax.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I WENT last week to see “Lucky Guy,” the new play by Nora Ephron about the journalist Mike McAlary, in previews. The decision to cast Tom Hanks in the lead role was brilliant. Mr. Hanks cannot be anything but endearing, almost cuddly, even though the man he is portraying was complicated and deeply flawed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Damage Done by a ‘Lucky Guy’', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Damage Done by a ‘Lucky Guy’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAlary, Mike', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libel and Slander', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'First Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Daily News', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Lucky Guy (Play)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T01:47:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martin Garbus', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garbus', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab02b0be-e359-5531-82a7-8903550cd8b5', 'word_count': 1362, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab02b0be-e359-5531-82a7-8903550cd8b5'}, {'abstract': 'Louis C. Taylor was convicted for starting the deadliest fire in Arizona history, but his case is now helping to call into question previously held arson investigation principles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/us/advances-in-science-of-fire-set-convict-free-after-42-years.html', 'snippet': 'Louis C. Taylor was convicted for starting the deadliest fire in Arizona history, but his case is now helping to call into question previously held arson investigation principles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUCSON — Prosecutors who seek a conviction on a charge of arson must first prove that a fire was intentionally set, and then that the defendant was the one who set it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/us/ARSON-1/ARSON-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/03/us/ARSON-1/ARSON-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/us/ARSON-1/ARSON-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/us/ARSON-1/ARSON-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/us/ARSON-1/ARSON-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/03/us/ARSON-1/ARSON-1-thumbStandard