rward/', 'snippet': 'Sloane Stephens, 20, who fell in straight sets in the second round at the Family Circle Cup, said the pressure from her surprising Australian Open showing has been overwhelming at times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DANIEL ISLAND, S.C. — After her surprise run to the semifinals of the Australian Open in January that included an upset of Serena Williams, Sloane Stephens was suddenly the brightest young star in American tennis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stephens, After Another Early Exit, Tries to Maintain Focus Moving Forward', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T04:38:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By BEN ROTHENBERG', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'ROTHENBERG', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06ca4d74-48c3-5316-beaf-d8e659b6b0db', 'word_count': 562, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06ca4d74-48c3-5316-beaf-d8e659b6b0db'}, {'abstract': 'The North’s threats and provocative acts prompted the Pentagon to announce the deployment of an advanced radar battery and antimissile system to Guam.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/world/asia/north-korea-blocks-workers-from-south-at-border.html', 'snippet': 'The North’s threats and provocative acts prompted the Pentagon to announce the deployment of an advanced radar battery and antimissile system to Guam.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — The United States announced Wednesday that it was speeding the deployment of an advanced missile defense system to Guam in the next few weeks, two years ahead of schedule in what the Pentagon said was “a precautionary move” to protect American naval