ne moves on to Matchday 2 of the Champions League quarterfinals and begins worrying about what Barcelona’s 2-2 tie at Paris St.-Germain and Lionel Messi’s hamstring injury will mean for next week’s second leg, let’s take a moment to properly honor the gorgeous ball that Dani Alves sliced into Messi’s path for the Catalans’ opening goal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Praise of Dani Alves’s Pass', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alves, Dani', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barcelona (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T07:15:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebbd48cb-ad4b-59ec-8803-46260b52d91b', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebbd48cb-ad4b-59ec-8803-46260b52d91b'}, {'abstract': 'Today and six years ago: A comparison of Manmohan Singh’s C.I.I. speeches.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/the-prime-minister-sings-a-different-tune/', 'snippet': 'Today and six years ago: A comparison of Manmohan Singh’s C.I.I. speeches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI–Prime Minister Manmohan Singh spoke of India’s flagging economy in a televised address Wednesday. He endorsed the need for growth that uplifts the poor, and acknowledged that the current 5 percent growth rate was disappointing, but he nonetheless urged people to be optimistic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption'