d want to make a difference.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pampered. Pragmatic. Persnickety. These are not the employee attributes that build fast-growth companies, but all three describe a group of employees that fast growth entrepreneurs must confront when hiring. Since the Great Recession of 2008, my advice to entrepreneurs is to run, baby, run when it comes to hiring this group.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why I Like to Hire Great Recession Graduates', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T11:00:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cliff Oxford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cliff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Oxford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60ff364a-3517-5424-bfd6-d2c5ce6790d6', 'word_count': 1126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60ff364a-3517-5424-bfd6-d2c5ce6790d6'}, {'abstract': 'Shares of the vintage notebook company rose in trading in Milan on Wednesday as much as 3.9 percent before falling back slightly to close at 2.28 euros a share, down 0.87 percent from its offering price.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/shares-of-moleskine-rise-in-trading-debut/', 'snippet': 'Shares of the vintage notebook company rose in trading in Milan on Wednesday as much as 3.9 perc