icle', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8d44f34-ad7d-5026-8b6b-231e29a6de45', 'word_count': 2142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8d44f34-ad7d-5026-8b6b-231e29a6de45'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/what-were-reading-664/', 'snippet': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Washington Post: The solution for kale fatigue: chard. — Julia Moskin', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Reading', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T14:12:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cea994c8-6a5d-557e-b067-7d2e9ad45748', 'word_count': 582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cea994c8-6a5d-557e-b067-7d2e9ad45748'}, {'abstract': 'The band will play several cities in California, as well as in Las Vegas, Toronto, Chicago, Boston and Philadelphia.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/rolling-stones-announce-9-city-north-american-tour/', 'snippet': 'The band will play several cities in California, as well as in Las Vegas, Toronto, Chicago, Boston and Philadelphia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a week of not-so-subtle hints on billboards around the country, the Rolling Stones announced on Wednesday that the band will do a tour of nine cities i