wn now.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/announcing-a-leave-of-presence-ebert-says-hes-reducing-his-workload/', 'snippet': 'Roger Ebert, the influential film writer for The Chicago Sun-Times, said that despite having written more than 300 movie reviews last year, “I must slow down now.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not every critic makes waves when he says that he’ll be writing fewer than 300 reviews in a year, but then not every critic is Roger Ebert. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/ebert/ebert-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/ebert/ebert-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/ebert/ebert-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/ebert/ebert-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/ebert/ebert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/03/arts/ebert/ebert-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Announcing a ‘Leave of Presence,’ Ebert Says He’s Reducing His Workload', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ebert to Reduce His Workload', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ebert, Roger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Sun-Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T14:18:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a644674a-8926-51f1-80fb-05c1bed9a80c', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a644674a-8926-51f1-80fb-05c1bed9a80c'}, {'abstract': 'A government campaign to distribute free condoms in hotels puts Vietnamese authorities ahead of this still-traditional society.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/free-condom-campaign-is-a-pragmatic-shift-in-vietnams-approach-to-safer-sex/', 'snippet': 'A government campaign to distribute free condoms in hotels puts Vietnamese authorities ahead of this still-traditional society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HO CHI MINH CITY — There had been some safe-sex campaigns in Vietnam before: university students walking around campus dressed up as condoms, a video game by U.S.A.I.D. teaching men to use protection with prostitutes and even a stylish condom dress designed for World AIDS day. Now government officials have started doing their part, too, by calling on all hotels in the city to distribute free condoms.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Playing It Safe', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birth Control and Family Planni