epublicans nodding in agreement during a recent ice-breaking dinner as he described a basic problem for the nation’s fiscal future: For each dollar that Americans pay for Medicare, they ultimately draw about $3 in benefits. What’s more, he added, most people do not understand that.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Misperceptions of Benefits Make Trimming Them Harder', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Misperceptions of Benefits Make Trimming Harder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Calmes, Jackie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Security (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T14:38:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a851672-b16f-5ffe-a780-ff2b6cd8d509', 'word_count': 1167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a851672-b16f-5ffe-a780-ff2b6cd8d509'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Rice’s dismissal after the release of a video did little to quiet critics, who called for the jobs of university officials and asked why Mr. Rice was not fired sooner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/sports/ncaabasketball/rutgers-fires-basketball-coach-after-video-surfaces.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Rice’s dismissa