', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Shield Yourself From Smartphone Snoops', 'kicker': 'Tool Kit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How to Shield Yourself From Smartphone Snoops', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, Brian X', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T21:14:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edd27a14-e43c-5d67-982b-e98c0b132de7', 'word_count': 1000, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edd27a14-e43c-5d67-982b-e98c0b132de7'}, {'abstract': 'The league will encourage teams to use the video from the home team’s locker room on their stadium scoreboards, to give fans at games extra value and an insider’s view of the team.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/03/n-f-l-to-install-cameras-in-locker-rooms-for-stadium-viewing/', 'snippet': 'The league will encourage teams to use the video from the home team’s locker room on their stadium scoreboards, to give fans at games extra value and an insider’s view of the team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In its quest to keep fans in the stands, and give them a reason not to view games in high definition in their livings rooms, the N.F.L. will put cameras into all home team locker rooms next season. Then they will encourage the teams to use the video on their stadium scoreboards, to give fans who buy tickets an inside look at what goes on in the teams’ inner sanctums. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.L. to Install Cameras in Locker Rooms for Stadium Viewing', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cameras in Locker Rooms', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stadiums and Arenas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-03T21:15:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/285bf614-e393-5259-bce7-2d76d3a1c23f', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/285bf614-e393-5259-bce7-2d76d3a1c23f'}, {'abstract': 'Several plays in this year’s Humana Festival in Louisville explore the shaping of the human psyche.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/theater/the-humana-festival-of-new-american-plays-in-louisville.html', 'snippet': 'Several plays in this year’s Humana Festival in Louisville explore the shaping of the human psyche.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOUISVILLE, Ky. — How exactly do we become the people we are? That knotty question hovered in the air at the Humana Festival of New American Plays at the Actors Theater here. The most intriguing works in the festival, now under the direction of Les Waters, take the audience on engrossing journeys through the thick underbrush of the human psyche as it is shaped by family, society and the divided impulses of the self.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1408, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/arts/04HUMANAjp1/04HUMANAjp1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Selfish Sons and Trolls, Swollen Egos Stride the Stage', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Selfish Sons and Trolls, Swollen Egos Stride the Stage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humana Festival of New American Plays', 