pwrecked,” a show of his furniture, lighting and fabrics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/garden/tord-boontjes-shipwrecked-exhibition-in-london.html', 'snippet': 'Tord Boontje evokes both the jungle and the recession in “Shipwrecked,” a show of his furniture, lighting and fabrics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The idea of being shipwrecked on a tropical island has lost luster since the 2000 film “Cast Away” portrayed Tom Hanks performing dental surgery on himself with a piece of flotsam. But Tord Boontje is restoring romance to the concept, while commenting on the creative potential sparked by a desolate economy.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/garden/04TEXTILES/04CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 829, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/garden/04TEXTILES/04CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 829}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/garden/04TEXTILES/04CURR3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 741, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/garden/04TEXTILES/04CURR3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1482, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/garden/04TEXTILES/04CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/garden/04TEXTILES/04CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cre