e Kooples, a new label, is the latest entrant to the United States market from a family of fashion entrepreneurs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been widely noted that couples over time start to look alike: mannerisms, facial expressions, style of dress. The Kooples, a fashion label that hails from Paris via London and recently set up at Bloomingdale’s in New York, takes this last point to heart. Its men’s and women’s collections are designed to complement each other, even be shared. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/fashion/04ZKOOP_SPAN/04ZKOOP1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, '