olice. Mr. Maynard remained alert enough to speak as he was flown to a hospital, and the police are investigating a motive, Sergeant Baylous said. Sheriff Crum, sworn in Jan. 1 after serving as a local magistrate, was known especially for targeting drug dealers, the authorities said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'West Virginia: Man Held in Sheriff’s Killing', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Mid-Atlantic', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'West Virginia: Man Held In Sheriff’s Killing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gabriel, Trip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Virginia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maynard, Tennis M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T00:35:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Trip Gabriel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Trip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gabriel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2214709-b867-5f7b-9534-facc8aabafa3', 'word_count': 131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2214709-b867-5f7b-9534-facc8aabafa3'}, {'abstract': 'To remember Brooklyn’s baseball heroes, all one needs to do is walk around the block of an apartment complex erected at the former site of Ebbets Field, where the Dodgers played their first game, an exhibition on April 5, 1913.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/sports/baseball/ebbets-field-is-gone-but-memories-of-brooklyn-dodgers-endure.html', 'snippet': 'To remember Brooklyn’s baseball heroes, all one needs to do is walk around the block of an apartment complex erected at the former site of Ebbets Field, where the Dodgers played their first game, an exhibition on April 5, 1913.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The apartment complex has stood longer than its fabled ancestor. On the wall near the Bedford Avenue entrance to the 1,318 units that rise 20 beige-brick stories is a concrete marker dated 1962 that reads, “This Is the Former Site of Ebbets Field.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSON1sepia/ANDERSON1sepia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSON1sepia/ANDERSON1sepia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSON1sepia/ANDERSON1sepia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSON1sepia/ANDERSON1sepia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1426, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSON1sepia/ANDERSON1sepia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSON1sepia/ANDERSON1sepia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/ANDERSO