//www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/us/politics/william-h-ginsburg-70-represented-monica-lewinsky.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Ginsburg’s career took a startling turn in 1998, when he went to Washington to represent Monica Lewinsky during the scandal over her relationship with President Bill Clinton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William H. Ginsburg, a civil malpractice lawyer in Los Angeles whose career took a startling turn in 1998 when he went to Washington to represent, volubly and controversially, a young White House intern named Monica Lewinsky, died on Monday at his home in Los Angeles. He was 70. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 468, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 468}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1599, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/us/04ginsburg/04ginsburg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'William H. Ginsburg, Monica Lewinsky’s Lawyer, Dies at 70', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'William H. Ginsburg, 70, Monica Lewinsky’s Lawyer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yardley, William', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ginsburg, William H', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legal Profession', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewinsky, Monica S', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T00:42:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/f174adc2-2173-5c11-a2d2-c1bcdb25f382', 'word_count': 680, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f174adc2-2173-5c11-a2d2-c1bcdb25f382'}, {'abstract': 'The $680 fee to apply for naturalization — which has nearly tripled since 1999 — effectively denies many legal permanent residents a chance to become citizens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/opinion/priced-out-of-citizenship.html', 'snippet': 'The $680 fee to apply for naturalization — which has nearly tripled since 1999 — effectively denies many legal permanent residents a chance to become citizens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Priced Out of Citizenship', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributors', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Priced Out of Citizenship', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Citizenship and Naturalization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citizenship and Immigration Services (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T00:42:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rahm Emanuel and Luis V. Gutierrez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rahm', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emanuel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Luis', 'middlename': 'V.', 'lastname': 'Gutierrez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0e0bf8d-ec3b-5ca1-9ca3-4c67fa7fddea', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0e0bf8d-ec3b-5ca1-9ca3-4c67fa7fddea'}, {'abstract': 'Using an online questionnaire filled out by over 161,000 people, the BBC has concluded that in today’s complicated world, there are seven social classes, not three.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/world/europe/multiplying-the-old-divisions-of-class-in-britain.html', 'snippet': 'Using an online questionnaire filled out by over 161,000 people, the BBC has concluded that in today’s complicated world, there are seven social classes, not three.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Class in Britain used to be a relatively simple matter, or at least it used to be treated that way. It came in three flavors — upper, middle and working — and people supposedly knew by some mysterious native sixth sense exactly where they stood. As the very tall John Cleese declared to the les