ing part of a crew that stole thousands of dollars in cash and drugs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A 17-year veteran of the New York Police Department was arrested on Wednesday on charges that he was a member of a crew that robbed drug dealers of thousands of dollars in cash and drugs. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Officer Charged in Robberies of Drug Dealers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer Charged in Robberies of Drug Dealers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tejada, Jose', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T01:55:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa0258ab-90d5-5fdf-9d3d-c8e78a030219', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa0258ab-90d5-5fdf-9d3d-c8e78a030219'}, {'abstract': 'In the long winter of Obama, Dr. Benjamin Carson is the Conservative Black Hope of the moment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/opinion/coates-he-wears-the-mask.html', 'snippet': 'In the long winter of Obama, Dr. Benjamin Carson is the Conservative Black Hope of the moment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The present darling of the right wing, Dr. Benjamin Carson, is a distinguished neurosurgeon who went from the depths of Detroit poverty to the heights of Johns Hopkins Hospital in Baltimore. But his current status among conservatives isn’t so much rooted in Carson’s redemptive rise from rags to respectability, as it is in the belief that he is, in the long winter of Obama, the one they’ve been waiting for.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/08/opinion/TaNehisi_img/TaNehisi_img-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 653, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/08/opinion/TaNehisi_img/TaNehisi_img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 653, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/08/opinion/TaNehisi_img/TaNehisi_img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/08/opinion/TaNehisi_img/TaNehisi_img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/08/opinion/TaNehisi_img/TaNehisi_img-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'He Wears the Mask', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Guest Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'He Wears The Mask', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coates, Ta-Nehisi', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'p