four goals and they beat the Pittsburgh Penguins.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/sports/hockey/rangers-topple-penguins.html', 'snippet': 'The Rangers did not seem to miss Marian Gaborik as three new players scored four goals and they beat the Pittsburgh Penguins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No matter how much of a head-scratcher the Marian Gaborik trade may have seemed on Wednesday, the Rangers did not seem to miss him at all at Madison Square Garden. Instead, with three newly acquired players combining to score four goals, the rebooted Rangers put together their best performance of the season, routing the Eastern Conference-leading Pittsburgh Penguins, 6-1. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/hockey/04rangers2-img/04rangers2-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 470, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/hockey/04rangers2-img/04rangers2-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 470}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/hockey/04rangers2-img/04rangers2-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 802, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/hockey/04rangers2-img/04rangers2-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1604, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/hockey/04rangers2-img/04rangers2-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/sports/hoc