nt': 1042, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c3b37db-fded-5771-b956-8b91a9b229be'}, {'abstract': 'The fall of Communism helped a group of Roma prosper, building opulent mansions while maintaining traditional ways.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/kings-of-the-roma/', 'snippet': 'The fall of Communism helped a group of Roma prosper, building opulent mansions while maintaining traditional ways.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To reach a surprising place, follow Route 6 south of Bucharest as it unwinds across the Romanian countryside, past fields of wildflowers and flocks of sheep. Turn west before the Danube River and head toward a grid of neatly laid streets, set down among farms.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kings of the Roma', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mansions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Romani People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bucharest (Romania)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Romania', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T09:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4fdd7a6c-12e4-597d-8fb3-c8b312180538', 'word_count': 932, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4fdd7a6c-12e4-597d-8fb3-c8b312180538'}, {'abstract': 'South Korea’s defense chief said on Thursday that the missile possessed “considerable” range, but that it was not capable of reaching the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/world/asia/north-korean-missile-moved-to-coast.html', 'snippet': 'South Korea’s defense chief said on Thursday that the missile possessed “considerable” range, but that it was not capable of reaching the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — South Korea’s defense chief said Thursday that North Korea had moved to its east coast a missile with a “considerable” range, but that the weapon was not capable of reaching the United States. The disclosure came as the North’s military warned that it was ready to strike American military forces with “cutting-edge smaller, lighter and diversified nuclear strike means.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/world/korea1/korea1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/05/world/korea1/korea1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/world/korea1/korea1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/world/korea1/korea1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/world/korea1/korea1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/05/world/korea1/korea1-thumbStandard.jpg'