 wane, thanks to the effectiveness of the varicella vaccine.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/putting-an-end-to-chickenpox/', 'snippet': 'Chickenpox, which once led to thousands of hospitalizations and about 100 deaths a year, is on the wane, thanks to the effectiveness of the varicella vaccine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A long-term study of the chickenpox vaccine has found it highly effective after one dose and even more effective after two.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 219, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 219, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_childhood/well_childhood-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 149, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Putting an End to Chickenpox', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chicken Pox', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shingles (Disease)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T14:23:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbc2b906-86ea-5331-a7d9-3f609593ff26', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbc2b906-86ea-5331-a7d9-3f609593ff26'}, {'abstract': 'The pocket watch made a surprise showing at SIHH, Geneva’s annual luxury watch fair.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/04/a-classic-timekeeper-returns/', 'snippet': 'The pocket watch made a surprise showing at SIHH, Geneva’s annual luxury watch fair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pocket watch, a dandy’s relic from days long gone, made a surprise showing at SIHH, Geneva’s annual luxury watch fair. Vacheron Constantin, a company that maintains a steady stable of historic pieces in their collection, introduced the elegant Patrimony Contemporaine Pocket Watch in rose gold with a leather strap and pouch. The manually wound timekeeper has an optional chain available for those who prefer the glint of gold.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Return of the Pocket Watch', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Watches and Clocks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vacheron Constantin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Geneva (Switzerland)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T14:30:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Pask', 'person': [{'firstname':