f people’s information needs are unmet, from complex questions to simple ones. Google, as it fends off rivals on all sides, wants to be the one to meet them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a front-page article in The New York Times on Thursday, I wrote that Web search is at its biggest crossroad since its invention, as users demand more from search and Google faces a broader array of rivals than ever. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-singhal-square-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 535, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-singhal-square-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 535}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-singhal-square-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 914, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-singhal-square-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1743, 'width': 1953, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-singhal-square-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-singhal-square-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/04/technology/04bits-singhal-square/04bits-si