e deleted documents related to the decision to invest in Greek government bonds just before Greece’s bailout in 2010.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/business/global/former-top-cypriot-bankers-cited-in-report.html', 'snippet': 'A report said two senior executives at the Bank of Cyprus might have deleted documents related to the decision to invest in Greek government bonds just before Greece’s bailout in 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Two of the most senior executives at Bank of Cyprus may have deleted crucial e-mail documents last year related to what proved to be a disastrous decision to invest heavily in Greek government bonds just before Greece’s international bailout in 2010, according to an investigative report commissioned by the central bank of Cyprus.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Bank Officials Named in Cyprus Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Bank Officials Named in Cyprus Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of Cyprus', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cyprus', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eliades, Andreas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Patsalides, Christakis', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T19:18:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Landon Thomas Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Landon', 'middlename