5dda2a0a', 'word_count': 464, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70733411-42ac-5940-9111-cba25dda2a0a'}, {'abstract': 'Seven members of the National Ballet of Cuba have defected during a Mexican tour and made their way to the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/arts/dance/citing-art-and-money-7-cuban-dancers-defect-to-us.html', 'snippet': 'Seven members of the National Ballet of Cuba have defected during a Mexican tour and made their way to the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They are in their early 20s, trained at one of the world’s most prestigious ballet companies, and they now confront a cold new world: the competitive, often precarious and very much nonsubsidized American dance scene.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Citing Art and Money, 7 Cuban Dancers Defect to U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Citing Art and Money, 7 Cuban Dancers Defect to U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wakin, Daniel J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Ballet of Cuba', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defectors (Political)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T21:40:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4aa086d4-8ad3-5ba4-8a0f-fca289ecfd3f', 'word_count': 494, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4aa086d4-8ad3-5ba4-8a0f-fca289ecfd3f'}, {'abstract': 'In “Trance,” directed by Danny Boyle, an auction house employee gets caught up in an art heist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/movies/trance-directed-by-danny-boyle.html', 'snippet': 'In “Trance,” directed by Danny Boyle, an auction house employee gets caught up in an art heist.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Trance,” Danny Boyle’s speed-freaky neo-noir, begins in a London auction house, one of those muted, imperial shrines where old masters are bought with nearly imperceptible nods. Starting this way is pretty much akin to a bull locking itself in a china shop. The director of head-rushing entertainments like “28 Days Later” and “127 Hours,” Mr. Boyle is a flamboyant visual stylist with a punk rocker’s delight in anarchic jolts. His is a cinema of attraction and repulsion. One minute he’s seducing you with bold color and whooshing cameras, the next he’s like a kid with a Taser, zapping you with grotesque images like a macheted head topped off as cleanly as a coconut.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'You Are Getting Sleepy. Where’d You Hide the Goya?', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'You Are Getting Sleepy. Where’d You Hide the Goya?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boyle, Danny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dawson, Rosario', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cassel, Vincent', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAvoy, James', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Trance (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-04T21:43:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis