shion/a-life-plan-for-two-followed-by-one-modern-love.html', 'snippet': 'What began as a crush evolved into that peculiar sort of adolescent friendship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin was everything an overweight 10-year-old girl could ever hope for in a man. His hair was the color of Cheetos and he was an incredible speller. It was decided; I was in love.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 724}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 849, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1698, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/fashion/07MODERNLOVE/0407MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Life Plan for Two, Followed by One', 'kicker': 'Modern Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Life Plan for Two, Followed by One', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shifrin, Marina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emotions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Friendship', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T00:46:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marina Shifrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shifrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afb17384-a860-5483-851e-b77d9e167996', 'word_count': 1514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afb17384-a860-5483-851e-b77d9e167996'}, {'abstract': 'Addressing issues on mistaken identities, the death of a pet, financial planning and appreciating one’s mother.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/fashion/one-of-a-kind.html', 'snippet': 'Addressing issues on mistaken identities, the death of a pet, financial planning and appreciating one’s mother.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have lived in a New England college town for many years. I am one of a handful of women of color here. I am often mistaken for another of us, a woman who works downtown and is well known, even though I bear no resemblance to her. When people mistake me for her, I explain their error politely, but inside, I am seething. Especially when people continue by telling me how similar we look. My partner thinks I am angry because this other woman is less attractive than I am. What do you say?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'One of a Kind', 'kicker': 'Social Q’s', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One of a Kind', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs, Etiquette and Manners', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T00:50:14+0000', 'document