unty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/nyregion/us-agrees-to-set-new-rules-for-immigration-raids.html', 'snippet': 'The agreement was part of a settlement of a lawsuit accusing the authorities of unlawfully forcing their way into the homes of Latino families on Long Island and in Westchester County.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal authorities have agreed to establish new policies governing the conduct of immigration officers during raids, including restrictions on how and when agents can enter private homes, the source of widespread ire and anxiety among immigrants.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Agrees to New Rules for Immigration Raids', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Agrees to New Rules For Immigration Raids', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Immigration and Customs Enforcement (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York Metropolitan Area', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T02:04:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/664a327d-add2-5b16-9a4a-3f23982c2049', 'word_count': 623, 'uri': 'nyt://article/664a327d-add2-5b16-9a4a-3f23982c2049'}, {'abstract': 'In “6 Souls,” a psychiatrist tries to figure out what’s going on with a patient who has an unusual contingent of multiple personalities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/movies/6-souls-with-julianne-moore-and-jonathan-rhys-meyers.html', 'snippet': 'In “6 Souls,” a psychiatrist tries to figure out what’s going on with a patient who has an unusual contingent of multiple personalities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Originally titled “Shelter,” this supernatural, multiple-personality thriller from Swedish directors Mans Marlind and Bjorn Stein has its own identity crisis. Beginning as a psychiatric freak show, “6 Souls” eventually trades serial-killer intimations for backwoods bad mojo before becoming just another dimly lighted pop-up-stalker flick.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN/05RDP_6SOULS_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/0