de9515cfe'}, {'abstract': 'People often hide constructive criticism inside a compliment, and those on the receiving end never hear it. Is there a better way to provide feedback?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/your-money/how-to-give-effective-feedback-both-positive-and-negative.html', 'snippet': 'People often hide constructive criticism inside a compliment, and those on the receiving end never hear it. Is there a better way to provide feedback?', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOST of us think we know how to give feedback. Positive comments are better — and more useful — than negative ones. And if you do have to point out something wrong, start with a compliment, move on to the problem, then end on a high note.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/business/Shortcuts/Shortcuts-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/06/business/Shortcuts/Shortcuts-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/business/Shortcuts/Shortcuts-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/business/Shortcuts/Shortcuts-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/business/Shortcuts/Shortcuts-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/06/business/Shortcuts/Short