Monte Reel talks about “Between Man and Beast”; Leslie Kaufman has notes from the field; Ada Calhoun discusses Mike Piazza’s memoir; and Gregory Cowles has best-seller news. Sam Tanenhaus is the host.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2013/04/05/books/review/07books_pod.html', 'snippet': 'This week, Monte Reel talks about “Between Man and Beast”; Leslie Kaufman has notes from the field; Ada Calhoun discusses Mike Piazza’s memoir; and Gregory Cowles has best-seller news. Sam Tanenhaus is the host.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, Monte Reel talks about “Between Man and Beast”; Leslie Kaufman has notes from the field; Ada Calhoun discusses Mike Piazza’s memoir; and Gregory Cowles has best-seller news. Sam Tanenhaus is the host.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Book Review Podcast', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T15:50:34+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/2017ad5b-f41f-5db0-a2ff-c6934aae960d', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/2017ad5b-f41f-5db0-a2ff-c6934aae960d'}, {'abstract': 'The married couple will play … a married couple.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/daniel-craig-and-rachel-weisz-to-star-in-pinters-betrayal-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The married couple will play … a married couple.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest burst of Broadway star casting will come from Britain this fall: The actors Daniel Craig (a k a the reigning 007) and Rachel Weisz (an Oscar winner for “The Constant Gardener”), who are married in real life, will play the husband and wife in Harold Pinter’s “Betrayal,” press representatives for the producer Scott Rudin said Friday. The Tony Award winner Mike Nichols will direct.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daniel Craig and Rachel Weisz to Star in Pinter’s ‘Betrayal’ on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaBute, Neil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nichols, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pinter, Harold', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spall, Rafe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weisz, Rachel', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T15:51:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5cba063a-d0d1-5bac-b388-0c23dd8e7150', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5cba063a-d0d1-5bac-b388-0c23dd8e7150'}, {'abstract': 'When two girls in Delaware wanted a ride and Margaret E. Smith, 89, obliged, their journey became a frightening encounter along the way.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/us/this-land-with-an-act-of-kindness-a-lady-vanishes.html', 'snippet': 'When two girls in Delaware wanted a ride and Margaret E. Smith, 89, obliged, their journey became a frightening encounter along the way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LINCOLN, Del. A steel-haired woman, 89 years old and an inch short of five feet, sat on a pillow in the driver’s seat of her Buick LeSabre, just thinking. Parked outside a convenience store on one of the last days of winter, she was considering a pre-Easter treat for herself: an ice cream cone. Butter pecan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Payment for Act of Kindness: 2 Days in Car Trunk at Age 89', 'kicker': 'This Land', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Payment for Act of Kindness: 2 Days in Car Trunk at Age 89', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delaware', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carjacking', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Margaret E', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T15:56:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b07b508c-014a-59bf-9c0b-c8a01bd6aaef', 'word_count': 1245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b07b508c-014a-59bf-9c0b-c8a01bd6aaef'}, {'abstract': 'A selection of cultural events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/arts/april-7-13.html', 'snippet': 'A selection of cultural events.', 'lead_paragraph': ' All Manner Of Guitarists', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/arts/07GUIDE3_SPAN/07GUIDE3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/arts/07GUIDE3_SPAN/07GUIDE3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'c