uter-banks-n-c-san-francisco-dallas/', 'snippet': 'A weekly capsule of events around the world curated by our writers and editors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Flower Parade, Amsterdam This event sounds tame, but don’t let the title fool you. Think large Thanksgiving Day parade floats (above) covered in flowers. The weekend begins with a parade on April 19 in Noordwijk and continues on April 20 with a 15-mile procession to Haarlem, where the floats are illuminated in the evening and remain on view through April 21. In other words, good luck avoiding it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calendar: Coming Events in Amsterdam; Outer Banks, N.C.; San Francisco; Dallas', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T17:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1aa08997-7da7-5659-8ee3-c839f0b152fa', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1aa08997-7da7-5659-8ee3-c839f0b152fa'}, {'abstract': 'For her first designer collaboration, textile designer Emily Kroll has teamed up with Araks Yeramyan to create limited-edition handmade quilts.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/in-stitches/', 'snippet': 'For her first designer collaboration, textile designer Emily Kroll has teamed up with Araks Yeramyan to create limited-edition handmade quilts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For her first designer collaboration, the textile designer Emily Kroll teamed up with the fashion designer Araks Yeramyan to create limited-edition quilts with repurposed materials from the Araks fall/winter 2013 collection. The quilts are an ode to traditional American craftsmanship, each handmade in Sugar Valley, Pa., by Amish artisans piecing together the panels of hunter green neoprene, lavender silk and cobalt blue wool to create a Bauhaus-like canvas that can be mounted on the wall as piece of art or simply draped over the bed for a chic night’s sleep.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Stitches', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quilts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T17:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malina Joseph Gilchrist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malina', 'middlename': 'Joseph', 'lastname': 'Gilchrist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99e68e2a-61de-5cd5-ad6d-5135e213ba67', 'word_count': 99, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99e68e2a-61de-5cd5-ad6d-5135e213ba67'}, {'abstract': 'The Times critic Stephen Holden reviews “The Company You Keep.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000002156896/movie-review-the-company-you-keep.html', 'snippet': 'The Times critic Stephen Holden reviews “The Company You Keep.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times critic Stephen Holden reviews “The Company You Keep.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/video-movies-company-040513/video-movies-company-040513-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/05/arts/video-movies-company-040513/video-movies-company-040513-articleLarge.j