n Wins Approval From Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corzine, Jon S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Freeh, Louis J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giddens, James W', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MF Global', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T17:46:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60d1e610-5d1b-5e30-9e4f-278c25d013b8', 'word_count': 492, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60d1e610-5d1b-5e30-9e4f-278c25d013b8'}, {'abstract': 'Louisville teams doctors decided it was best for Kevin Ware to rest rather than attend a news conference Friday. Ware planned to attend Saturday’s national semifinal against Wichita State and will sit on the team bench.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/ware-takes-a-break-but-will-attend-louisvilles-game/', 'snippet': 'Louisville teams doctors decided it was best for Kevin Ware to rest rather than attend a news conference Friday. Ware planned to attend Saturday’s national semifinal against Wichita State and will sit on the team bench.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — On Friday afternoon, dozens of reporters crowded into Breakout Room No. 1, where Louisville guard Kevin Ware, he of the gruesome leg injury in the N.C.A.A. tournament, was scheduled to speak. A placard with Ware’s name rested on the table. Scribes lined the wall. Cameras crowded together in the back.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ware Takes a Break, But Will Attend Louisville’s Game', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ware, Kevin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Louisville', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T17:49:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Greg Bishop', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Greg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bishop', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d4b842e-4604-5228-886a-86868c5159df', 'word_count': 424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d4b842e-4604-5228-886a-86868c5159df'}, {'abstract': 'The share of Americans with jobs may tell us more about the state of the recovery than the unemployment rate.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/the-employment-rate/', 'snippet': 'The share of Americans with jobs may tell us more about the state of the recovery than the unemployment rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Spare a moment for an overlooked economic indicator: The employment rate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Employment Rate', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T17:49:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organi