gs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/rundown-and-cluttered-a-sacred-space-for-music-prepares-to-move/', 'snippet': 'As the Alan Lomax archive gets ready to leave its home on 41st Street, the archive’s curator says something will be lost in the move: a physical connection to Lomax.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four-fifty West 41st Street, a rundown blue-tiled former warehouse by the Lincoln Tunnel, is the unimpressive sort of city architecture that you walk by without noticing. A shaky elevator ride up to the sixth floor, and the rooms behind the white door hold a trove of bland metal desks overflowing with papers and office plants growing down a shelf of books.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/nyregion/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/05/nyregion/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/nyregion/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/nyregion/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/nyregion/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA/05cityroom-lomax-ss-slide-LOZA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75