aterial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e638a425-8307-51f2-bf0b-610abc14fa31', 'word_count': 440, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e638a425-8307-51f2-bf0b-610abc14fa31'}, {'abstract': 'There’s so much shame and idiocy attached to fashion nowadays, thanks in part to the pulverizing of women on the red carpet, that the attention on looks seems out of proportion to their other, more genuine achievements.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/everybody-loses-in-this-beauty-contest/', 'snippet': 'There’s so much shame and idiocy attached to fashion nowadays, thanks in part to the pulverizing of women on the red carpet, that the attention on looks seems out of proportion to their other, more genuine achievements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY GUESS IS, in the pause following President Obama’s comment “by far the best-looking attorney general in the country” — after he had praised Kamala Harris’s achievements — some guests at the private fund-raiser in California cringed and said to themselves, “Oh, no … he went there.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Everybody Loses in This Beauty Contest', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Everybody Loses in This Beauty Contest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chapur, Maria Belen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Kamala D', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanford, Mark', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T20:08:46+0000', 'document