lation.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/comparing-italian-tv-to-the-truman-show-italian-blogger-calls-for-sweeping-reform/', 'snippet': 'Beppe Grillo, who was barred from Italy’s state television channels for his political comedy, announced plans to press for sweeping reform of the public broadcaster RAI through new legislation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beppe Grillo, the Italian populist who started the insurgent Five Star Movement online after he was barred from state television channels for his political comedy, plans to press for sweeping reform of Italy’s public broadcaster RAI through new legislation. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Comparing Italian TV to ‘The Truman Show,’ Italian Blogger Calls for Sweeping Reform', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grillo, Beppe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Five Star Movement (Italy)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T21:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/841e4cee-e63d-5167-8d62-3ada971c3077', 'word_count': 491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/841e4cee-e63d-5167-8d62-3ada971c3077'}, {'abstract': 'Almost one in 13 American jobs is now in the eating and drinking industry.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/the-fries-with-that-economy/', 'snippet': 'Almost one in 13 American jobs is now in the eating and drinking industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the more striking patterns in the recovery has been the fast clip of low-wage job growth. The best example of this is probably in food services and drinking places, which have been adding jobs for 37 consecutive months. (Employment over all has been growing for 30 consecutive months.) Over that time, eating and drinking places have added 856,200 jobs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Fries-With-That Economy', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T21:01:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1f9fd52-eed6-563f-a8b9-81c593a482cd', 'word_count': 184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1f9fd52-eed6-563f-a8b9-81c593a482cd'}, {'abstract': 'Quinnipiac soccer is auctioning donated jerseys to finance a scholarship fund for a Sandy Hook Elementary School student in memory of Rachel Marie D’Avino.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/donating-their-no-26-jerseys-to-aid-newtown/', 'snippet': 'Quinnipiac soccer is auctioning donated jerseys to finance a scholarship fund for a Sandy Hook Elementary School student in memory of Rachel Marie D’Avino.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HAMDEN, Conn. — Dave Clarke, the women’s soccer coach at Quinnipiac University, was exchanging instant messages with Lauren Carmody Grenier, a f