week as the men’s basketball coach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A report by outside counsel commissioned by Rutgers on how to handle concerns of abusive behavior by Mike Rice, who was fired this week as the men’s basketball coach.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Investigation Report on Mike Rice', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rutgers, The State University of New Jersey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Mike Jr (1969- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T22:28:40+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/5fd5c363-35a2-5cbf-be28-87430067e92e', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/5fd5c363-35a2-5cbf-be28-87430067e92e'}, {'abstract': 'To get his out-of-pocket expenses reimbursed, Carl C. Icahn must agree to refrain from running a proxy fight against Dell’s board or filing a lawsuit against the company, according to a letter sent to him by a special committee of Dell’s board.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/05/dell-offers-to-reimburse-icahn-for-deal-work-with-strings-attached/', 'snippet': 'To get his out-of-pocket expenses reimbursed, Carl C. Icahn must agree to refrain from running a proxy fight against Dell’s board or filing a lawsuit against the company, according to a letter sent to him by a special committee of Dell’s board.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A special committee of Dell‘s board offered on Friday to reimburse Carl C. Icahn up to $25 million worth of expenses tied to a possible bid for the computer company – provided that he plays nicely.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dell Offers to Reimburse Icahn for Deal Work, With Strings Attached', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dell, Michael S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Icahn, Carl C', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dell Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Silver Lake Partners', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'The Blackstone Group', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-05T22:29:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44886c26-57eb-54e7-94d3-bc0e6684a094', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44886c26-57eb-54e7-94d3-bc0e6684a094'}, {'abstract': 'At the 50 West restaurant in Plainville, Conn., the corn bread and jams are homemade, and the aiolis and salad dressings are also concocted in-house.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/nyregion/a-review-of-50-west-restaurant-in-plainville-conn.html', 'snippet': 'At the 50 West restaurant in Plainville, Conn., the corn bread and jams are homemade, and the aiolis and salad dressings are also concocted in-house.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The drab-gray exterior of 50 West does little to attract attention, and compared with the towering pink neon and gleaming chrome facade of a neighboring diner, it appears to be a model of discretion. That sense of subtlety is reinforced by rooms simply decorated with honey oak paneling, washed-mango paint, a few mirrors and glass chandeliers.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07DINECT2/07DINECT2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Scratch, Making Meals Appear', 'kicker': 'Connecticut Dining | Plainville', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Scratch, Making Meals Appear', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None},