ackey is still something of an outsider. His electric guitar had been considered alien to classical music until he began to team it up with string quartets and write concertos for it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/nyregion/steven-mackey-fits-no-label-in-his-music.html', 'snippet': 'Steven Mackey is still something of an outsider. His electric guitar had been considered alien to classical music until he began to team it up with string quartets and write concertos for it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PRINCETON, N.J. — The path to the music room in Steven Mackey’s spacious Princeton home is lined with toys: a phalanx of toddler-size vehicles, a toy kitchen, a Thomas the Tank Engine table crisscrossed with rail tracks. Next to the brightly colored plastic objects, the black grand piano takes on the wryly amused look of a buttoned-up uncle at a birthday party, besieged on all sides by cheerful chaos.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07ARTSNJ1/07ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07ARTSNJ1/07ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07ARTSNJ1/07ARTSNJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07ARTSNJ1/07ARTSNJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1312, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/nyregion/07ARTSN