: 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/0141b534-3853-5793-b687-0364b401de06', 'word_count': 573, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0141b534-3853-5793-b687-0364b401de06'}, {'abstract': 'An agreement to shrink America’s military presence could reduce local tensions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/opinion/progress-on-okinawa.html', 'snippet': 'An agreement to shrink America’s military presence could reduce local tensions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tensions in Okinawa over the American military presence on that island have festered for decades. On Friday, Prime Minister Shinzo Abe of Japan showed political leadership by agreeing with the United States on a timetable for reducing the size of the American force and returning some land used as a military base. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Progress on Okinawa', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Progress on Okinawa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABE, SHINZO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Okinawa and Other Ryukyu Islands (Japan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Bases and Installations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T01:43:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba5de69c-550a-5b3a-8b96-df0207bf41ec', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba5de69c-550a-5b3a-8b96-df0207bf41ec'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, Apr. 6, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-saturday-apr-6-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, Apr. 6, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '"I started crawling. I’d stop for a few minutes, then start crawling again.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, Apr. 6, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T01:48:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9bdf301-735d-521b-92e9-bb8697533743', 'word_count': 39, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9bdf301-735d-521b-92e9-bb8697533743'}, {'abstract': 'Ron Darling, a retired pitcher and a Mets broadcast announcer, wakes early to read the papers and enjoy his alone time before heading to Citi Field on game days.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/nyregion/ron-darling-finds-the-calm-before-the-game.html', 'snippet': 'Ron Darling, a retired pitcher and a Mets broadcast announcer, wakes early to read the papers and enjoy his alone time before heading to Citi Field on game days.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, Ron Darling, the retired starting pitcher for the New York Mets, returned to work as an announcer for his former team on TBS and SportsNet New York. Mr. Darling, 52, is doing commentary at several games a week, including Sunday’s against the Miami Marlins at Citi Field. During the season, Mr. Darling,