-of-public-corruption-unit-led-to-arrests.html', 'snippet': 'More prosecutors focused on political corruption and the use of more aggressive tactics may have helped lead to recent arrests 0f lawmakers accused in bribery cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The two federal cases that mesmerized Albany this week — a state senator accused of trying to bribe his way onto the New York City mayoral ballot and an assemblyman charged with taking payoffs to write made-to-order legislation — come as federal prosecutors in Manhattan have increased their focus on political corruption, officials said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Attorney Added Staff to Fight Corruption', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Attorney Added Staff To Confront Corruption', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Attorneys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bharara, Preet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Malcolm A', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevenson, Eric A', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T02:01:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By William K. Rashbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Rashbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}