s San Francisco, the defending World Series champion, beat St. Louis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/sports/baseball/giants-raise-banner-and-remind-cardinals-how-they-won-it.html', 'snippet': 'Barry Zito continued his dominance, allowing three hits in seven innings as San Francisco, the defending World Series champion, beat St. Louis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — The last time the Giants raised a championship banner, after their 2010 World Series victory, it came on a wave of civic incredulity that such a thing could happen after a 56-year dry spell. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/GIANTS-REFER/GIANTS-REFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/GIANTS-REFER/GIANTS-REFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/GIANTS-REFER/GIANTS-REFER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/GIANTS-REFER/GIANTS-REFER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1338, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/GIANTS-REFER/GIANTS-REFER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/GIANTS-REFER/GIANTS-REFER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit