t depicted Jackson as imperfect but often heroic, a passionate defender of the common man.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert V. Remini, an admired historian best known for his study of Andrew Jackson, including an exhaustive three-volume biography that traced how the seventh president harnessed his populist appeal to wield unusual executive power, died on March 28 in Evanston, Ill. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 901}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1799, 'width': 1198, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/arts/06remini/06remini-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert Remini, Exhaustive Andrew Jackson Biographer, Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robert Remini, 91, Exhaustive Andrew Jackson Biographer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Remini, Robert V', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yardley, William', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Andrew', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T03:08:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/20b615bf-dc26-5955-846e-ed274491f45c', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20b615bf-dc26-5955-846e-ed274491f45c'}, {'abstract': 'Rick Nash’s goal with less than five minutes left in regulation tied the game, but a newly acquired Pittsburgh forward, Jussi Jokinen, scored against the Rangers’ Henrik Lundqvist for the win.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/sports/hockey/jussi-jokinen-and-penguins-beat-rangers-in-shootout.html', 'snippet': 'Rick Nash’s goal with less than five minutes left in regulation tied the game, but a newly acquired Pittsburgh forward, Jussi Jokinen, scored against the Rangers’ Henrik Lundqvist for the win.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSBURGH — The game had a playoff feel to it, fast and desperate, hard-hitting and angry, with accusations flying afterward like pucks and errant elbows. The Penguins won, 2-1, in a shootout, but the Rangers were encouraged by a tenacious performance that earned them a precious point in the standings.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_pa