runs in the seventh inning against the Mets, who remain in a rebuilding mode.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/sports/baseball/marlins-beat-mets-in-meeting-of-rebuilding-teams.html', 'snippet': 'The Marlins, void of high-priced players, earned their first victory of the season, scoring five runs in the seventh inning against the Mets, who remain in a rebuilding mode.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year ago, when the Mets and the Marlins first faced each other at Citi Field, the question entering the series was how fans would receive shortstop Jose Reyes, who had left New York to sign a big free-agent contract with Miami in the off-season. Would they cheer? Would they boo?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/mets/mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/mets/mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/mets/mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/mets/mets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/06/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None