os. But buying an index-tracking E.T.F. doesn’t guarantee the same return as the index.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/business/mutfund/exchange-traded-funds-tracking-error-is-often-overlooked.html', 'snippet': 'E.T.F.’s are popular for their low fees and their usefulness in building diversified portfolios. But buying an index-tracking E.T.F. doesn’t guarantee the same return as the index.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EXCHANGE-TRADED funds that track indexes may sound like straightforward investments. Because they tend to have low fees and can be used to build diversified portfolios, as well as for esoteric strategies, E.T.F.’s are wildly popular among individual and institutional investors alike. But even when E.T.F.’s appear simple, there may be more risk than meets the eye.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Exchange-Traded Funds, a Variable Worth Watching', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Exchange-Traded Funds, a Variable Worth Watching', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exchange Traded Funds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BlackRock Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vanguard Group Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Street Global Advisors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T15:41:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Mutual Funds', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna Bernasek', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernasek', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/993291ff-457