 increasing prescriptions of psychoactive drugs for soldiers in combat at an alarming rate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/opinion/sunday/wars-on-drugs.html', 'snippet': 'The military has been increasing prescriptions of psychoactive drugs for soldiers in combat at an alarming rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAST year, more active-duty soldiers committed suicide than died in battle. This fact has been reported so often that it has almost lost its jolting force. Almost. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Friedman-Richard-circular/Friedman-Richard-circular-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Friedman-Richard-circular/Friedman-Richard-circular-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Friedman-Richard-circular/Friedman-Richard-circular-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Friedman-Richard-circular/Friedman-Richard-circular-superJumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Friedman-Richard-circular/Friedman-Richard-circular-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Friedman-Richard-circular/Friedman-Richard-circular-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu