07/opinion/sunday/trading-in-the-dark.html', 'snippet': 'There are good reasons to be wary of the stock market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stocks dropped on Friday, after the dismal employment report for March forced investors to rethink the recent rally. Stock prices have been driven up by easy money from the Federal Reserve, but the jobs picture indicates that little of the Fed’s largess has made its way to Main Street, where unemployment remains high.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trading in the Dark', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trading in the Dark', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Financial Industry Regulatory Authority', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T17:41:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f4314be-c4f5-5856-8629-991c132aac99', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f4314be-c4f5-5856-8629-991c132aac99'}, {'abstract': 'Saddam Hussein’s fall put the entire Arab authoritarian system under scrutiny.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/opinion/sunday/the-arab-spring-started-in-iraq.html', 'snippet': 'Saddam Hussein’s fall put the entire Arab authoritarian system under scrutiny.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAMBRIDGE, Mass.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New Yor