e delay in filling federal judicial vacancies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The number of vacancies on the nation’s federal courts has reached an astonishingly high level, creating a serious shortage of judges and undermining the ability of the nation’s court system to bestow justice.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Courts Without Judges', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Courts Without Judges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Courts (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Halligan, Caitlin Joan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Srinivasan, Sri', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-06T17:45:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/977171a6-27ff-57c9-9db4-be893fe1ab58', 'word_count': 626, 'uri': 'nyt://article/977171a6-27ff-57c9-9db4-be893fe1ab58'}, {'abstract': 'Democrats feel the inevitable, inexorable, inescapable pull of the Clintons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/opinion/sunday/dowd-can-we-get-hillary-without-the-foolery.html', 'snippet': 'Democrats feel the inevitable, inexorable, inescapable pull of the Clintons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PLEASE don’t ask me this anymore.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im