uld change after the busiest off-season in franchise history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/sports/baseball/blue-jays-have-task-of-keeping-fans-who-returned.html', 'snippet': 'Over the past 20 years, stars have drifted through Toronto, but none managed to carry the team into October. That could change after the busiest off-season in franchise history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Among the Blue Jays fans expressing caution about the extraordinary buildup of hope and hype for the 2013 season, there was Joe Carter, the smiling symbol of the franchise’s glory days, doling out restraint.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/sub-dog-JAYS/sub-dog-JAYS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/sub-dog-JAYS/sub-dog-JAYS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/sub-dog-JAYS/sub-dog-JAYS-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/sub-dog-JAYS/sub-dog-JAYS-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/sub-dog-JAYS/sub-dog-JAYS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/sub-dog-JAYS/sub-dog-JAYS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 's