 again drawn attention to racers’ well-being.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MARTINSVILLE, Va. — Denny Hamlin stood atop his hauler at Martinsville Speedway on Friday and watched as Mark Martin wheeled the No. 11 Toyota around the track during Sprint Cup practice. That was Hamlin’s racecar, the number he drove for 264 consecutive Cup races since late 2005. His streak will not reach 265.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 290, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 290}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 494, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 988, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/dog-yNASCAR/dog-yNASCAR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main