pel Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Oppel', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4c66211-bef2-54ff-8067-a6f541ae7e03', 'word_count': 1231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4c66211-bef2-54ff-8067-a6f541ae7e03'}, {'abstract': 'The goal scored Saturday by Aston Villa’s Matthew Lowton could be worth about $40 million to Aston Villa if it helps them avoid relegation from the Premier League.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/06/was-this-aston-villa-goal-worth-50-million/', 'snippet': 'The goal scored Saturday by Aston Villa’s Matthew Lowton could be worth about $40 million to Aston Villa if it helps them avoid relegation from the Premier League.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, Deloitte’s Alan Switzer, writing in The Telegraph, pegged the first-year cost of relegation from the Premier League at £25 million (about $38 million), a figure that has almost certainly risen — doubled even? — since he calculated it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Was This Aston Villa Goal Worth $50 Million?', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aston Villa (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-07T02:04:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7bd7494b-8ea3-5539-9df2-304b43d95cf0', 'word_count': 350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7bd7494b-8ea3-5539-9df2-304b43d95cf0'}, {'abstract': 'Henrik Lundqvist had a season-high 48 saves and the Rangers picked up their third win in four games as they battle the Islanders in Devils for the final two spots in the Eastern Conference playoff race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/sports/hockey/henrik-lundqvist-has-48-saves-in-rangers-win-over-carolina.html', 'snippet': 'Henrik Lundqvist had a season-high 48 saves and the Rangers picked up their third win in four games as they battle the Islanders in Devils for the final two spots in the Eastern Conference playoff race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RALEIGH, N.C. — If the Rangers needed a breather after back-to-back games against Eastern Conference-leading Pittsburgh and before two critical meetings with Toronto this week, the schedule offered this kindness on Saturday night: a trip to Carolina. The fading Hurricanes had lost 10 of their last 11 games and had to play without the injured Alexander Semin, their second-leading scorer.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/hockey/07rangers1-img/07rangers1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/hockey/07rangers1-img/07rangers1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/hockey/07rangers1-img/07rangers1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/hockey/07rangers1-img/07rangers1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'hei