ly Circle Cup semifinal that lasted 54 minutes. Serena has won 14 of their 24 meetings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/sports/tennis/serena-williams-routs-venus-in-family-circle-semifinal.html', 'snippet': 'Serena Williams defeated her older sister Venus, 6-1, 6-2, in a Family Circle Cup semifinal that lasted 54 minutes. Serena has won 14 of their 24 meetings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DANIEL ISLAND, S.C. — The first match between Venus and Serena Williams in nearly four years drew the largest crowd in the Family Circle Cup’s history, with 9,538 fans on hand Saturday to watch Serena defeat her older sister, 6-1, 6-2, in a semifinal that lasted just 54 minutes.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/serena/serena-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/serena/serena-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/serena/serena-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/serena/serena-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1455, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/serena/serena-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/serena/serena-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg