ip Erdogan of Turkey to move ahead with his commitment to normalize relations with Israel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kerry Moves to Help Turkey and Israel to Restore Ties', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erdogan, Recep Tayyip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davutoglu, Ahmet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-07T02:46:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael R. Gordon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Gordon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/334be13d-a363-5565-b93e-988eb38d051c', 'word_count': 377, 'uri': 'nyt://article/334be13d-a363-5565-b93e-988eb38d051c'}, {'abstract': 'Kevin Ware Sr. still hasn’t seen the injury that knocked his son out of the Final Four, but he made sure he was by his side when Louisville beat Wichita State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/sports/ncaabasketball/louisville-games-have-been-tough-to-watch-for-kevin-ware-and-his-family.html', 'snippet': 'Kevin Ware Sr. still hasn’t seen the injury that knocked his son out of the Final Four, but he made sure he was by his side when Louisville beat Wichita State.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — Passengers on the express bus from Throgs Neck in the Bronx to East 23rd Street in Manhattan last Monday morning might have wondered why their driver was wearing sunglasses on a cloudy day. Kevin Ware Sr., the father of Louisville’s famously injured guard, said he had no choice.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 805}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 764, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1527, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/07/sports/ware/ware-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Wares, Games Have Been Tough to Watch', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Wares, It’s Been Tough to Watch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'ra