.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/its-o-k-to-put-yourself-first/', 'snippet': 'After two years of Lyme disease, I realized that I needed to take care of myself before I took care of others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After I found out I had neurological Lyme disease, I spent two painful years attempting to recover. Since there was no end in sight, I thought a lot about how I’d change things if I ever got my life back. I considered how I would spend my energy if I were ever granted any. When I finally climbed out of bed, I decided that to the greatest extent possible, I would quit doing the things I didn’t like to do and do the things I did like to do.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s O.K. to Put Yourself First', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-07T13:01:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glennon Melton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glennon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Melton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f0f2213-a33b-5e95-a223-7d4d0ff54332', 'word_count': 776, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f0f2213-a33b-5e95-a223-7d4d0ff54332'}, {'abstract': 'Attacker blamed influence of cannabis in part for killing, police said', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/07/dutch-man-confesses-to-killing-british-woman-in-kashmir-police-say/', 'snippet': 'Attacker blamed influence of cannabis in part for killing, police said', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Dutch man, Richard De Wit, confessed to stabbing to death a British woman in a houseboat on Dal Lake in Kashmir, the police said Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': '