cbcfc9f060'}, {'abstract': 'Carl Richards discusses why we should focus on the aspects of our financial lives that we can control.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/08/feeling-overwhelmed-take-a-deep-breath/', 'snippet': 'Carl Richards discusses why we should focus on the aspects of our financial lives that we can control.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carl Richards is a certified financial planner in Park City, Utah, and is the director of investor education at The BAM Alliance. His book, “The Behavior Gap,” was published this year. His sketches are archived\xa0on the Bucks blog.I love the sensation that comes when things feel under control. In fact, a sense of control may just be the antidote to fear. It is also one of the reasons dealing with money can be so scary. It often feels like there is very little that we can control.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling Overwhelmed? Take a Deep Breath', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-08T14:52:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Richards', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richards', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b962321d-8e41-5ac0-810a-22831c680f57', 'word_count': 907, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b962321d-8e41-5ac0-810a-22831c680f57'}, {'abstract': 'Building Blocks: Dozens of interactive kiosks are to be installed in 16 subway stations in the next few months, designed to help commuters navigate the system.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/08/new-screens-in-the-subway-will-guide-riders-and-sell-to-them-too/', 'snippet': 'Building Blocks: Dozens of interactive kiosks are to be installed in 16 subway st