 will be brought under Universal’s umbrella, moving from Sony Music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Days after it was revealed that Jay-Z’s entertainment company, Roc Nation, is getting into the sports agency business, the company has announced a worldwide deal with the Universal Music Group for its record releases.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 857}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 718, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1435, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/jay-z-media/jay-z-media-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jay-Z’s Entertainment Company Makes Music Deal With Universal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker'