al Bank, schools, shops and office buildings. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Footage of Bomb Blast in Damascus', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Damascus (Syria)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lebanon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-08T18:25:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b298d324-00c7-587f-b916-33d91d7b8a3d', 'word_count': 140, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b298d324-00c7-587f-b916-33d91d7b8a3d'}, {'abstract': 'A musical background can enhance the ability to learn a second language. Now scientists have found that knowing a tonal language may prime the brain for musical training.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/08/really-musical-training-and-language-skills-enhance-one-another/', 'snippet': 'A musical background can enhance the ability to learn a second language. Now scientists have found that knowing a tonal language may prime the brain for musical training.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE FACTS', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/12/21/health/21really/21really-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 529, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop