 government in the economy makes that information particularly valuable to investors. And that can lead some to get a jump on the market if they learn about changes in policy before others.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Fine Line Between Political Intelligence and Insider Trading', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insider Trading', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Government Accountability Office', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-08T18:45:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter J. Henning', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Henning', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fdc6333b-ea9d-57f9-bdb3-59eb30feaefa', 'word_count': 1048, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fdc6333b-ea9d-57f9-bdb3-59eb30feaefa'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Funicello, an original Mouseketeer who later described herself as “the queen of teen,” died on Monday in Bakersfield, Calif. She was 70.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/04/08/arts/artsspecial/20130408FUNICELLO_obit.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Funicello, an original Mouseketeer who later described herself as “the queen of teen,” died on Monday in Bakersfield, Calif. She was 70.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ms. Funi