-f61f-5597-b0e2-0e882c7c2992'}, {'abstract': 'Weight concerns airlines, mainly those with small planes like Samoa Air, which is charging fares based on a passenger’s weight. Other airlines are cutting weight, too, which saves on fuel costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/business/airlines-weigh-costs-and-passenger-pounds-on-the-road.html', 'snippet': 'Weight concerns airlines, mainly those with small planes like Samoa Air, which is charging fares based on a passenger’s weight. Other airlines are cutting weight, too, which saves on fuel costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Probably because I’ve been at this for 14 years, people assume I have ready answers for many often-asked air travel questions, starting with, “How can I always find the lowest fare?” To this I reply reluctantly, “I have absolutely no idea.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/Road/Road-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 509, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/Road/Road-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 509, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/Road/Road-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/09/business/Road/Road-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/business/Road/Road-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'hea