e738a8-cc6b-51c4-922a-11aa3e4e3545', 'word_count': 505, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38e738a8-cc6b-51c4-922a-11aa3e4e3545'}, {'abstract': 'A United States diplomat has written to a French auction house on behalf of the Hopi Indians and requested that it postpone an auction of Hopi artifacts that is set to happen Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/08/u-s-diplomat-asks-auction-house-to-delay-sale-of-hopi-items/', 'snippet': 'A United States diplomat has written to a French auction house on behalf of the Hopi Indians and requested that it postpone an auction of Hopi artifacts that is set to happen Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States Embassy in Paris has asked a French auction house to consider postponing its Friday sale of Hopi artifacts and let tribal leaders examine them to assess their origins and authenticity.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Diplomat Asks Auction House to Delay Sale of Hopi Items', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Embassy Discourages Sale of Hopi Ritual Items', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hopi Indians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Neret-Minet Tessier & Sarrou', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-08T21:51:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Mashberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e60d1e07-069e-5706-98c7-7495e73721c6', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e60d1e07-069e-5706-98c7-7495e73721c6'}, {'abstract': 'Centennial attention on Danny Kaye has included a new biography and an exhibition in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/arts/television/danny-kaye-so-20th-century-has-his-moments.html', 'snippet': 'Centennial attention on Danny Kaye has included a new biography and an exhibition in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To people over a certain age it no doubt seems incredible that people under a certain age have to be told who Danny Kaye was. In the middle of the last century Kaye was one of the country’s biggest stars, working his nimble, quick-tongued brand of comedy into a career that bridged eras and genres: radio, stage, film, records, television. For decades you would have to have lived in a cave to not know his work.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09KAYE1/09KAYE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09KAYE1/09KAYE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 840}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09KAYE1/09KAYE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09KAYE1/09KAYE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1464, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09KAYE1/09KAYE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09KAYE1/09KAYE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'