ds in the time of McCarthyism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/theater/reviews/finks-at-the-ensemble-studio-theater.html', 'snippet': 'In “Finks,” Joe Gilford’s new play, young people must choose whether to protect their careers or their friends in the time of McCarthyism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is only one female character in “Finks,” a bracing play about McCarthyism by Joe Gilford, but it’s the kind of role actresses live for, and Miriam Silverman is giving it an attention-getting turn at the Ensemble Studio Theater. The play works subject matter that has already been pretty thoroughly mined, but this brisk, muscular production — based on the lives of the playwright’s parents — quickly leaves you not caring that you’ve visited the territory before. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09FINKSjp/09FINKSjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09FINKSjp/09FINKSjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09FINKSjp/09FINKSjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09FINKSjp/09FINKSjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/09FINKSjp/09FINKSjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/09/ar