 appeals court to stream programming it gets free from broadcasters. Fox and other broadcasters are pondering their next move.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Executives in charge of Fox and Univision raised the prospect Monday of one day moving their programming off the broadcast airwaves and exclusively onto cable in a stepped-up response to Aereo, a streaming TV service.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Networks Hint at Leaving the Airwaves ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Networks Hint at Leaving the Airwaves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aereo Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stelter, Brian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Univision', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-08T23:54:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4a6324e-f5e7-5e90-b296-d7e09b334870', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4a6324e-f5e7-5e90-b296-d7e09b334870'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Schmeck covered medical research for The New York Times, where he worked for more than 30 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/business/media/harold-m-schmeck-89-times-science-writer-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Schmeck covered medical research for The New York Times, where he worked for more than 30 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Harold M. Schmeck Jr., a science writer for The New York Times for more than 30 years who specialized in covering medical research, from the space age to the era of genetic medicine, died on April 1 in Hyannis, Mass. He was 89.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Harold M. Schmeck, 89, Times Science Writer, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Harold M. Schmeck Jr., 89, Times Science Writer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmeck, Harold M Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yardley, William', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-08T23:59:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/44f150eb-e875-5999-9b18-0d2b4080afaf', 'word_count': 421, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44f150eb-e875-5999-9b18-0d2b4080afaf'}, {'abstract': 'As he continued his trip to the Middle East, Secretary of State John Kerry met with the Palestinian prime minister and Israeli president and prime minister.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/world/kerry-to-focus-on-palestinian-economy-as-part-of-peace-process.html', 'snippet': 'As he continued his trip to the Middle East, Secretary of State John Kerry met with the Palestinian prime minister and