ry to get smokers to quit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is limited value in telling smokers that their deadly habit may kill them. They already know that, yet most ignore the warnings. But showing smokers gruesome images of people who have been maimed or disfigured by tobacco seems to have a much bigger effect. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gruesome Ads That Work', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gruesome Ads That Work', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T01:03:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1e415ef-fbf8-5841-8c80-7d3285dec5c9', 'word_count': 260, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1e415ef-fbf8-5841-8c80-7d3285dec5c9'}, {'abstract': 'On the island of Cyprus, the filmmaker Iva Radivojevic explores how the economic crisis has contributed to a rise in hostility toward immigrants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/opinion/100000002161439/hail-hail-freedom-in-cyprus.html', 'snippet': 'On the island of Cyprus, the filmmaker Iva Radivojevic explores how the economic crisis has contributed to a rise in hostility toward immigrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the island of Cyprus, the filmmaker Iva Radivojevic explores how the economic crisis has contributed to a rise in hostility toward immigrants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xla