daa0'}, {'abstract': 'A dozen trains, perhaps more, may have passed over the spot where the body of Emily Singleton, 22, lay in a deep trough at the end of the Canal Street station on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/nyregion/body-on-subway-tracks-unnoticed-for-hours.html', 'snippet': 'A dozen trains, perhaps more, may have passed over the spot where the body of Emily Singleton, 22, lay in a deep trough at the end of the Canal Street station on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'She entered the subway system sometime around 1 a.m. on Sunday, dressed in dark clothes and dark boots as if coming from a night on the town. By the afternoon, her lifeless body lay among the soot-darkened track ties and trash under Canal Street.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Woman’s Corpse Lay Hidden for Hours on Tracks at Subway Station', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Woman’s Corpse Lay Hidden for Hours on Tracks at Subway Station', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subways', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canal Street (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroad Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T01:48:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt