nces of a hung jury,” and added, “We are at risk.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The jury considering murder charges against David Tarloff, a schizophrenic man accused of killing a psychologist in her Upper East Side office five years ago, sent a note to the judge Monday afternoon suggesting they might not be able to reach a verdict. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jurors Hint at Deadlock Over Killing of Therapist', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' Jurors Hint At Deadlock Over Killing Of Therapist ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tarloff, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Faughey, Kathryn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLaughlin, Edward J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T02:16:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Russ Buettner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Russ', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buettner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38df96f9-12d6-53e8-9696-3b4345f0bd7e', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38df96f9-12d6-53e8-9696-3b4345f0bd7e'}, {'abstract': 'The current N.C.A.A. president, Mark Emmert, has faced increasing criticism and scrutiny on a variety of fronts, but part of the problem is that the job has become too large for one person.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/sports/ncaabasketball/ncaa-needs-restructured-leadership.html', 'snippet': 'The current N.C.A.A. president, Mark Emmert, has faced increasing criticism and scrutiny on a var