cognition of the world’s history and a healthy appreciation of irony.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/arts/design/ed-fisher-new-yorker-cartoonist-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Fisher created cartoons that managed to be erudite without being pretentious, requiring a general recognition of the world’s history and a healthy appreciation of irony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ed Fisher, whose culturally savvy cartoons, featured in The New Yorker for nearly 50 years, made wry sport of modern life, frequently matching images from history or folklore with captions in an up-to-date mode, died on April 3 in Canaan, Conn. He was 86.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/design/FISHER1-obit/FISHER1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 547, 'width': 448, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/design/FISHER1-obit/FISHER1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 547, 'width': 448, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/design/FISHER1-obit/FISHER1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/design/FISHER1-obit/FISHER1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/design/FISHER1-obit/FISHER1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ed Fisher, New Yorker Cartoonist, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content