in the midst of a mixed-use redevelopment plan that attempts to ease the highway’s effects.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/realestate/saugatuck-conn-what-i-95-hasnt-put-asunder.html', 'snippet': 'A waterfront slice of Westport bisected by I-95 is in the midst of a mixed-use redevelopment plan that attempts to ease the highway’s effects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Drivers in general may be reduced to cursing — silently or otherwise — as they inch along Interstate 95 in parts of Connecticut during rush hour. But for many of the 2,500 or so residents of Saugatuck, a waterside slice of Westport 48 miles from Manhattan, the dislike is almost personal.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/14/realestate/14LIVING_SPAN/14LIVING_SPAN-thumbSta