/e03072fe-fcf3-5326-8b04-52f39317b96e', 'word_count': 786, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e03072fe-fcf3-5326-8b04-52f39317b96e'}, {'abstract': 'In her memoir, Monica Wesolowska explores how to parent a child who is caught up in our complex system of modern medical death.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/holding-silvan-letting-go-of-a-life-and-an-ideal-about-death/', 'snippet': 'In her memoir, Monica Wesolowska explores how to parent a child who is caught up in our complex system of modern medical death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After Monica Wesolowska gave birth to her first child, a healthy-seeming boy, things took a fast and grim turn: her son, Silvan, was taken from her arms for “observation,” rushed unexpectedly through hospital hallways and ultimately given the worst possible prognosis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': "‘Holding Silvan': Letting Go of a Life and an Ideal About Death", 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T19:29:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1dc39d02-d079-5b2f-8dda-a5c6351a8767', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1dc39d02-d079-5b2f-8dda-a5c6351a8767'}, {'abstract': 'Mizrahi’s extravagant board adds authenticity to the graphic hoodies and slip-ons favored by the fashion set.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/feeling-for-gelareh-mizrahis-skateboards/', 'snippet': 'Mizrahi’s extravagant board adds authenticity to the graphic hoodies and slip-ons favored by the fashion set.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s no secret that the fashion crowd has a certain affinity for skate style. The designer Gelareh Mizrahi is no exception; she’s tricked out her skateboards with python skin. Mizrahi’s extravagant board isn’t for every day, but it does add a little authenticity to the graphic Kenzo hoodies and Celine slip-ons favored by the fashion set.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling For | Gelareh Mizrahi’s Skateboards', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Feeling For: The Ride or Die Skateboard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skateboarding', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T19:30:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/164313ff-788e-5dad-8244-b7ac2735c1fb', 'word_count': 63, 'uri': 'nyt://article/164313ff-788e-5dad-8244-b7ac2735c1fb'}, {'abstract': 'If Gov. Bobby Jindal of Louisiana remains unpopular in his home state, how much does it hurt his chances of winning the 2016 Republican presidential nomination?', 'web_url': 'https://fivethirtyeight.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/with-popularity-fading-at-home-is-jindal-the-new-romney/', 'snippet': 'If Gov. Bobby Jindal of Louisiana remains unpopular in his home state, how much does it hurt his chances of winning the 2016 Republican presidential nomination?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Monday’s article on the nation’s least popular governors did not include Gov. Bobby Jindal of Louisiana, because he is not up for re-election in 2014. (Louisiana’s next gubernatorial election will be in 2015, and Mr. Jindal will not be eligible, having served two consecutive terms.) But recent surveys suggest that Mr. Jindal has become very unpopular in his home state amid a series of battles on fiscal policy. A March poll from Southern Media & Opinion Research put Mr. Jindal’s approval rating at just 38 percent, against 60 percent disapproval. His numbers had been similarly poor in a February survey by Public Policy Polling.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Popularity Fading at Home, Is Jindal the New Romney?', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jindal, Bobby', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T19:41:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fca3d304-d4a9-5155-9d98-31ac8d323ae7', 'word_count': 987, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fca3d304-d4a9-5155-9d98-31ac8d323ae7'}, {'abstract': 'As the European competition chief appears