the time had come for the South to build its own nuclear weapons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/world/asia/in-us-south-korean-makes-case-for-nuclear-arms.html', 'snippet': 'A prominent member of South Korea’s Parliament told an international conference in Washington that the time had come for the South to build its own nuclear weapons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON – On a day when North Korea warned expatriates in the South to evacuate because the country was on the brink of nuclear war – a statement the American Embassy in Seoul dismissed as hyperbole – a prominent member of South Korea’s Parliament argued in Washington on Tuesday that the time had come for the South to build its own nuclear weapons.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In U.S., South Korean Makes Case for Nuclear Arms', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T20:56:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By David E. Sanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Sanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e36681c-5016-5ce4-af0e-f3424d04c2a0', 'word_count': 593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e36681c-5016-5ce4-af0e-f3424d04c2a0'}, {'abstract': 'Here’s what happens when a scientist goes through the Washington version of social niceties.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/09/a-scientist-and-a-comedian-walk-into-a-confirmation-hearing/', 'snippet': 'Here’s wh