t cuts known as sequestration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Chef Told to Plan Some Time Off', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kass, Sam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-09T23:11:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jada F. Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jada', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b023894-aff5-5677-82e2-4ba7040d158a', 'word_count': 205, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b023894-aff5-5677-82e2-4ba7040d158a'}, {'abstract': 'Ilya Kovalchuk practiced with the Devils for the first time since he injured his right shoulder on March 23, offering a ray of hope for a team that has dropped seven games in a row.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/sports/hockey/devils-ilya-kovalchuk-practices-but-still-unclear-on-return.html', 'snippet': 'Ilya Kovalchuk practiced with the Devils for the first time since he injured his right shoulder on March 23, offering a ray of hope for a team that has dropped seven games in a row.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — Ilya Kovalchuk practiced with the Devils for the first time since he injured his right shoulder on March 23, offering a ray of hope for a skidding team working to stay optimistic.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kovalchuk, Return Still Unclear, Practices With the Reeling Devils', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'K