ed to raise $300,000 to get the franchise off the ground.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Using Retirement Money to Start a Business', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Individual Retirement Accounts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T11:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Patrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patrick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54d1a047-e0aa-5076-963a-0ad123606641', 'word_count': 807, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54d1a047-e0aa-5076-963a-0ad123606641'}, {'abstract': 'George E. Logue Sr. collected scores of tractors and bulldozers over the years. Now that he has passed away, his collection is up for grabs.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/antique-tractor-sale-will-be-crawling-with-caterpillars/', 'snippet': 'George E. Logue Sr. collected scores of tractors and bulldozers over the years. Now that he has passed away, his collection is up for grabs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A collection of nearly 100 antique tractors, mostly of the bright-yellow Caterpillar variety, will be auctioned at 10 a.m. Wednesday in Trout Run, Pa.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline':