 Robert Schimmel, who died in 2010, David Steinberg and his “Inside Comedy” colleagues debated how best to present it – or whether to show it at all.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/how-robert-schimmel-got-the-last-word-on-showtimes-inside-comedy/', 'snippet': 'After recording an interview with the stand-up comic Robert Schimmel, who died in 2010, David Steinberg and his “Inside Comedy” colleagues debated how best to present it – or whether to show it at all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As David Steinberg remembers it, his interview with Robert Schimmel was a hilarious reflection on an often tragic life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/schimmel1/schimmel1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/schimmel1/schimmel1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/schimmel1/schimmel1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/schimmel1/schimmel1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/schimmel1/schimmel1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/09/arts/schimmel1/schimmel1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images