abstract': 'Live updates on the gun debate.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/live-updates-on-the-gun-debate-2/', 'snippet': 'Live updates on the gun debate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two senators announce a bipartisan compromise on background checks. Michelle Obama wades into the gun debate. Newtown families urge Republican senators to vote instead of filibuster.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Updates on the Gun Debate | April 10, 2013', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Rifle Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T14:12:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38b6be51-ee9b-57dc-ad5e-6c7029b4e4df', 'word_count': 2150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38b6be51-ee9b-57dc-ad5e-6c7029b4e4df'}, {'abstract': 'In an interview with the Russian newspaper, “Kommersant,” Ms. Osipova gave the same reason for her move from the Mikhailovsky to the Royal as she did for her move from the Bolshoi to the Mikhailovsky: Repertoire.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/russian-ballerina-natalia-osipova-joins-londons-royal-ballet/', 'snippet': 'In an interview with the Russian newspaper, “Kommersant,” Ms. Osipova gave the same reason for her move from the Mikhailovsky to the Royal as she did for her move from the Bolshoi to the Mikhailovsky: Repertoire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — It was only 18 months ago that the Russian ballerina Natalia Osipova shocked the dance world by leaving the Bolshoi Ballet, where she was considered a major star, to join the lesser-known Mikhailovsky Ballet in St. Petersburg. But on Monday, the Royal Opera House announced that Ms. Osipova would join the Royal Ballet as a principal dancer for the 2013-14 season. The announcement came hot on the heels of Ms. Osipova’s wholesale conquest of this city during the Mikhailovsky’s recent two-week engagement here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russian Ballerina Natalia Osipova Joins London’s Royal Ballet', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Osipova, Natalia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BALLET THEATER', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Ballet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T14:13:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/407588ed-47af-5e14-b229-f5313fdfe817', 'word_count': 462, 'uri': 'nyt://article/407588ed-47af-5e14-b229-f5313fdfe817'}, {'abstract': 'With the airlines hoping to combine later this year, here’s a look at what it could mean for everything from miles and upgrades to seats and routes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/travel/if-american-airlines-and-us-airways-merge-what-should-fliers-expect.html', 'snippet': 'With the airlines hoping to combine later this year, here’s a look at what it could mean for everything from miles and upgrades to seats and routes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American Airlines is on its way to becoming the biggest airline in the world after winning bankruptcy-court approval to merge with US Airways. Maybe you don’t fly those airlines often, but here’s why you should care: the consolidation of two major carriers might affect how seamlessly you can fly. It might affect what you pay. It might even affect your miles strategy.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1614, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/travel/14GETAWAY_SPAN/14GETAWAY_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg'