: 'Robert G. Edwards Dies at 87; Changed Rules of Conception With First ‘Test Tube Baby’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Changing Rules of Conception With the First ‘Test Tube Baby’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kolata, Gina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Edwards, Robert G', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'In Vitro Fertilization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nobel Prizes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cambridge University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T16:21:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gina Kolata', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kolata', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/12c59f5b-042d-554d-9d4e-4896dde3f5b7', 'word_count': 1659, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12c59f5b-042d-554d-9d4e-4896dde3f5b7'}, {'abstract': 'Julia Moskin’s notes on the recipes for this month’s Recipe Lab. Make the dishes and share your notes here.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/notes-on-deborah-madisons-onion-tart-and-asparagus-salad/', 'snippet': 'Julia Moskin’s notes on the recipes for this month’s Recipe Lab. Make the dishes and share your notes here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This month’s book for Recipe Lab is “Vegetable Literacy” by Deborah Madison, and our live chat is coming up this Tuesday at 3:30 p.m. Eastern. This will be your chance to ask her everything and anything about vegetable cookery, or about the recipes I hope you’re planning to try out before then. (You can find the recipes here; you can see how they come tog