title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d78ee54f-da5d-5a39-acc1-13780fdbaf9b', 'word_count': 629, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d78ee54f-da5d-5a39-acc1-13780fdbaf9b'}, {'abstract': 'One of the educational potentials of computing is the ability to tailor learning experiences to the skills of individual students. A vocabulary-building site, Vocabulary.com, is an example of that potential, some educators say.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/a-vocabulary-site-shows-how-to-tailor-online-education/', 'snippet': 'One of the educational potentials of computing is the ability to tailor learning experiences to the skills of individual students. A vocabulary-building site, Vocabulary.com, is an example of that potential, some educators say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The recent excitement about online learning has mostly been focused on the power of technology to distribute and democratize education. At the forefront has been the rise of massive open online courses, or MOOCs, which have been magnets for attention and investment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-vocabulary/10bits-vocabulary-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 287, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-vocabulary/10bits-vocabulary-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 287}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-vocabulary/10bits-vocabulary-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 797, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-vocabulary/10bits-vo