'nyt://article/a750880e-3450-5808-81f8-645605055bc8'}, {'abstract': 'An interview with Colonel Ted Spain, who was deployed to Iraq as the commander of the 18th Military Police Brigade.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/10-mistakes-of-the-iraq-war/', 'snippet': 'An interview with Colonel Ted Spain, who was deployed to Iraq as the commander of the 18th Military Police Brigade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2003, Col. Ted Spain was deployed to Iraq as the commander of the 18th Military Police Brigade. His task was to rebuild the Iraqi police force, establish a detention system and forge a new model for law and order in the country. But on the ground, he says, this task was made impossible by a lack of manpower, limited resources and the rising animosity of the Iraqi people. When he retired in 2004, the military police were still struggling to put these systems in place, and law and order seemed a distant goal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '10 Mistakes of the Iraq War', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bremer, L Paul III', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerik, Bernard B', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rumsfeld, Donald H', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Ricardo S', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ABU GHRAIB (IRAQ)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T17:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hann