nd the Web.April means the arrival of a new baseball season. More than a few intellectuals have described the game in quasi-religious terms, crediting baseball with the capacity to add meaning and texture to life. A recent book by the embattled N.Y.U. president John Sexton even makes an explicit case for “Baseball as a Road to God.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Cubs Explain the Cosmos', 'kicker': 'The Stone', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philosophy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T17:59:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.c. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb11f986-9b5d-5c11-bdd1-1834fda55600', 'word_count': 544, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb11f986-9b5d-5c11-bdd1-1834fda55600'}, {'abstract': 'The organizers of the Tribeca Film Festival announced the jurors who would choose the winners in its seven competitive categories, calling them, with some understatement, “a diverse group of 41 industry leaders.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/jury-lineups-announced-for-tribeca-film-festival/', 'snippet': 'The organizers of the Tribeca Film Festival announced the jurors who would choose the winners in its seven competitive categories, calling them, with some understatement, “a diverse group of 41 industry leaders.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine a cocktail party populated by recognizable guests who would otherwise probably never hang out together: some of them are highly knowledgeable about movies, some have made movies, others have appeared in movies and still others have at least seen some movies. Hold that image in your mind and tally off the boldface names in attendance, and you may come up with rosters not unlike the — shall we say, heterogeneous — juries that will preside over this year’s Tribeca Film Festival. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/arts/10artsbeat-tribeca/10artsbeat-tribeca-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jury Lineups Announced for Tribeca Film Festival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': N