ate time-lapse road trips using Google Street View images. Its utility is unclear. But it’s terrific viewing.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/turning-street-view-images-into-time-lapse-films/', 'snippet': 'A Toronto company has developed a free, online product that allows users to create time-lapse road trips using Google Street View images. Its utility is unclear. But it’s terrific viewing.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Hyperlapse videos are a variation of traditional time lapse filmmaking in which the camera travels while also panning, rotating and tilting. The effect can be striking or dizzying. But under normal circumstances, coordinating all that action and turning it into a film is exceedingly complex and time consuming.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-hyperlapse/10bits-hyperlapse-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-hyperlapse/10bits-hyperlapse-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-hyperlapse/10bits-hyperlapse-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 538, 'width': 955, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-hyperlapse/10bits-hyperlapse-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 538, 'width': 955, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/technology/10bits-hyperlapse/10bits-hyperlapse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy':