zen of Israel with crimes including contact with a foreign agent after he traveled to Syria to fight alongside the rebels, Shin Bet, Israel’s internal security agency, said in a statement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arab Israeli Is Accused of Joining Rebels in Syrian Revolt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Arab Israeli Is Accused of Joining Rebels in Syrian Revolt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Massarwa, Hikmat', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shin Bet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harroun, Eric G', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T18:34:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa1a35b8-bbcc-5f9f-9883-e512f3a55610', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa1a35b8-bbcc-5f9f-9883-e512f3a55610'}, {'abstract': 'The mayor and deputy mayor of Spring Valley, N.Y., both charged last week as part of a far-ranging corruption case, refused to step down but also found public support.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/nyregion/first-spring-valley-ny-meeting-since-officials-arrests.html', 'snippet': 'The mayor and deputy mayor of Spring Valley, N.Y., both charged last week as part of a far-ranging corruption case, refused to step down but also found public support.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SPRING VALLEY, N.Y. — It would have been a routine gathering of this community’s governing body except for one salient and looming fact: It was the first meeting since the mayor and the deputy mayor had been arrested in a complicated and brazen federal corruption case that also ensnared a state senator and a New York City councilman.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arrests of 2 Officials Lead to a Tense Village Meeting', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Arrests of 2 Officials Lead To a Tense Village Meeting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leonard, Randy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spring Valley (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Desmaret, Joseph A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jasmin, Noramie F', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Halloran, Daniel J III', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Malcolm A', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T18:36:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Leonard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b24f8a8-9ab8-5a1f-b248-82442376ce8d', 'word_count': 674, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b24f8a8-9ab8-5a1f-b248-82442376ce8d'}, {'abstract': 'Private Stock, by the designer Jon Koon, provides an entertaining break from the ordinary shopping expe