 in America festival in Philadelphia, with other acts including Nine Inch Nails, Kendrick Lamar and Phoenix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jay-Z did not have to look far for a singer to headline the second annual Budweiser Made in America music festival in Philadelphia — his wife Beyoncé will be at the top of the bill, Billboard reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyoncé to Headline Philadelphia Music Festival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knowles, Beyonce', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T19:43:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/571e2a84-9bcb-5ac1-a1c3-d1f36cb3e245', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/571e2a84-9bcb-5ac1-a1c3-d1f36cb3e245'}, {'abstract': 'Shayne Oliver is the 25-year-old designer behind a men’s label that mixes streetwear with high fashion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/fashion/hood-by-air-has-a-fashion-moment.html', 'snippet': 'Shayne Oliver is the 25-year-old designer behind a men’s label that mixes streetwear with high fashion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fashion show was running an hour late, but no one seemed to mind. The rapper Waka Flocka Flame took a seat near the artist Terence Koh. Tank and Bambi, two miniature Pomeranians with more than 3,000 followers on Instagram, sat front row with their owner, the creative director Nicola Formichetti. Then, with a smoke-filled spectacle of bluish lasers and flickering LED signs, a mash-up of post-apocalyptic, post-Internet looks was unveiled.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 724}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 849, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1698, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/fashion/11HBR/11HBR-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hood by Air Has a Fashion Moment', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Fashion Education, Hard Won', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hawgood, Alex', 'rank': 2, 'major'