af0e97cd350c'}, {'abstract': 'McCandlish Phillips, the former New York Times reporter who died this week, was known for exposing a Klansman’s Jewish background, but his work was much broader, as shown here in a few of his articles.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/evidence-a-reporter-was-more-than-a-one-story-wonder/', 'snippet': 'McCandlish Phillips, the former New York Times reporter who died this week, was known for exposing a Klansman’s Jewish background, but his work was much broader, as shown here in a few of his articles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'McCandlish Phillips, the masterly former New York Times reporter who died on Tuesday, was about a lot more than exposing a Jewish-born Ku Klux Klansman, although that is what he is often remembered for. His deceptively simple-sounding declarative voice could make just about any subject seem irresistibly droll. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/nyregion/10mccandlish-cityroom/10mccandlish-cityroom-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/10/nyregion/10mccandlish-cityroom/10mccandlish-cityroom-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/nyregion/10mccandlish-cityroom/10mccandlish-cityroom-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/nyregion/10mccandlish-cityroom/10mccandlish-cityroom-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1370, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '