cle/62f9c039-49fb-5639-aa1b-30aa762aa342', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62f9c039-49fb-5639-aa1b-30aa762aa342'}, {'abstract': 'Manjari Chaturvedi brought a dance style mixing Indian classical dance with Sufi poetry and music to Symphony Space on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/arts/dance/manjari-chaturvedis-sufi-kathak-at-symphony-space.html', 'snippet': 'Manjari Chaturvedi brought a dance style mixing Indian classical dance with Sufi poetry and music to Symphony Space on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What is Sufi Kathak? As the Indian dancer Manjari Chaturvedi made abundantly clear during her New York debut at Symphony Space on Tuesday, Sufi Kathak is a dance style invented by Manjari Chaturvedi. It borrows from Kathak, an Indian classical dance with both Hindu and Muslim roots, to express the mysticism of Sufi poetry and music.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/kathak/kathak-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/kathak/kathak-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 631}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/kathak/kathak-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 975, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/kathak/kathak-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1949, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/kathak/kathak-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam