iff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/652d0cab-f864-57c3-9a1b-bd692d40dbf5', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/652d0cab-f864-57c3-9a1b-bd692d40dbf5'}, {'abstract': 'The 2014 Ghibli will be Maserati’s first diesel offering, sharing its engine with the Lancia Thema and European Jeep Grand Cherokee.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/10/the-2014-maserati-ghibli-aims-to-be-a-5-series-fighter/', 'snippet': 'The 2014 Ghibli will be Maserati’s first diesel offering, sharing its engine with the Lancia Thema and European Jeep Grand Cherokee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Automotive conglomerates can produce the strangest things, like, say, a diesel-powered Maserati. The company released the first official photos Monday of the four-door 2014 Ghibli sedan, which will be introduced at the Shanghai Motor Show next week.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The 2014 Maserati Ghibli Aims to Be a 5 Series Fighter', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Maserati Ghibli: Four Doors and a Diesel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marchionne, Sergio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fiat SpA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jeep Division of Chrysler', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Maserati SpA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North America', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-10T21:36:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/219d982a-bef1-5dff-a049-420d4f52edfe', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/219d982a-bef1-5dff-a049-420d4f52edfe'}, {'abstract': 'At the mezzo-soprano Isabel Leonard’s recital at Zankel Hall on Tuesday evening, the program was split between Spanish and American songs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/arts/music/isabel-leonard-at-zankel-hall.html', 'snippet': 'At the mezzo-soprano Isabel Leonard’s recital at Zankel Hall on Tuesday evening, the program was split between Spanish and American songs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The two halves of the mezzo-soprano Isabel Leonard’s recital on Tuesday evening at Zankel Hall reflected the two sides of her ancestry. Her mother is Argentine and her father is from the United States, so before intermission she sang Spanish songs and after it American ones, including new pieces by Jennifer Higdon, Glen Roven and Ben Moore. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/LEONARD/LEONARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/LEONARD/LEONARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/LEONARD/LEONARD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/11/arts/LEONARD/LEONARD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumb