t': 669, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc7d9eb8-12eb-57c0-846c-630c88621ba4'}, {'abstract': 'Lionel Messi came off the bench on Wednesday and helped set up the decisive goal against Paris St.-Germain that sent Barcelona to the semifinals of the UEFA Champions League.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/sports/soccer/lionel-messi-to-the-rescue-as-barcelona-advances-to-champions-league-semifinals.html', 'snippet': 'Lionel Messi came off the bench on Wednesday and helped set up the decisive goal against Paris St.-Germain that sent Barcelona to the semifinals of the UEFA Champions League.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For nearly an hour, the Barcelona fans at Camp Nou divided their gazes between the action on the field and the movement — or lack of it, really — on the team’s bench.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/sports/soccer/soccers-2/soccers-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/10/sports/soccer/soccers-2/soccers-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/sports/soccer/soccers-2/soccers-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/sports/soccer/soccers-2/soccers-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/10/sports/soccer/soccers-2/soccers-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard