u-get-what-you-pay-for/', 'snippet': 'Republican and Democratic strategists don’t like what they see in the campaign money landscape any more than you do, but for different reasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Hanna, the Republican Party political boss, famously declared at the outset of the McKinley-Bryan campaign of 1896: “There are two things that are important in politics. The first is money, and I can’t remember the second.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Political Campaigns, Do You Get What You Pay For?', 'kicker': 'Thomas B. Edsall', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Axelrod, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rove, Karl', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevens, Stuart', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Crossroads', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Center for Responsive Politics', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citizens United', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Crossroads Grassroots Policy Strategies', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Election Commission', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-11T01:21:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas B. Edsall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/049be0ed-15f0-57c6-9432-6b2bdd7708a0', 'word_count': 2552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/049be0ed-15f0-57c6-9432-6b2bdd7708a0'}, {'abstract': 'The United States is poised to increase its nonlethal aid to opposition groups as pressure builds to lift a European Union embargo on sending arms to Syria.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/world/move-to-widen-support-for-syria-rebels-gains-speed.html', 'snippet': 'The United States is poised to increase its nonlethal aid to opposition groups as pressure builds to lift a European Union embargo on sending arms to Syria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A long-debated move by Western nations to expand support for Syria’s opposition gained momentum on Wednesday, with the United States poised to increase its nonlethal aid to rebel groups and pressure building to lift a European Union embargo on sending arms to Syria. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/world/europe/12diplo/12diplo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/12/world/europe/12diplo/12diplo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/world/europe/12diplo/12diplo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/world/europe/12diplo/12diplo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/world/europe/12diplo/12diplo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy