the Winklevoss twins.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/as-big-investors-emerge-bitcoin-gets-ready-for-its-close-up/', 'snippet': 'Silicon Valley and Wall Street are taking note of bitcoin, which has drawn prominent investors like the Winklevoss twins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Winklevoss twins, Cameron and Tyler — Olympic rowers, nemeses of Mark Zuckerberg — are laying claim to a new title: bitcoin moguls.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Never Mind Facebook; Winklevoss Twins Rule in Digital Money', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Never Mind Facebook; Winklevoss Twins Rule in Digital Money', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Currency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winklevoss, Cameron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winklevoss, Tyler', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bitcoin Project', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Winklevoss Capital Management', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-11T19:11:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nathaniel Popper and Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathaniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Popper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6ae5927-cad5-5f58-b333-bd41200b231e', 'word_count': 864, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6ae5927-cad5-5f58-b333-bd41200b231e'}, {'abstract': 'In his 42 years as technical director of Louis Jadot, Jacques Lardière solidified his status as one of the most unforgettable characters in wine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/dining/jacques-lardiere-puts-down-his-wine-glass.html', 'snippet': 'In his 42 years as technical director of Louis Jadot, Jacques Lardière solidified his status as one of the most unforgettable characters in wine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To watch Jacques Lardière scoot about the cellar at the headquarters of Louis Jadot in Beaune, France, the crossroads of Burgundy, is to see a man in his element. With white hair cascading from his head like a puffy cumulus cloud, red pants the likes of which only a Frenchman could even think of carrying off, twinkling eyes magnified by spectacles and an ever-present smile, Mr. Lardière is a cross between a wizard and an elf, climbing over barrels and digging deeper into Jadot’s rich Burgundian holdings in a determined effort to explain the wondrous mysteries that keep Burgundy lovers so everlastingly entranced.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/dining/17POUR_SPAN/17POUR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/dining/17POUR_SPAN/17POUR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/dining/17POUR_SPAN/17POUR_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/dining/17POUR_SPAN/17POUR_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'sub