ve at home after college.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was in high school, I visited France on an exchange program and stayed with a well-to-do family. When I returned home, I marveled that the household employed a maid who washed my clothes. My mother rolled her eyes. “You have a maid here who does your laundry,” she said. “Me!”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Having Mom Do Your Laundry, to Save Money', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Perks of Living With Parents', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calculators', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Laundry and Laundromats', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-11T19:14:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a1a6e45-6e9a-5f1f-aea3-a90127fe600a', 'word_count': 347, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a1a6e45-6e9a-5f1f-aea3-a90127fe600a'}, {'abstract': 'Franco Bernabe, the Telecom Italia chairman, said its board of directors had received an offer from Hutchison Whampoa, and that a committee of its biggest shareholders would review it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/technology/hong-kong-operator-makes-bid-for-telecom-italia.html', 'snippet': 'Franco Bernabe, the Telecom Italia chairman, said its board of directors had received an offer from Hutchison Whampoa, and that a committee of its biggest shareholders would review it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Telecom Italia on Thursday said it would formally consider an offer to merge with a smaller 