'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/tuck-everlasting-cant-find-a-parking-spot-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The musical’s run in Boston has been postponed because, press representatives said, no theater is available for a transfer to New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With luck, audiences won’t have to live forever to see a musical adaptation of “Tuck Everlasting” hit Broadway, but they are going to have to wait a little longer for it. The producers of a new musical based on that Natalie Babbitt children’s novel, about a girl who meets a boy from a family of immortals, said that its planned world premiere in Boston would be delayed because there were no theaters in New York where the musical could transfer.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Tuck Everlasting’ Can’t Find a Parking Spot on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Tuck Everlasting’ Musical Can’t Park on Broadway', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Babbitt, Natalie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicholaw, Casey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shear, Claudia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tysen, Nathan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-11T19:34:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d48973c9-af64-5085-b6ec-165617599d9c', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d48973c9-af64-5085-b6ec-165617599d9c'}, {'abstract': 'A Paris judge said Thursday that she will decide Friday whether an auction that day of Hopi Indian artifacts can proceed despite complaints from the tribe.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/11/paris-judge-to-rule-friday-on-hopi-artifact-sale/', 'snippet': 'A Paris judge said Thursday that she will decide Friday whether an auction that day of Hopi Indian artifacts can proceed despite complaints from the tribe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A French civil court judge heard arguments for two hours Thursday and said she will rule Friday on whether a major auction of sacred Hopi Indian artifacts can go forward in Paris despite claims by the tribe that they were stolen and that selling them is sacrilegious.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Judge to Rule Friday on Hopi Artifact Sale', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'French Judge to Rule Friday On Selling Hopi Artifacts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hopi Indians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Neret-Minet Tessier & Sarrou', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-11T19:41:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Mashberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd33a75e-ccfe-5afa-a0de-21010c4f7962', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd33a75e-ccfe-5afa-a0de-21010c4f7962'}, {'abstract': 'Citigroup’s chief executive attended the ribbon-cutting at a new branch in the nati