4/11/the-price-of-gold-and-ron-paul/', 'snippet': 'As the value of gold declines, a look back at the libertarian’s views on fiat currency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The price of gold, The New York Times reported today, has fallen 17 percent since late 2011. Just on Wednesday, the price of bullion dropped $28, to $1,558 an ounce. Gold-focused mutual funds, which reached a peak value of $26.3 billion in April of 2011, have lost half of their value since then.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Price of Gold (and Ron Paul)', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-11T19:46:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77489807-818c-5284-8f11-dee5676c39b1', 'word_count': 250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77489807-818c-5284-8f11-dee5676c39b1'}, {'abstract': 'Joshua Marsh’s sumptuous paintings of ordinary objects are on view at Jeff Bailey, and a darkly comical video by Johannes DeYoung is being screened in the gallery’s project room.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/arts/design/joshua-marsh-as-if.html', 'snippet': 'Joshua Marsh’s sumptuous paintings of ordinary objects are on view at Jeff Bailey, and a darkly comical video by Johannes DeYoung is being screened in the gallery’s project room.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeff Bailey Gallery ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Joshua Marsh ‘As If’', 'kicker': 'Art in Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Johannes DeYoung: ‘Ego Loser’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None