ies all over China. And he was imprisoned, twice, spending almost 16 years in solitary confinement. (The first time, the authorities offered to release him if he returned to the United States, but he chose to remain in prison to prove his loyalty to the revolution.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN/12RDP_REVOLUTIONARY_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_