ess and friendship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/nyregion/two-lives-linked-by-murder-coincidence-and-forgiveness.html', 'snippet': 'Despite the fact Michael Rowe murdered Anthony Colon’s brother Wilfredo in 1992, the two men have since developed a strong bond of forgiveness and friendship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From across the prison visiting room on that afternoon in September 2006, Anthony Colón noticed the broad man in the glasses, an inmate assigned to take pictures. Mr. Colón, a restaurant manager, was there to visit an old friend who was doing time. He had not expected to see the man in the glasses, Michael Rowe. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/nyregion/about/about-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/12/nyregion/about/about-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/nyregion/about/about-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/nyregion/about/about-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/nyregion/about/about-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/12/nyregion/about/about-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,