ing for cash in a reality TV show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/movies/fists-of-legend-directed-by-kang-woo-suk.html', 'snippet': 'In “Fists of Legend,” a group of largely forgotten street fighters try to recapture their glory in the ring by competing for cash in a reality TV show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the title of “Fists of Legend” suggests, originality is not one of the film’s watchwords. For all that, this mixed-martial-arts slog from Kang Woo-suk — running more than two and a half hours, people — is not a complete chore. Shot with some wit and considerable speed, its short, sharp beatdowns are a refreshing change from the bloated action sequences favored by some of Mr. Kang’s genre contemporaries.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_FISTS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_FISTS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_FISTS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_FISTS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/12/arts/12RDP_FISTS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/12/