pace to return to the Champions League next year, completing a 10-year circle that saw them relegated from La Liga.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/full-circle-almost-for-real-sociedad/', 'snippet': 'Real Sociedad is on pace to return to the Champions League next year, completing a 10-year circle that saw them relegated from La Liga.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fans at Anoeta saw six goals last Saturday. Two were scored by Malaga, a quarterfinalist in this season’s Champions League, but it was the four that were scored by Real Sociedad that will add to the growing sense of belief that echoes around San Sebastián these days.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Full Circle, Almost, for Real Sociedad', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Real Sociedad (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-12T17:02:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samuel Marsden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samuel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Marsden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ae4f612-59c4-52db-a487-34b2f1aeaabc', 'word_count': 697, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ae4f612-59c4-52db-a487-34b2f1aeaabc'}, {'abstract': 'The Twins announced Friday afternoon that their game with the Mets on Friday night would be played despite wintry weather in the area.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/mets-wait-to-see-if-theyll-have-a-snow-day/', 'snippet': 'The Twins announced Friday afternoon that their game with the Mets on Friday night would be played despite wintry weather in the area.', 'lead_paragraph': 