a81-bed1-20a5fab85e6c'}, {'abstract': 'The actress Julianne Moore is the cover subject of the Spring Design issue of T, where we learn how the natural beauty likes to play against type.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/12/now-online-t-spring-design-2013/', 'snippet': 'The actress Julianne Moore is the cover subject of the Spring Design issue of T, where we learn how the natural beauty likes to play against type.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The actress Julianne Moore, photographed by Inez and Vinoodh, is the cover subject of the Spring Design issue of T, where we learn how the natural beauty likes to play against type. Inside: discover the glories of Lowcountry cooking in Charleston, read Nicky Haslam’s take on how good and bad taste evolve over time, and admire the rich tones and gems inside jewelry designer Marie-Helene de Taillac’s apartment in Paris. Other spots on this issue’s house tours: the Milan town house of the C.E.O. of Kartell, Irene Silvagni’s wonderfully imperfect Provençal retreat and the landscape designer Piet Oudolf’s lush home in Nantucket. Finally, take a look at a collection of “Great Gatsby” editions that offer an illuminating cross section of 83 years of book design. See all from the issue >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'T’s Spring Design Issue', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Taillac, Marie-Helene', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Julianne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oudolf, Piet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kartell', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-12T21:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/387ddf7c-a75c-5b58-8b0f-0a076077ff44', 'word_count': 131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/387ddf7c-a75c-5b58-8b0f-0a076077ff44'}, {'abstract': 'John Pizzarelli brings his quartet and his father, Bucky Pizzarelli, to the Café Carlyle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/arts/music/john-pizzarelli-quartet-and-bucky-pizzarelli-at-cafe-carlyle.html', 'snippet': 'John Pizzarelli brings his quartet and his father, Bucky Pizzarelli, to the Café Carlyle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For some lucky musicians, like John Pizzarelli, work and play are pretty much the same thing. At any of Mr. Pizzarelli’s concerts, with or without his singing and life partner, Jessica Molaskey, Mr. Pizzarelli conveys a contagious enjoyment that transports you to a place where worries recede, and you can coast along with him to a jazz-pop heaven. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13PIZZARELLI/13PIZZARELLI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13PIZZARELLI/13PIZZARELLI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13PIZZARELLI/13PIZZARELLI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13PIZZARELLI/13PIZZARELLI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, '