'snippet': 'The Just Kidding Theater Company takes on zombies and Hamlet — and Juliet, Titania and Lady Macbeth — in “Living Dead in Denmark,” at the Gene Frankel Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You won’t find Yorick’s skull in “Living Dead in Denmark,” the Just Kidding Theater Company’s antic production at the Gene Frankel Theater. But you will find bound human heads suspended on a wall en route to your seat. You’ll also find Shakespearean characters, men in drag, a villain called Lady Gaga and more zombies than you can shake a broadsword at. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13LIVINGDEAD/13LIVINGDEAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13LIVINGDEAD/13LIVINGDEAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13LIVINGDEAD/13LIVINGDEAD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13LIVINGDEAD/13LIVINGDEAD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13LIVINGDEAD/13LIVINGDEAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13LIVINGDEAD/13LIVINGDEAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/0