{'abstract': 'The newest episode of the parody franchise “Scary Movie” mines “Paranormal Activity,” “Black Swan” and “Rise of the Planet of the Apes” for a few laughs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/movies/scary-movie-v-starring-ashley-tisdale.html', 'snippet': 'The newest episode of the parody franchise “Scary Movie” mines “Paranormal Activity,” “Black Swan” and “Rise of the Planet of the Apes” for a few laughs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not even Halloween, and Dimension Films (the Weinstein Company’s horror, action and sophomoric-comedy arm) is releasing “Scary Movie V,” the latest installment of the slick, highly profitable parody franchise. Hollywood has certainly kept the screenwriters (the “Scary Movie” veterans Pat Profft and David Zucker) supplied with material: the biggest targets here are the “Paranormal Activity” series, “Black Swan” and “Rise of the Planet of the Apes,” with nods to “Mama,” “The Ring,” “Saw” and others. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13SCARY/13SCARY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13SCARY/13SCARY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13SCARY/13SCARY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/13SCARY/13SCARY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/13/arts/