rison gang or Mexican drug cartels were responsible for killing two prosecutors eight weeks apart in Kaufman, Tex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KAUFMAN, Tex. — Soon after one of his prosecutors was shot and killed here in January, the district attorney in this rural county outside Dallas, Mike McLelland, told colleagues that he believed the victim was the target of a specific disgruntled defendant whom his office had successfully prosecuted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Lone Wolf’ Theory Gains Ground in Texas Deaths', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A ‘Lone Wolf’ Theory Gains Ground in Texas Prosecutors’ Deaths', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fernandez, Manny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kaufman County (Tex)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLelland, Mike', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hasse, Mark E', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLelland, Cynthia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-12T22:44:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manny Fernandez and Serge F. Kovaleski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Serge', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Kovaleski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6037889c-3d14-5f87-a652-1dd55ed6701c', 'word_count': 1371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6037889c-3d14-5f87-a652-1dd55ed6701c'}, {'abstract': 'Readers discuss child care expenses 