orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa869216-3420-5c13-89da-225fee044ccb', 'word_count': 1322, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa869216-3420-5c13-89da-225fee044ccb'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama met with insurance executives to discuss the so-called rate shock if the industry sharply raises premiums this fall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/us/politics/obama-and-insurance-executives-discuss-health-care-exchanges.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama met with insurance executives to discuss the so-called rate shock if the industry sharply raises premiums this fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama met with insurance industry executives at the White House on Friday to coordinate the introduction this fall of the insurance marketplaces at the heart of the national health care law, and to discuss so-called rate shock if the industry sharply raises premiums. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Sees Insurers; Health Law Is Subject ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Sees Insurers; Health Law Is Subject', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Calmes, Jackie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reform and Reorganization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-12T23:40:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name':