14, 1863. For some six days prior the Ocean Ranger lay at anchor in sight of the fort’s guns as a steady stream of food and supplies were carried aboard. The brig’s main cargo, however, consisted of passengers — specifically 453 recently freed African-Americans — about to set sail for a new life in Haiti.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Île à Vache: From Hope to Disaster', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slavery', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Haiti', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T02:03:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip W. Magness', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Magness', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf4916e2-e1ec-5954-956b-0f8e1c914cf1', 'word_count': 2344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf4916e2-e1ec-5954-956b-0f8e1c914cf1'}, {'abstract': 'A guide to cultural and recreational events in the Hudson Valley.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/nyregion/events-in-westchester.html', 'snippet': 'A guide to cultural and recreational events in the Hudson Valley.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A guide to cultural and recreational events in the Hudson Valley. Items for the calendar should be sent at least three weeks in advance to westweek@nytimes.com.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Events in Westchester', 'kicker': 'Calendar', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Westchester', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject',