een convicted in the death of an 8-year-old girl, the girl’s family was just starting to process what had happened.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/nyregion/after-conviction-in-75-murder-is-thrown-out-a-victims-family-relives-its-pain.html', 'snippet': 'A day after a Bronx judge freed David Bryant, who had been convicted in the death of an 8-year-old girl, the girl’s family was just starting to process what had happened.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time Walter J. Smith saw his little sister Karen alive, on a warm spring day, March 28, 1975, she was on her way to the corner store to buy a 100 Grand candy bar. Hours later, at 1:50 a.m., her body was found in a darkened 16th-floor stairwell of the South Bronx housing project where she lived. The 8-year-old girl had been raped, stabbed and left to die — the candy bar wrapper by her side.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Conviction in ’75 Murder Is Thrown Out, Victim’s Family Relives Pain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Conviction in ’75 Murder Is Thrown Out, Victim’s Family Relives Pain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'False Arrests, Convictions and Imprisonments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bryant, David', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Karen', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Walter J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T02:20:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Santora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 