ing hospital for avian influenza.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Avian Flu Virus Confirmed in Beijing for First Time', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Avian Influenza', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T05:14:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gerry Mullany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gerry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mullany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a57a373a-2080-544b-a3d0-7f6502054c4c', 'word_count': 232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a57a373a-2080-544b-a3d0-7f6502054c4c'}, {'abstract': 'Sanctions against Russia; change for a Bordeaux mainstay; challenge for Mugabe foe; and Silicon Valley’s visa issue.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/iht-quick-read-april-13/', 'snippet': 'Sanctions against Russia; change for a Bordeaux mainstay; challenge for Mugabe foe; and Silicon Valley’s visa issue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States imposed new sanctions Friday on about two dozen Russians accused of human rights violations, and Moscow vowed to retaliate as a fractious dispute between the two countries escalated further into a cold war-style, tit-for-tat clash. The Obama administration barred 18 Russians from traveling to the United States and froze any assets they may have here under a new law intended to punish human rights violations. A handful of other more highly placed officials, including the head of the Russian region of Chechnya, were put on a list not publicly revea