-8a2d-5d83-823e-d068a3bdadc4', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/91f90f0c-8a2d-5d83-823e-d068a3bdadc4'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks’ Carmelo Anthony is poised to top Kevin Durant, who has won three consecutive scoring titles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/sports/basketball/carmelo-anthony-nears-nba-scoring-title.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks’ Carmelo Anthony is poised to top Kevin Durant, who has won three consecutive scoring titles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1994, David Robinson of the San Antonio Spurs entered his team’s final game locked in a battle with Shaquille O’Neal of the Orlando Magic for the league’s scoring title. Robinson, a veteran center, needed to score 4 more points than O’Neal to overtake him. Just to be safe, Robinson went on a tear, scoring a career-high 71 points — making him the fourth player to surpass 70 points in a game — and finishing with an average of 29.8 points a game. O’Neal could not match him, scoring 32 in his team’s finale and finishing with an average of 29.3.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/dog-dribble/dog-dribble-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/dog-dribble/dog-dribble-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 672}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/dog-dribble/dog-dribble-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 915, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/dog-dribble/dog-dribble-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1829, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0,