ple believed then as we do now, that Socrates’ real crime was being too clever and, not insignificantly, a royal pain to those in power or, as Plato put it, a gadfly. Just as a gadfly is an insect that could sting a horse and prod it into action, so too could Socrates sting the state. He challenged the moral values of his contemporaries and refused to go along with unjust demands of tyrants, often obstructing their plans when he could. Socrates thought his service to Athens should have earned him free dinners for life. He was given a cup of hemlock instead.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hacktivists as Gadflies', 'kicker': 'The Stone', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hacktivists As Gadflies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Auernheimer, Andrew', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keys, Matthew', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Anonymous (Internet Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AT&T Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T17:36:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Ludlow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ludlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5380363-1935-5ca7-923e-fddcf1aae359', 'word_count': 1266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5380363-1935-5ca7-923e-fddcf1aae359'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. McCormick, the first woman from North America to be a professional bullfighter, performed in hundreds of bullfights in the 1950s and received top billing in stadiums worldwide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/us/patricia-mccormick-bullfighter-who-defied-gender-roles-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. McCormick, the first woman from North America to be a professional bullfighter, performed in hundreds of bullfights in the 1950s and received top billing in stadiums worldwide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During the 1950s, when young women from West Texas were typically expected to take care of the home, Patricia McCormick bucked social convention, and a long male tradition, by entering the bullfighting ring. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/us/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/14/us/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 684}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/us/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 898, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/us/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1796, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/us/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/14/us/dog-MCCORMICK1-obit/dog