ing fears of an outbreak like one in New York that killed 7.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/us/after-meningitis-death-in-los-angeles-gay-activists-urge-vigilance.html', 'snippet': 'A West Hollywood lawyer was declared brain dead just days after friends described him as fit and healthy, raising fears of an outbreak like one in New York that killed 7.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST HOLLYWOOD, Calif. — A potentially deadly strain of meningitis, which has left one resident brain dead, has sent a shiver through the large gay community here, as public health officials have urged residents to be on the lookout for any symptoms of the disease.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Alert for Meningitis in Los Angeles ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Alert for Meningitis in Los Angeles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meningitis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Hollywood (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T19:55:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Lovett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lovett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cfa17de-de7a-5821-9ca3-b00a64bec978', 'word_count': 754, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cfa17de-de7a-5821-9ca3-b00a64bec978'}, {'abstract': 'The photographer Chad Batka captured highlights from the first day of the music festival in California.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/coachella-photos-from-day-1/', 'sni