065e0'}, {'abstract': 'A video released on a North Korean government Web site shows the nation targeting nuclear weapons at a Colorado city. But a map shown places the city in the vicinity of Louisiana.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/13/north-korea-threatens-colorado-city-inaccurately/', 'snippet': 'A video released on a North Korean government Web site shows the nation targeting nuclear weapons at a Colorado city. But a map shown places the city in the vicinity of Louisiana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'North Korea, which seemed to be running out of tubs to thump, found a new target for its ire in a propaganda video released Saturday on Uriminzokkiri, a government Web site.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'North Korea Threatens Colorado City, Inaccurately', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T20:37:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c01f68e-f797-5729-a26b-d7b9d8aeda17', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c01f68e-f797-5729-a26b-d7b9d8aeda17'}, {'abstract': 'The American military for the first time will require generals and admirals to be evaluated by the people they command on qualities including character.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/us/militarys-top-officers-face-review-of-their-character.html', 'snippet': 'The American military for the first time will require generals and admirals to be evaluated by the people they command on qualities including character.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WAS