bstract': 'Edward R. Murrow High School won its division in the scholastic championships last week, and Webster University of St. Louis was the Final Four of College Chess title winner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/crosswords/chess/chess-murrow-high-school-wins-title.html', 'snippet': 'Edward R. Murrow High School won its division in the scholastic championships last week, and Webster University of St. Louis was the Final Four of College Chess title winner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Edward R. Murrow High School in Brooklyn won its division at the “Supernationals” scholastic championships in Nashville last weekend.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brooklyn School Takes Title at the ‘Supernationals’', 'kicker': 'Chess', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brooklyn School Takes Title At the ‘Supernationals’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McClain, Dylan Loeb', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Murrow, Edward R, High School', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Webster University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intermediate School 318 (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-13T23:26:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Chess', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dylan Loeb McClain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dylan', 'middlename': 'Loeb', 'lastname': 'McClain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d209c07-ed06-5e8a-9331-87fb4de4d982', 'word_count': 449, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d209c07-ed06-5e8a-9331-87fb4de4d982'}, {'abstract': 'Matt Harvey continued his sensational start to the season, taking a no-hit bid into the seventh inning as the Mets beat the Twins for the second day in a row.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/sports/baseball/matt-harvey-flirts-with-no-hitter-as-mets-beat-twins.html', 'snippet': 'Matt Harvey continued his sensational start to the season, taking a no-hit bid into the seventh inning as the Mets beat the Twins for the second day in a row.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — It wasn’t a bad pitch, but it wasn’t the right pitch. Matt Harvey realized that not long after Minnesota’s Justin Morneau swung at an inside slider with two out in the seventh, pulling a home run high off the right-field pole and halting Harvey’s bid for a second Mets no-hitter in two years and his first professional shutout.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/METS/METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/METS/METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/14/sports/METS/METS-thumbStan