 Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubio, Marco', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-14T16:49:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker and Brian Knowlton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Knowlton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0926d28-4e75-5cf5-b4cf-10682e1b037a', 'word_count': 818, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0926d28-4e75-5cf5-b4cf-10682e1b037a'}, {'abstract': '’42,’ a baseball biopic, was a strong No. 1 at North American movie theaters, taking in about $27.3 million over the weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/14/jackie-robinson-movie-has-strong-opening/', 'snippet': '’42,’ a baseball biopic, was a strong No. 1 at North American movie theaters, taking in about $27.3 million over the weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hollywood was predictably shocked over the weekend to find that a well-reviewed drama succeeded at the box office even though it was aimed at geriatric moviegoers (industry definition: anyone over the age of 25). The Jackie Robinson biopic “42” was a strong No. 1 at North American movie theaters, taking in about $27.3 million, according to its distributor, Warner Brothers. Legendary Entertainment spent a relatively modest $38 million to make the film, which performed best among older men, the hardest demographic for studios to reach. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jackie Robinson Movie Has Strong Opening', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Strong Start for Jackie Robinson Movie', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robinson, Jackie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hollywood.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Legendary Entertainment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-14T16:58:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2de6463f-499a-5def-8174-01014d6d4153', 'word_count': 171, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2de6463f-499a-5def-8174-01014d6d4153'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers said that while creating functional kidneys for people was a long way off, replacement organs made like the rat kidneys would have benefits over other methods.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/15/science/rat-kidneys-made-in-lab-seen-as-step-to-human-transplants.html', 'snippet': 'Researchers said that while creating functional kidneys for people was a long way off, replacement organs made like the rat kidneys would have benefits over other methods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Researchers at Massachusetts General Hospital in Boston have made functioning rat kidneys in the laboratory, a bioengineering achievement that may one day lead to the ability to create