ell as housing starts and leading economic indicators for March.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/15/business/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-april-15.html', 'snippet': 'Reports include quarterly earnings from Microsoft, PepsiCo and Bank of America, as well as housing starts and leading economic indicators for March.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ECONOMIC REPORTS Data to be released include the Consumer Price Index, housing starts and industrial production for March (Tuesday); the Federal Reserve’s beige book (Wednesday); and weekly jobless claims and leading economic indicators for March (Thursday).', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/business/15Ahead/15Ahead-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/15/business/15Ahead/15Ahead-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/business/15Ahead/15Ahead-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/business/15Ahead/15Ahead-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1273, 'width': 1273, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/business/15Ahead/15Ahead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/15/business/15Ahead/15Ahead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '