nd this might not be the last postponement for the Mets on this trip, either.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — Light early-morning snow showers and an ominous forecast prompted the Minnesota Twins to postpone Sunday’s game with the Mets before some people had their breakfast. The Twins e-mailed the announcement at 8:53 a.m. Central time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Snow Could Be in Mets’ Future', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Twins', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denver (Colo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Minneapolis (Minn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-14T22:26:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pat Borzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pat', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borzi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/420c6afc-4cfc-58f3-9a27-082ff10e0fb7', 'word_count': 194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/420c6afc-4cfc-58f3-9a27-082ff10e0fb7'}, {'abstract': 'More European finance ministers agreed over the weekend to push for automatic exchanges of bank records to crack down on tax havens, a plan that already had the support of five countries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/15/business/global/support-grows-for-european-effort-to-fight-tax-havens.html', 'snippet': 'More European finance ministers agreed over the weekend to push for automatic exchanges of bank records to crack down on tax havens, a plan that already had the support of fi