 was alive, our relationship was virtually symbiotic. After he was gone, I realized he’d been my antidepressant.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/15/separation-anxiety/', 'snippet': 'When my father was alive, our relationship was virtually symbiotic. After he was gone, I realized he’d been my antidepressant.', 'lead_paragraph': '“When was the last time you masturbated?” the psychiatrist asked me matter-of-factly. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Separation Anxiety', 'kicker': 'Anxiety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grief (Emotion)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T11:15:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole Bokat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bokat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22f12be5-1b61-57f7-8418-13f33fef7a5f', 'word_count': 1371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22f12be5-1b61-57f7-8418-13f33fef7a5f'}, {'abstract': 'Fazil Say, given a 10-month suspended sentence for insulting Islam and offending Muslims, said the accusations violated human rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/world/middleeast/turkish-pianist-sentenced-for-twitter-postings.html', 'snippet': 'Fazil Say, given a 10-month suspended sentence for insulting Islam and offending Muslims, said the accusations violated human rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISTANBUL — A court here handed down a suspended 10-month prison term on Monday for Fazil Say, an internationally acclaimed Turkish pianist and composer co