-the-mac/', 'snippet': 'The free Preview program included with Mac OS X offers multiple ways to view PDF files and edit images.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Preview app included with Mac OS X does more than just open images and PDF files. While the program can zoom in and out of open PDF files (and even display the document in a full-screen view), the Smart Magnify feature in Preview for OS X 10.7 (and later) enlarges a specific area of the document quickly. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip of the Week: Magnifying Smartly on the Mac', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T14:45:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/880c455d-408e-58ab-83d5-6c3acdc2ea66', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/880c455d-408e-58ab-83d5-6c3acdc2ea66'}, {'abstract': 'During his travels, Secretary of State John Kerry has repeatedly invoked the memory of Anne Smedinghoff, who died this month in a car-bomb attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/us/kerry-to-meet-with-parents-of-slain-state-dept-officer.html', 'snippet': 'During his travels, Secretary of State John Kerry has repeatedly invoked the memory of Anne Smedinghoff, who died this month in a car-bomb attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — Secretary of State John Kerry met here privately on Monday with the parents of Anne Smedinghoff, the young State Department officer who was killed this month in Afghanistan. She was the first State Department officer to die in the line of duty since the September attack on the United States diplomatic compound in Benghazi, Libya. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 799}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 770, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1539, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/world/16diplo2/16diplo2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kerry Meets With Parents of Diplomat Killed in Afghanistan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kerry Meets Privately With Parents of Diplomat Killed in Afghanistan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 1,