enbergs-absence-concerns-democrats-as-gun-votes-near.html', 'snippet': 'With Democrats scrambling to secure enough votes on sweeping gun legislation, the presence of Senator Frank R. Lautenberg, who has been ailing, is shaping up to be crucial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As a crucial series of gun-control votes approaches in the Senate, lawmakers on Capitol Hill are suddenly preoccupied with one question in particular: when is Frank Lautenberg coming back?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senator’s Absence Worries Democrats as Gun Votes Near', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lautenberg, Frank R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T17:19:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raymond Hernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raymond', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edfbc73d-c3a6-5869-8a4b-bd0a14739a7f', 'word_count': 448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edfbc73d-c3a6-5869-8a4b-bd0a14739a7f'}, {'abstract': 'The anniversary of the sinking of the Titanic is recognized by a City Room commenter with an original long-form haiku.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/15/20-lifeboats-101-years-later/', 'snippet': 'The anniversary of the sinking of the Titanic is recognized by a City Room commenter with an original long-form haiku.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To mark the 101st anniversary of the sinking of the Titanic, the City Room comment stalwart known as Lifeboat No. 6 has bestowed upon us a mini-epic: a long, traditional-form haiku of 20 stanzas, each representing one of the lost liner’s 20 lifeboats. We salute him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 491, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 491}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 838, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1676, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/nyregion/15cityroom-lifeboat1/15cityroom-lifeboat1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headli