itizen, which highlights defensive gun use. The latest entry, from April 9, describes three incidents: Two from 2013 and one archival example from 1969. It’s not hard to see what the NRA’s getting at, but just in case, a sidebar on the site states: “Studies indicate that firearms are used over 2 million times a year for personal protection, and that the presence of a firearm, without a shot being fired, prevents crime in many instances.” In other words, as Wayne LaPierre put it after Newtown, “the only thing that stops a bad guy with a gun is a good guy with a gun.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Defensive Gun Use', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaPierre, Wayne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Rifle Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Violence Policy Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T21:02:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c040665-09ef-57d2-ab79-00e7d44dd6a9', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c040665-09ef-57d2-ab79-00e7d44dd6a9'}, {'abstract': '“Visitations,” one-act operas about auditory delusions, was staged at a new hall at Stanford.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/arts/music/jonathan-bergers-visitations-at-stanford.html', 'snippet': '“Visitations,” one-act operas about auditory delusions, was staged at a new hall at Stanford.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PALO ALTO, Calif. — I attended two 