rs.html', 'snippet': 'It is not clear how overwhelmingly negative public comment will affect airport screening procedures, since more than 800 body scanners are in use at 200 domestic airports.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One traveler criticized the body scanners at airport checkpoints as “an overpriced technology that provides a false sense of security and a real sense of intrusion into our personal lives.” A second called the machines a “disgrace,” requiring travelers to stand “with arms in the air and hands overhead, for screening our entire bodies each time we fly.” A third said simply, “You have NOT made me feel safer!”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/business/16-SCANNERS/16-SCANNERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/16/business/16-SCANNERS/16-SCANNERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/business/16-SCANNERS/16-SCANNERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/business/16-SCANNERS/16-SCANNERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1382, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/business/16-SCANNERS/16-SCANNERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/16/business/16-SCANNERS/16-SCANNERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp