l clock on the neo-Gothic building’s facade, couldn’t have come at a more fitting moment. In just a few weeks, the Netherlands’ Queen Beatrix will turn the throne over to her son Willem-Alexander, having declared that the future of the nation lies with “the next generation.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Now Reopening | Amsterdam’s Rijksmuseum', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rijksmuseum', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T21:21:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steffie Nelson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steffie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a45ed784-33e3-5141-9c8e-ed04e088e224', 'word_count': 568, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a45ed784-33e3-5141-9c8e-ed04e088e224'}, {'abstract': 'The Times’s William Neuman looks at Venezuela’s tight presidential race and what Nicolás Maduro’s slim victory could mean for his presidency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/americas/100000002173045/an-air-of-uncertainty.html', 'snippet': 'The Times’s William Neuman looks at Venezuela’s tight presidential race and what Nicolás Maduro’s slim victory could mean for his presidency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times’s William Neuman looks at Venezuela’s tight presidential race and what Nicolás Maduro’s slim victory could mean for his presidency.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/15/world/video-venezuela-elect