icle/23e1b9c9-a92d-5d4f-b0b6-d8f8bdc668f6'}, {'abstract': 'With Rossini’s “Moses in Egypt,” New York City Opera returns to its birthplace, City Center, which proves to be an ideal setting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/arts/music/city-operas-moses-in-egypt-at-city-center.html', 'snippet': 'With Rossini’s “Moses in Egypt,” New York City Opera returns to its birthplace, City Center, which proves to be an ideal setting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The good news from New York City Opera is its terrific production of Rossini’s “Moses in Egypt” (“Mosè in Egitto”), which opened on Sunday afternoon. Here is an exciting performance of an overlooked masterpiece with a winning young cast in an imaginative staging by the director Michael Counts that boldly incorporates video elements.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/arts/MOSES/MOSES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/16/arts/MOSES/MOSES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/arts/MOSES/MOSES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/arts/MOSES/MOSES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/16/arts/MOSES/MOSES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/16/arts/MOSES/MOSES-thumbStandar