d a plan to have three bishops supervise an overhaul of the nation’s largest umbrella group of American nuns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pope Francis has reaffirmed the reprimand of American nuns issued by his predecessor, Pope Benedict XVI, and endorsed the plan to have three bishops supervise an overhaul of the nation’s largest umbrella group of American nuns.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pope Upholds Reprimand of American Nuns’ Group', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pope Upholds Reprimand Of American Nuns’ Group', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuns', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Leadership Conference of Women Religious', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T23:24:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laurie Goodstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laurie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73959912-e10d-5282-ab18-e74e75e7661c', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73959912-e10d-5282-ab18-e74e75e7661c'}, {'abstract': 'The opposition figure Musallam el-Barrak, a former member of Parliament, was sentenced for comments he made during a speech at a political rally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/world/middleeast/kuwait-gives-5-year-term-to-dissenter.html', 'snippet': 'The opposition figure Musallam el-Barrak, a former member of Parliament, was sentenced for comments he made during a speech at a political rally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — A court in Kuwait on Monday sentenced a prominent opposition politician to five years in prison for insulting the country’s ruler, a crime that leaders around the Persian Gulf are prosecuting with increasing frequency in an effort to stanch emboldened protest movements, or stop protests before they start. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kuwait Gives 5-Year Term to Dissenter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kuwait Gives 5-Year Term To Dissenter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kuwait', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabah, Sabah al-Ahmad al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barrak, Musallam el-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-15T23:36:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77303e89-568b-52b1-8e5c-f953e7fa20c5', 'word_count': 536, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77303e89-568b-52b1-8e5c-f953e7fa20c5'}, {'abstract': 'Video shot by The Boston Globe’s Steve Silva captures the scene after two bombs exploded at the Boston Marathon. <i>Warning: Footage contains some graphic language.</i>', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000002173604/explosions-at-the-boston-marathon.html', 'snippet': 'Video shot by The Boston Globe’s Steve Silva captures the scene after two bombs exploded at the Boston Marathon. <i>Warning: Footage contains some graphic la