london-marathon.html', 'snippet': 'Security arrangements are likely to be reviewed before  the London Marathon on Sunday and the ceremonial funeral of Margaret Thatcher on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With security forces in many cities on alert for copycat attacks after the Boston Marathon bombings, British officials on Tuesday urged a review of security measures for the London Marathon on Sunday — the next big international race — as the police and military here prepared to deploy for another major public event with the ceremonial funeral of former Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Officials Urge Tight Security for London Marathon After Boston Bombs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Marathon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-16T10:02:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bea62aaf-6ede-5811-a490-ca6fa05225f0', 'word_count': 963, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bea62aaf-6ede-5811-a490-ca6fa05225f0'}, {'abstract': 'The cookbook author Deborah Madison and Julia Moskin of The Times spoke with three home cooks in a Google+ Hangout about vegetable recipes.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/recipe-lab-video-chat-with-deborah-madison/', 'sni