 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e58eee03-e4be-5455-9084-b55bb6936f94', 'word_count': 1227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e58eee03-e4be-5455-9084-b55bb6936f94'}, {'abstract': 'Shannon Galpin, the founder of a nonprofit organization that aids women in conflict zones, noticed she was the only woman cycling in Afghanistan. She has set out to change that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/sports/cycling/shannon-galpin-has-a-mission-putting-afghans-on-bikes.html', 'snippet': 'Shannon Galpin, the founder of a nonprofit organization that aids women in conflict zones, noticed she was the only woman cycling in Afghanistan. She has set out to change that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In November, Shannon Galpin was riding her single-speed mountain bike through the hills outside Kabul. It was her 11th visit to Afghanistan, and she had grown accustomed to the sight of camel caravans, abandoned Soviet tanks and soldiers sweeping the desert for land mines. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/17cycling2/16cycling2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/17cycling2/16cycling2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/17cycling2/16cycling2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/17cycling2/16cycling2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1510, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type