s did not know whether it was the work of foreign or domestic groups or individuals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/us/politics/obama-calls-marathon-bombings-an-act-of-terrorism.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama labeled the Boston blasts a terrorist attack for the first time, but he said officials did not know whether it was the work of foreign or domestic groups or individuals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When President Obama went before cameras at the White House on Tuesday, he said he knew nothing more about who carried out the deadly bombings in Boston than he did the day before. But he knew enough to call them an “act of terrorism.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Calls Blasts an ‘Act of Terrorism’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-16T16:24:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27ea0814-a0c8-55f3-a706-32a2e133e3f6', 'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27ea0814-a0c8-55f3-a706-32a2e133e3f6'}, {'abstract': 'Vietnam must get subways running before a new car culture replaces the country’s iconic motorcycles.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/16/a-case-for-bringing-subways-to-vietnam/', 'snippet': 'Vietnam must ge