 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9eefbe49-d594-53ff-b2d4-e53dd05817db'}, {'abstract': 'In a pair of 5-to-4 decisions, the court ruled for an injured airline mechanic and against a nurse who said her pay had been unfairly docked.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/business/supreme-court-rules-on-2-employee-employer-disputes.html', 'snippet': 'In a pair of 5-to-4 decisions, the court ruled for an injured airline mechanic and against a nurse who said her pay had been unfairly docked.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In a pair of 5-to-4 decisions issued on Tuesday, the Supreme Court ruled in favor of an injured airline mechanic and against a registered nurse who said her pay had been unfairly docked.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/business/17-BIZCOURT/17-BIZCOURT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/business/17-BIZCOURT/17-BIZCOURT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/business/17-BIZCOURT/17-BIZCOURT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/business/17-BIZCOURT/17-BIZCOURT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Supreme Court Rules in Favor Of 1 Worker, but Not Another', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Supreme Court Rules in Favor Of 1 Worker, but Not Another', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Cour