ts, examines the last 10 years of Bebe Miller’s work, using live performance, video and text.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/arts/dance/a-history-at-the-kumble-theater.html', 'snippet': '“A History,” presented at the Kumble Theater for the Performing Arts, examines the last 10 years of Bebe Miller’s work, using live performance, video and text.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Certain choreographers grumble at the prospect of reviving dances. Others actually relish the experience of looking back. In the case of Bebe Miller, who formed her company in 1985 and has been a regular figure on the New York dance scene in the ensuing years, such yearning has resulted in “A History.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/BEBE/BEBE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/BEBE/BEBE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/BEBE/BEBE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/BEBE/BEBE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/BEBE/BEBE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/BEBE/BEBE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'