ition to Martin Richard and Krystle Campbell, a female graduate student from China was identified as the third spectator killed in the marathon blasts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/us/victims-ages-8-and-29-remembered-for-kindness-and-laughter.html', 'snippet': 'In addition to Martin Richard and Krystle Campbell, a female graduate student from China was identified as the third spectator killed in the marathon blasts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — Martin Richard and Krystle Campbell, two of three people killed Monday at the Boston Marathon, shared something in common with most of those injured by the blasts. They were there to watch others. They were not supposed to be the subjects of a newspaper story.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/us/VICTIMS-1/VICTIMS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/us/VICTIMS-1/VICTIMS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/us/VICTIMS-1/VICTIMS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/us/VICTIMS-1/VICTIMS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1357, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/us/VICTIMS-1/VICTIMS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/17/us/VICTIMS-1/VICTIMS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75