-8977-501dc210f4f1'}, {'abstract': 'College acceptance letters are increasingly telling applicants to show up at midyear, an economic benefit for the colleges but a shock to the students.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/education/more-college-applicants-dont-get-in-until-winter.html', 'snippet': 'College acceptance letters are increasingly telling applicants to show up at midyear, an economic benefit for the colleges but a shock to the students.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elizabeth Bricker of Rumson, N.J., was still half-asleep when her mother came into her room two weeks ago carrying an envelope from the University of Southern California. Even through the haze of spring break, she could see that the envelope was big — big enough to mean she had gotten in. “I was so excited,” she recalled. “Then I opened it and I read the letter and I was like, oh no! I started to cry.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/nyregion/DEFER/DEFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/nyregion/DEFER/DEFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/nyregion/DEFER/DEFER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/nyregion/DEFER/DEFER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/nyregion/DEFER/DEFER-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su