1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55e948e9-6cc8-52aa-8f03-0f53ecd8e92b'}, {'abstract': 'On a night that was dedicated to the legacy of Jackie Robinson, the Yankees rode a three-run homer by Robinson Cano and hung on with a save from their No. 42, Mariano Rivera.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/sports/baseball/yankees-top-diamondbacks-4-2-on-a-night-honoring-no-42.html', 'snippet': 'On a night that was dedicated to the legacy of Jackie Robinson, the Yankees rode a three-run homer by Robinson Cano and hung on with a save from their No. 42, Mariano Rivera.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a night when the Yankees and the Arizona Diamondbacks honored the legacy of Jackie Robinson, the No. 42 was everywhere. Each Yankees and Diamondbacks player wore a jersey with that number to honor Robinson, who wore it when he broke the major league baseball color barrier in 1947.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'th