mes', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opinion Report: Torture, Confirmed', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T12:50:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d110f11-929c-5185-869b-d782ae73a29a', 'word_count': 39, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d110f11-929c-5185-869b-d782ae73a29a'}, {'abstract': 'To be a drunk was one thing. A drunk mommy? That, I decided, was my rock bottom.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/mommies-dont-drink-anymore/', 'snippet': 'To be a drunk was one thing. A drunk mommy? That, I decided, was my rock bottom.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Mommies don’t drink beer,” my older daughter said with a dramatic eye roll.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Mommies Don’t Drink’ (Anymore)', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alcohol Abuse', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T13:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kimberly McCreight', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kimberly', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McCreight', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff8a94fd-36b4-558a-8f62-60a348681f3f', 'word_count': 741, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff8a94fd-36b4-558a-8f62-60a348681f3f'}, {'abstract': 'Christie’s opens the bidding for its online-only auction of vintage accessories.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/site-to-be-seen-christies-vintage-couture-accessories/', 'snippet': 'Christie’s opens the bidding for its online-only auction of vintage accessories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The venerable auction house Christie’s opens the bidding for its online-only auction of vintage accessories – including costume jewelry, handbags and trunks – at 10 a.m. on Thursday. Carefully curated by Clare Borthwick, Christie’s specialist in vintage couture and accessories, the goods include jewelry from Chanel, Kenneth Jay Lane, Miriam Haskell and Yves Saint Laurent; handbags from Hermès in almost every color, including a white Birkin with gold hardware ideal for the summer; and trunks from Louis Vuitton that date back to the first quarter of the 20th century. The sale will continue online through May 2. And if your dream bag isn’t on the site yet, don’t fret: Christie’s specialists already have their next online-only sale planned to start on May 9 featuring exotic handbags from Hermès. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Site to Be Seen | Christie’s Vintage Couture Accessories', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Handbags and Purses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T13:09:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': 