s://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/arctic-nations-seekcommon-management-of-fishing-as-open-water-spreads/', 'snippet': 'Facing an opening Arctic Ocean, nations opt to mange any new fishing effort cooperatively.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Humanity has long had a two-pronged reaction to environmental change — girding against risks but also probing for opportunities. The spread of ice-free Arctic Ocean waters in summer is eroding shorelines and may be affecting Northern Hemisphere winter weather (the jury is out). But of course this change has also prompted enterprising shippers to test new trade shortcuts and led to projections of bountiful new fisheries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arctic Nations Seek Common Management of Fishing as Open Water Spreads', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCTIC OCEAN', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCTIC REGIONS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Commercial', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Treaties', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T14:27:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65220154-a43f-540f-8a52-8c5571d1f4ab', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65220154-a43f-540f-8a52-8c5571d1f4ab'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. LaBute, the author and filmmaker of provocative works like “In the Company of Men,” “The Shape of Things” and the play “Reasons to be Pretty,” will write a new series called “Full Circle,” about the intertwined lives of 11 people.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/directv-orders-new-series-from-neil-labute/', 'snippet': 'Mr. LaBute, the author and filmmaker of provocative works like “In the Company of Men,” “The Shape of Things” and the play “Reasons to be Pretty,” will write a new series called “Full Circle,” about the intertwined lives of 11 people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Grab your remote control and get ready to find new things about yourself to despise: Neil LaBute is coming to television.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/labute/labute-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 265, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/labute/labute-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 265, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/labute/labute-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/17/arts/labute/labute-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'DirecTV Orders New Series From Neil LaBute', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaBute, Neil', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DirecTV', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T14:27:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qu