preme Court ruled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/us/court-rules-warrants-are-needed-to-draw-blood-in-drunken-driving-cases.html', 'snippet': 'The fact that alcohol dissipates from the bloodstream over time does not by itself allow the police to take blood over objections, the Supreme Court ruled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The fact that alcohol dissipates from the bloodstream over time does not by itself give the police the right to draw blood without a warrant in drunken-driving investigations, the Supreme Court ruled on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court Says Police Need Warrant for Blood Test', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Court Says Police Need Warrant For Blood Test', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drunken and Reckless Driving', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fourth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNeeley, Tyler G', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Sobriety)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T16:04:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bc1c587-5326-5b1f-85bc-859a3108ef1c', 'word_count': 596, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bc1c587-5326-5b1f-85bc-859a3108ef1c'}, {'abstract': 'NBC video of scenes from Margaret Thatcher’s funeral at St. Paul’s Cathedral in London.', 'w