'}, {'abstract': 'Technology reporters Jenna Wortham and Brian X. Chen share their thoughts on the latest phenomenon in hardware, the so-called smart watch. Will it be a smart idea?', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/17/smartwatches/', 'snippet': 'Technology reporters Jenna Wortham and Brian X. Chen share their thoughts on the latest phenomenon in hardware, the so-called smart watch. Will it be a smart idea?', 'lead_paragraph': ' Rumor has it that Apple, Samsung, Google and Microsoft are all working on some sort of thingamajig that is worn around the wrist, which people are calling a smartwatch. None have arrived on the market yet, but they have everyone wondering whether or not this will be the biggest mobile device since the smartphone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/technology/17bits-wrist/17bits-wrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 264, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/17/technology/17bits-wrist/17bits-wrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 264}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/technology/17bits-wrist/17bits-wrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/technology/17bits-wrist/17bits-wrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/17/technology/17bits-wrist/17bits-wrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/17/