/2013/04/17/oilers-president-decides-insulting-fans-was-a-bad-idea/', 'snippet': 'The Edmonton Oilers’ president of hockey operations, Kevin Lowe, apologized on Tuesday after he offended the team’s fan base on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Edmonton Oilers’ president of hockey operations, Kevin Lowe, apparently needed to learn a lesson this week taught in Sports Marketing 101: Never take potshots at your fans. There might be a special chapter in the marketing handbook about doing so in a news conference designed to inspire optimism among your fans, as when you hire a new general manager because the last one drove the franchise into a ditch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oilers President Decides Insulting Fans Was a Bad Idea', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'MacTavish, Craig', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Edmonton Oilers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-17T20:57:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5f6deb2-c826-56dd-9924-992cd4676dd8', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5f6deb2-c826-56dd-9924-992cd4676dd8'}, {'abstract': 'A scene from the high school comedy "G.B.F.," directed by Darren Stein.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000002177503/clip-gbf.html', 'snippet': 'A scene from the high school comedy "G.B.F.," directed by Darren Stein.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A scene from the high school comedy "G.B.F.," directed by D