ood that harsh sanctions will drive Tehran to concessions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/world/middleeast/report-on-iran-urges-obama-to-rethink-sanctions.html', 'snippet': 'A panel of former senior American officials and outside experts asked President Obama to reconsider the likelihood that harsh sanctions will drive Tehran to concessions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A panel of former senior American officials and outside experts, including several who recently left the Obama administration, issued a surprisingly critical assessment of American diplomacy toward Iran on Wednesday, urging President Obama to become far more engaged and to reconsider the likelihood that harsh sanctions will drive Tehran to concessions. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Report Urges White House to Rethink Iran Penalties', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Report Urges White House To Rethink Iran Penalties', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iran Project', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pickering, Thomas R', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crocker, Ryan C', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slaughter, Anne-Marie', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamilton, Lee H', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T00:17:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection