'uri': 'nyt://article/79156151-77d0-58ae-857a-0f591725bbb7'}, {'abstract': 'There are now specialized prosthetics with computerized knees and ankles that adjust to terrain and activity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/us/war-and-sports-shape-better-artificial-limbs.html', 'snippet': 'There are now specialized prosthetics with computerized knees and ankles that adjust to terrain and activity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John Kremer, a Navy explosives expert, lost both his legs below the knee after stepping on a mine in Afghanistan in 2010. In his San Diego hospital bed, he assumed he would be chained to a wheelchair for a year or more. Walking seemed a distant goal. Running? He could barely comprehend the concept anymore.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/us/REHAB-2/REHAB-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/18/us/REHAB-2/REHAB-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/us/REHAB-2/REHAB-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 769, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/us/REHAB-2/REHAB-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1539, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/us/REHAB-2/REHAB-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/18/us/REHAB-2/REHAB-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe