'While the company’s Lumia smartphones continued to sell well, sales of its basic models, which make up the bulk of its business, took a dive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Nokia said on Thursday that its sales fell sharply in the first quarter because of lagging demand in emerging markets for its simplest models, adding to investor anxiety over the company’s ability to execute a turnaround.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nokia Trims Loss, but Sales Fall', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nokia Sales Fall, but Loss Is Narrower', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Kevin J", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nokia Oyj', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T11:46:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': "By Kevin J. O'Brien", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': "O'Brien", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9074765-0f76-5304-bc4e-c8290ce1ecd9', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9074765-0f76-5304-bc4e-c8290ce1ecd9'}, {'abstract': 'The new Comedy Central show that spins around Amy Schumer is as much the work of its staff as of its central player, as a six-month observation of the process reveals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/21/arts/television/amy-schumers-comedy-central-show-from-the-inside.html', 'snippet': 'The new Comedy Central show that spins around Amy Schumer is as much the work of its staff as of its central player, as a six-month observation of the process reveals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was mid-October, and six stand-up comedians were working on a sketch in\xa0the writers’ room of the new series “Inside Amy Schumer,” trying to come up with funny ways to commit suicide. “What if it was something with a low level of success, like throwing yourself down stairs?” Tig Notaro suggested. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 813}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 756, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1512, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/arts/21SCHUMER3/21JPSCHUMER2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Amy Schumer, Funny Girl', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Funny Girl', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': No