.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/highlights-childrens-magazines-come-to-india-bringing-goofus-and-gallant-with-them/', 'snippet': 'Indian versions of the American children’s magazine Highlights unveiled in New Delhi on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Highlights, the earnest, unapologetically unhip magazine that entertained generations of American children while they waited in doctors’ and dentists’ offices, started publishing in India on Thursday with much fanfare.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/europe/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/18/world/europe/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/europe/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/europe/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1644, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/europe/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/18/world/europe/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk/18-goofus-gallant-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe