s-of-seesaw-marriages/', 'snippet': '“Seesaw marriage” means taking turns. But waiting for your time in either the dominant parent or the career-focused parent role can feel more like a tug of war.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I came to being a full-time stay-at-home mom late. I’m on catch-up with all those professional mothers who refined their style over the baby and toddler years. But I’ve found that I’m not measured against them, but against my husband — and sometimes I fail to measure up.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Ups and Downs of ‘Seesaw Marriages’', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosin, Hanna', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T13:17:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Hodgson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hodgson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0a5e99f-0263-5641-b925-765107a51e98', 'word_count': 779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0a5e99f-0263-5641-b925-765107a51e98'}, {'abstract': 'Despite public concerns about rising foreign aid, lawmakers in Germany signed off on a multibillion-euro bailout for Cyprus despite concerns.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/business/global/german-lawmakers-back-cyprus-bailout.html', 'snippet': 'Despite public concerns about rising foreign aid, lawmakers in Germany signed off on a multibillion-euro bailout for Cyprus despite concerns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Germany’s lower house of Parliament approved the bailout package for Cyprus on Thursda