last, Indian home minister says.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/ammonium-nitrate-used-in-bangalore-blast-police-say/', 'snippet': 'No connection between Boston bombings and Bangalore blast, Indian home minister says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI— The Bangalore police and government officials said Thursday that investigators are chasing several leads in the blast that injured 16 people on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1183, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/world/asia/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk/18-bangalore-blasts-IndiaInk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ammonium Nitrate Used in Bangalore Blast, Police Say', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shettar, Jagadish Shivappa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangalore (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delhi (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Karnataka (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T13:42:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hari Kumar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d42af41-9a38-5991-a50f-d823a1117bea', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d42af41-9a38-5991-a50f-d823a1117bea'}, {'abstract': 'Morgan Stanley posts a first-quarter profit of $1 billion. | Rising profits may turn out to be a source of discomfort for banks. | A top Barclays executive, Rich Ricci, is stepping down. | Stephen A. Feinberg has emerged as a possible buyer of the gun maker Freedom Group.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/morgan-stanleys-first-quarter-rebound/', 'snippet': 'Morgan Stanley posts a first-quarter profit of $1 billion. | Rising profits may turn out to be a source of discomfort for banks. | A top Barclays executive, Rich Ricci, is stepping down. | Stephen A. Feinberg has emerged as a possible buyer of the...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Morgan Stanley on Thursday reported first-quarter profit of $1 billion, or 50 cents a share, driven by sold results in wealth management. The profit compared with a loss of $79 million a year earlier and beat estimates. Excluding one-time charges, the firm had a profit of $1.2 billion, or 61 cents a share, which was down from $1.4 billion reported in the first quarter of 2012. The firm is holding a conference call at 10 a.m. to discuss the results.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morgan Stanley’s First-Quarter Rebound', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T13:59:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffd0de29-1376-5780-be95-b66b3d07eb10', 'word_count': 1564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffd0de29-1376-5780-be95-b66b3d07eb10'}, {'abstract': 'The game between the Bruins and the Sabres at TD Garden on Wednesday night was a chance for Boston to exhale.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/sports/at-the-bruins-game-a-time-to-rally.html', 'snippet': 'The game between the Bruins and the Sabres at TD Garden on Wednesday night was a chance for Boston to exhale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While everyone rolls out the cliché that sporting events after tragedies serve as some sort of healing mechanism, the people involved always know better. No one went to the Bruins game at the TD Garden Wednesday night thinking it would ease the city’s pain from Monday’s Boston Marathon bombings. But like many clichés, it contains a kernel of truth. People went to the Bruins game Wednesday night because rallying together and doing something normal are at least steps into healing’s neighborhood. And so they came, and when the national anthem singer, Rene Rancourt, turned the song over to them, they all took a teary step forward. The Bruins had simply provided the gathering point.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/19leadingpic/19leadingpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At the Bruins Game, a Tim