 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1cf7708a-60f5-59ff-a45d-48ac4971294a', 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1cf7708a-60f5-59ff-a45d-48ac4971294a'}, {'abstract': 'There are certain spots at the Center Bar in the Time Warner Center that offer indelible views of two New York skylines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/booming/the-center-bar-at-time-warner-center.html', 'snippet': 'There are certain spots at the Center Bar in the Time Warner Center that offer indelible views of two New York skylines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are a few seats at Center Bar that early in the evening, before it gets too dark, offer one of the best views of New York City. Those are at the southern end of the marble bar, several feet away from the baby grand piano. The bar is not on a high floor, and these particular stools do not showcase nearby Central Park or any other New York landmarks, for that matter.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/booming/19drink-booming-center1/19drink-booming-center1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/19/booming/19drink-booming-center1/19drink-booming-center1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/booming/19drink-booming-center1/19drink-booming-center1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/booming/19drink-