t is clear enough that Germain might be one of his lost alter egos, a character ensnared by his own desires and a willful inability to distinguish reality from fantasy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reality and Fantasy: Desire Blurs the Line', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Reality and Fantasy: Desire Blurs the Line', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott Thomas, Kristin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ozon, Francois', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'In the House (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Luchini, Fabrice', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T21:57:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/eeee76e0-51e1-528b-8f9c-43730fd03f1c', 'word_count': 624, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eeee76e0-51e1-528b-8f9c-43730fd03f1c'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to jazz performances in New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/arts/music/jazz-listings-for-april-19-25.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to jazz performances in New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jazz', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jazz Listings for April 19-25', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Listings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '