ppet': "Viacom had claimed that the Web video service violated copyright law by showing unauthorized clips of shows like “South Park.’'", 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge said on Thursday that Viacom was being “anachronistic” in the copyright infringement lawsuit it filed against YouTube for using unauthorized clips of shows like “The Daily Show With Jon Stewart” and “South Park.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Rules Against Viacom in Copyright Suit Against YouTube', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Copyrights and Copyright Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Viacom Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T22:27:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a30dcbeb-eafe-5e29-a7f2-4c30e5595148', 'word_count': 281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a30dcbeb-eafe-5e29-a7f2-4c30e5595148'}, {'abstract': 'Record labels like Get On Down have been slowly redefining the role and shape of the reissue in the digital age.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/arts/music/get-on-down-and-the-reissue-market.html', 'snippet': 'Record labels like Get On Down have been slowly redefining the role and shape of the reissue in the digital age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MALDEN, MASS. — In a large — but not quite large enough — warehouse here earlier this month, a young man was shrink-wrapping a set of chess pieces by hand. On the other side of the room, another young man was taking those packages and placing them, along with four vinyl LPs, a sticker sheet and a booklet, into a larger box, creating a somewhat ornate treatment for a deluxe edition of “Liquid Swords,” the 1995 debut album by Wu-Tang Clan’s GZA.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19RECORD_SPAN/19RECORD_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'LPs With Goodies on the Side', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'LPs, With Goodies On the Side', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Get On Down', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T22:28:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Caramanica', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caramanica', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a5294c9-eaa6-59cd-8855-4d4b43772c45', 'word_count': 1019, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a5294c9-eaa6-59cd-8855-4d4b43772c45'}, {'abstract': 'In Australia, unlike in America, a successful HPV vaccination campaign has resulted in a sharp decline in genital warts and precancerous lesions among young women and men.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/hpv-vaccine-showing-successes-in-australia/', 'snippet': 'In Australia, unlike in America, a successful HPV vaccination campaign has resulted in a sharp decline in genital warts and precancerous lesions among young women and men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The American government’s goal of vaccinating young girls against the human papillomavirus has been disappointing, with less than a third of teenagers having completed a full course of HPV vaccine. But now the United States can look to Australia, which six years into a successful nationwide HPV vaccination campaign has experienced a sharp decline in the number of new cases of genital warts among young men and women.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 722}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 852, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1703, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/18/science/18wellguardasil/18wellguardasil-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'HPV Vaccine Showing Successes in Australia', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cervical Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Papilloma Virus (HPV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Warts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Youth', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-18T22:30:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/238b7ffb-c767-55e5-902a-d1366840921f', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/238b7ffb-c767-55e5-902a-d1366840921f'}, {'abstract': 'The state topped California in yogurt production last year, and at the same time, according to Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, showed “our approach to growing the economy and creating an entrepreneurial government is paying off.”', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/18/new-york-is-u-s-cultural-leader-at-least-in-making-yogurt/', 'snippet': 'The state topped California in yogurt production last year, and at the same time, according to Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, showed “our approach to growing the economy and creating an entrepreneurial government is paying off.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York State is now the yogurt capital of the nation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/nyregion/18cityroom-yogurt/18cityroom-yogurt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/19/nyregion/18cityroom-yogurt/18cityroom-yogurt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/nyregion/18cityroom-yogurt/18cityroom-yogurt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subTyp