isted romance that tries to blend horror with comedy, stars Matthew Settle as a real estate investor whose new girlfriend has a series of surprises in store for him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/movies/love-sick-love-directed-by-christian-charles.html', 'snippet': '“Love Sick Love,” a twisted romance that tries to blend horror with comedy, stars Matthew Settle as a real estate investor whose new girlfriend has a series of surprises in store for him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until “Love Sick Love” reveals its true colors, it has the tone of a biting satire of contemporary urban mating rituals. Its main characters, Dori (Katia Winter) and Norman (Matthew Settle), personify a breed of attractive, upscale narcissists in the Manhattan dating pool to which the description “toxic” applies. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19LOVESICK_SPAN/LOVESICK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19LOVESICK_SPAN/LOVESICK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19LOVESICK_SPAN/LOVESICK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19LOVESICK_SPAN/LOVESICK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/arts/19LOVESICK_SPAN/19LOVESICK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name'