 'Mr. Lund, a native of Finland, played in the N.H.L. long before the league began to attract the best ice hockey players in the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/sports/hockey/pentti-lund-nhls-top-rookie-in-49-dies-at-87.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Lund, a native of Finland, played in the N.H.L. long before the league began to attract the best ice hockey players in the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pentti Lund, the National Hockey League’s first prominent Finnish-born player and its 1949 rookie of the year, playing at wing for the Rangers, died on Tuesday in Thunder Bay, Ontario. He was 87.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/LUND-obit/LUND-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 464, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/LUND-obit/LUND-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 464}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/LUND-obit/LUND-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/LUND-obit/LUND-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1584, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/LUND-obit/LUND-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/19/sports/LUND-obit/LUND-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi