dered the government’s anticorruption body to complete investigations against Mr. Ashraf by Monday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pakistan: Court Allows Ex-Premier’s Candidacy', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pakistan: Court Allows Ex-Premier’s Candidacy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ashraf, Raja Pervez', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-19T01:37:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Salman Masood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Salman', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Masood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b651655-2e73-57e0-bcdc-24c02da80746', 'word_count': 73, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b651655-2e73-57e0-bcdc-24c02da80746'}, {'abstract': 'Ernest J. Moniz was approved 21-1 by the Senate Energy Committee, indicating that he will have no problem being confirmed by the full Senate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/us/politics/senate-committee-approves-ernest-j-moniz-energy-secretary-nominee.html', 'snippet': 'Ernest J. Moniz was approved 21-1 by the Senate Energy Committee, indicating that he will have no problem being confirmed by the full Senate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate energy committee formally approved the nomination of Ernest J. Moniz to be energy secretary, the committee announced on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senate Committee Approves Nominee for Energy Sec