, 'pub_date': '2013-04-19T04:04:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1284f12c-315f-509e-92b8-321f27452b2a', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1284f12c-315f-509e-92b8-321f27452b2a'}, {'abstract': 'An agent also testified that he had posed as a Texan who wanted to make a political donation to New York City’s comptroller, John C. Liu, that exceeded the legal limit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/nyregion/us-agent-posing-as-donor-is-heard-at-trial-of-ex-aides-for-liu.html', 'snippet': 'An agent also testified that he had posed as a Texan who wanted to make a political donation to New York City’s comptroller, John C. Liu, that exceeded the legal limit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Texan called himself Richard Kong; he said that he wanted to open restaurants in New York and that he needed a politician in his corner. So he helped to organize a fund-raiser for John C. Liu, the city comptroller, in August 2011. At the event, he was introduced to Mr. Liu.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jurors Hear Taped Talks About Plans to Help Liu', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jurors Hear Taped Talks About Plans To Help Liu', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pan, Xing Wu', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'person