Schaap', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rosie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schaap', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b1d5d04-cc3e-59a9-a067-8d8d0a408969', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b1d5d04-cc3e-59a9-a067-8d8d0a408969'}, {'abstract': 'Thierry Mugler, who has maintained creative involvement in the Mugler fragrance business since he departed from its fashion business a decade ago, is now also leaving that role.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/thierry-mugler-leaving-mugler-fragrance/', 'snippet': 'Thierry Mugler, who has maintained creative involvement in the Mugler fragrance business since he departed from its fashion business a decade ago, is now also leaving that role.', 'lead_paragraph': '11:19 a.m. | Updated The Clarins Fragrance Group announced Friday that Thierry Mugler, who has maintained creative involvement in the Mugler fragrance business since he departed from its fashion business a decade ago, is now also leaving that role. He is stepping down as artistic director of Thierry Mugler Parfums, a position in which he oversaw creative aspects of new fragrances, like the Womanity scent introduced in 2010. He will continue to consult for the brand. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thierry Mugler Leaving Mugler Fragrance', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Perfumes and Fragrances', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Formichetti, Nicola', 'rank': 5, 'major': '