reinvent video messaging by allowing people to chat through video with their friends and leave messages in the cloud.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/test-run-glide-video-messenger-app/', 'snippet': 'Glide, a new video-based start-up, hopes to reinvent video messaging by allowing people to chat through video with their friends and leave messages in the cloud.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is still unclear how people want to interact with video and their smartphone when it comes to communicating. Although iPhone owners use FaceTime, the Apple video chat feature, its usage pales in comparison to the number of texts and voice calls customers send on their devices.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/technology/bits-glide/bits-glide-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/technology/bits-glide/bits-glide-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/technology/bits-glide/bits-glide-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/19/technology/bits-glide/bits-glide-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/19/technology/bits-glide/bits-glide-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Test Run: Glide Video Messenger App', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headlin