e of the BBC Proms concerts this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Performances from the BBC Proms – an eight-week explosion of daily summer concerts, mostly at the Royal Albert Hall in London – will be broadcast by WQXR, the New York classical radio station, for the first time this summer, in an arrangement made possible by the station’s membership in the European Broadcasting Union.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A British Musical Tradition Will Get Airtime in New York', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Proms', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barenboim, Daniel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Joshua', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiDonato, Joyce', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gergiev, Valery', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glass, Philip', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Runnicles, Donald', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tchaikovsky, Peter Ilyich', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wagner, Richard', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zappa, Frank', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Broadcasting Corp', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Youth Orchestra of the United States of America', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WQXR', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-19T20:16:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'm