e ramps or sweet rhubarb help turn focaccia from an ephemeral treat into something more memorable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite an obsession with pizza and a great love of flatbreads, I’ve spent strangely little time making focaccia. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Bit of Kneading but a Lot of Versatility', 'kicker': 'A Good Appetite', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Bit of Kneading but a Lot of Versatility', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clark, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Focaccia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bread', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-19T21:03:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d0919b9-4eed-53ce-960e-f2e0808cbf9a', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d0919b9-4eed-53ce-960e-f2e0808cbf9a'}, {'abstract': 'A concert in the Composer Portraits series at Columbia University’s Miller Theater reviewed the works of Oliver Knussen, the British composer and conductor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/20/arts/music/oliver-knussen-in-composer-portraits.html', 'snippet': 'A concert in the Composer Portraits series at Columbia University’s Miller Theater reviewed the works of Oliver Knussen, the British composer and conductor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was clear on Thursday night before a concert at Columbia University’s Miller Theater that the Boston Marathon bombing has put security forces everywhere on high alert