ow and sweeten.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/carmelized-garlic-and-garlic-oil/', 'snippet': 'This method only caramelizes the cloves around the edges, but the center does mellow and sweeten.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s video I demonstrate a short cut method for caramelizing garlic. This is a handy tip for someone who doesn’t want to wait for an entire bulb to slowly roast in the oven, the traditional way of getting garlic that is golden through and through. This method only caramelizes the cloves around the edges. But the center does mellow and sweeten and you can use this this for any recipe that calls for caramelized or roasted garlic, like the one for potato, sage and lemon zest focaccia in my column this week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Caramelized Garlic and Garlic Oil', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Garlic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-19T21:53:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a6b5c83-0ae5-55ba-9581-ae878c9e4fa0', 'word_count': 182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a6b5c83-0ae5-55ba-9581-ae878c9e4fa0'}, {'abstract': 'The Islanders, who are 7-1-1 in their last nine games away from Nassau Coliseum, visit the Jets, who have won six of their last seven at MTS Centre, as both teams battle for a playoff spot in the Eastern Conference.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/islanders-expect-playoff-atmosphere-in-winnipeg/', 'snippet': 'The Islanders, who are 7-1-1 in their last nine games away 