 food in Croton-on-Hudson. Mr. Purdy, an enthusiastic traveler, said that he and Mr. Pratt wanted the prewar look of the unpretentious brasseries he came across in Paris, in the Provence region of France and in Morocco. Tagine is not Rick’s Café Américain, but it has many details that recall a time gone by. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 287, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 287}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 491, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 981, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21SUBDINEWE2/21SUBDINEWE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mingling of Morocco and Old France',