ent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/04/19/business/Wanting-More-Work.html', 'snippet': 'About 7.6 million Americans working part-time jobs are doing so reluctantly, and would rather have a full-time job. People stuck in such positions are one reason a broader measure of unemployment — which includes reluctant part-timers as well as p...', 'lead_paragraph': 'About 7.6 million Americans working part-time jobs are doing so reluctantly, and would rather have a full-time job. People stuck in such positions are one reason a broader measure of unemployment — which includes reluctant part-timers as well as people without a job who have looked for work in the past year, but not in the last four weeks — is so much higher than the standard jobless rate, which stands at 7.6 percent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wanting More Work', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Part-Time Employment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-19T23:35:07+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/8b653847-f519-5387-b686-6a8d76459963', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/8b653847-f519-5387-b686-6a8d76459963'}, {'abstract': 'The confusion surrounding the genocide trial of Gen. Efraín Ríos Montt highlighted the polarized emotions raised by a month of testimony about the bloodiest chapter in the country’s long civil war.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/20/world/americas/judge-rejects-annulment-of-ex-dictators-guatemala-trial.html', 'snippet': 'The confusion surrounding the genocide trial of Gen. Efraín Ríos Montt highlighted the polarize