, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-20T02:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/682af09a-e93a-52ad-be29-016a54f03070', 'word_count': 459, 'uri': 'nyt://article/682af09a-e93a-52ad-be29-016a54f03070'}, {'abstract': 'A Saturday stumper by David Steinberg.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/19/what-the-picky-pick/', 'snippet': 'A Saturday stumper by David Steinberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY’S PUZZLE — I had to work for this one, but that’s to be expected on a Saturday. There are solvers who don’t enjoy the pop culture entries in the New York Times crossword puzzle, but I hang on to them for dear life, especially on a Saturday. They are what give me my toehold.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What the Picky Pick', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-20T02:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fb27175-dc43-5eca-9726-35604f4bb854', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fb27175-dc43-5eca-9726-35604f4bb854'}, {'abstract': 'Joe Girardi said he was certain Derek Jeter would return to the Yankees as the same player he was before he injured his ankle. He just could not say when that return would be.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/20/sports/bas