ewhere in New England, you inevitably know all the names of the members of your board of selectmen. You see them at dinner parties; you recognize their children; you talk about easements, sewage redirection, the specter of a new lane on Route 5A.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 815}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 755, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1509, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/nyregion/21BIGCITY1/21BIGCITY1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Liberal, Old Liberal', 'kicker': 'Big City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Liberal, Old Liberal', '