, 'word_count': 760, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb10e005-ea10-531f-b006-53ccecc14855'}, {'abstract': 'American real estate manias are as old as the nation itself, but until recently they were localized — and focused on land, not homes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/21/business/before-housing-bubbles-there-was-land-fever.html', 'snippet': 'American real estate manias are as old as the nation itself, but until recently they were localized — and focused on land, not homes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SINCE 1997, we have lived through the biggest real estate bubble in United States history — followed by the most calamitous decline in housing prices that the country has ever seen. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-VIEW/21-VIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 490, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-VIEW/21-VIEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 490}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-VIEW/21-VIEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 837, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-VIEW/21-VIEW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1673, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-VIEW/21-VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-VIEW/21-VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'