d they most recently led their college teams to the N.C.A.A. tournament, Griner with Baylor, Delle Donne with Delaware and Diggins with Notre Dame. These are excerpts from their conversation last Wednesday with reporters and editors at The New York Times. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 255, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 255}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 870, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/sports/seconds/seconds-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Brittney Griner, Elena Delle Donne and Skylar Diggins', 'kicker': '30 Seconds ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Atop Women’s Basketball, And Just Getting Star