06, “to symbolize our commitment to becoming independent of fossil fuels.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/21/jobs/solarcitys-chief-on-a-turn-toward-the-sun.html', 'snippet': 'The chief executive of SolarCity says the company started on July 4, 2006, “to symbolize our commitment to becoming independent of fossil fuels.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'I WAS born in Pretoria, South Africa. My father was a chiropractor, and my mother operated a massage therapy college where students came to learn reflexology, massage techniques and natural health therapy. I’m the youngest of three boys, and I have a younger sister.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-BOSS/21-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 548, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-BOSS/21-BOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 548, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-BOSS/21-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-BOSS/21-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21-BOSS/21-BOSS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Turning Toward the Sun', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turning Toward the Sun', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 