ut his time with the Qingdao Eagles in China and about whether he had yet experienced any ribbing from the Spurs about one particular game he played against them back in 2004.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'McGrady’s Spurs Stint Recalls Magical Game', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGrady, Tracy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Antonio Spurs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-20T20:33:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve McPherson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McPherson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0468785-9fbf-5227-a8cc-6578955b8e6c', 'word_count': 681, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0468785-9fbf-5227-a8cc-6578955b8e6c'}, {'abstract': 'After the Space Shuttle program ended in 2011, Titusville, Fla., a boomtown born of the space race, started to lose its footing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/04/21/business/21backdrop-ss.html', 'snippet': 'After the Space Shuttle program ended in 2011, Titusville, Fla., a boomtown born of the space race, started to lose its footing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the Space Shuttle program ended in 2011, Titusville, Fla., a boomtown born of the space race, started to lose its footing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/business/21backdrop-ss-slide-T25B/21backdrop-ss-slide-T25B-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 