daf64ce73'}, {'abstract': 'Many of the state’s brewers have embraced a law that lets them open tasting rooms without a liquor license, but some say the tap rooms are bars by another name.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/21/us/montana-loophole-leaves-bitter-taste-among-bar-owners.html', 'snippet': 'Many of the state’s brewers have embraced a law that lets them open tasting rooms without a liquor license, but some say the tap rooms are bars by another name.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MISSOULA, Mont. — It was Saturday afternoon, and that meant the pale ale was flowing inside Draught Works, the latest brewery to open in this beer-loving college town. People swooned over the Czech pilsner and the coffee stout. A string band plucked away. As parents ordered another round, their children darted around the tables like giggling schools of fish.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21beer_2/21beer_2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21beer_2/21beer_2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21beer_2/21beer_2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21beer_2/21beer_2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21beer_2/21beer_2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt