ed undetected into the heart of the Bulls’ defense, but Coach Tom Thibodeau is expected to make adjustments to limit Lopez in Game 2 on Monday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 7 feet tall, with broad shoulders and tree-trunk legs, Brook Lopez is massive even by N.B.A. standards. But in the Nets’ 106-89 Game 1 victory against the Chicago Bulls on Saturday night at Barclays Center, Lopez repeatedly sneaked undetected into the heart of the Bulls’ defense. He had six layups in the first half alone, often by expertly drifting to the blind spots of Bulls defenders to create passing angles for his teammates.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/sports/basketball/22nets-pic/22nets-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/22/sports/basketball/22nets-pic/22nets-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/sports/basketball/22nets-pic/22nets-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/sports/basketball/22nets-pic/22nets-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/sports/basketball/22nets-pic/22nets-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/22/sports/basketball/22nets-pic/22nets-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75