'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/8855323e-42f3-5f25-8dda-c72a21dbab45', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/8855323e-42f3-5f25-8dda-c72a21dbab45'}, {'abstract': 'The final of the NEC Cup in Yokohama, Japan, on Sunday was easily won by Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/crosswords/bridge/bridge-russia-wins-nec-cup-in-yokohama.html', 'snippet': 'The final of the NEC Cup in Yokohama, Japan, on Sunday was easily won by Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The final of the NEC Cup in Yokohama, Japan, on Sunday was easily won by Russia: Andrei Gromov, Alexander Dubinin, Evgeni Gladysh and Mikhail Krasnosselski from Russia; and Sjoert Brink from the Netherlands. They defeated Mixed (Sabine Auken from Denmark; Roy Welland, Reese Milner, Hemant Lall and Jacek Pszczola from the United States; and Michal Kwiecien from Poland) by 153.5 international match points to 53. Mixed conceded after 48 of the scheduled 64 boards. The winners shared $12,000 and the runners-up $6,000.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/crosswords/bridge/22card/22card-jumbo.gif', 'height': 500, 'width': 291, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/crosswords/bridge/22card/22card-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 500, 'width': 291, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/crosswords/bridge/22card/22card-thumbStandard.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/22/crosswords/bridge/22card/22card-thumbStandard.gif', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype