yt://article/402f0d8c-6274-550c-aa96-b83af0b870a6'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 140 New York Times article in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/word-of-the-day-wily/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 140 New York Times article in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'wily •\\ˈwi-le\\• adjective', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day | wily', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T04:06:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2e52027-8466-5107-9504-0a24a28c0779', 'word_count': 181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2e52027-8466-5107-9504-0a24a28c0779'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/arts/television/whats-on-monday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '10 P.M. (13) THE ISLAND PRESIDENT (2012) The director Jon Shenk visits the Maldives, an archipelago of about 1,200 low-lying islands in the Indian Ocean, and follows the efforts of Mohamed Nasheed, above, the country’s president from 2009 to 2012, as he tries to save the nation, a haven for wealthy tourists, from being swallowed by rising seas thought to be caused by global warming. “It is in the nature of political leaders, especially in democracies, to be optimistic, to insist that solutions can be found to even the most intractable problems,” A. O. Scott wrote in The New York Times. “Topical, politically engaged documentaries, particularly those made by American filmmakers, share in this tendency, offering implicit reassurance even as they deliver bad news about the state of the world.” Mr. Shenk’s film, presented here by “Independent Lens,” “is buoyant and spirited enough to keep those demons temporarily at bay,” Mr. Scott added. “It is impossible, while watching it, to root against Mr. Nasheed or to believe that he will fail. But the hope that infuses this movie makes it all the more upsetting to walk out of the theater and contemplate a looming disaster that the world’s leaders seem unable to prevent.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Monday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s on Today', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T04:15:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/374523de-d8d4-54a4-aa52-d3596144a284', 'word_count': 730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/374523de-d8d4-54a4-aa52-d3596144a284'}, {'abstract': 'Despite only starting nine games in all competitions this season and making most of his appearances off the bench, Claudio Pizarro has been a crucial part of Bayern Munich’s successful and record-breaking campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/claudio-pizarro-soccers-best-third-choice-striker/', 'snippet': 'Despite only starting nine games in all competitions this season and making most of his appearances off the bench, Claudio Pizarro has been a crucial part of Bayern Munich’s successful and record-breaking campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some things get better with age, but soccer players are generally not among them. Claudio Pizarro may be an exception. Despite only starting nine games in all competitions this season and making most of his appearances off the bench, Pizarro has been a crucial part of Bayern Munich’s successful and record-breaking campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Claudio Pizarro: Soccer’s Best Third-Choice Striker', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayern Munich (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T04:27:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cristian Nyari', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cristian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nyari', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/70915801-8ffa-57ed-b214-e57b32ab1186', 'word_count': 764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70915801-8ffa-57ed-b214-e57b32ab1186'}, {'abstract': 'Victims of the Boston Marathon bombing were remembered Sunday at churches, makeshift shrines and a funeral home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/04/21/us/21boston.html', 'snippet': 'Victims of the Boston Marathon bombing were remembered Sunday at churches, makeshift shrines and a funeral home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Victims of the Boston Marathon bombing were remembered Sunday at churches, makeshift shrines and a funeral home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21boston-slide-B0ZP/21boston-slide-B0ZP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/21/us/21boston-slide-B0ZP/21boston-slide-B0ZP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp