ith George” — and produce it operatically, quadrupling the size of the orchestra? Mr. Sondheim talks about the show.', 'lead_paragraph': ' What happens when you take a Stephen Sondheim chamber piece — “Sunday in the Park With George” — and produce it operatically, quadrupling the size of the orchestra? Parisian audiences are finding out this week at the 2,000-seat Théâtre du Châtelet. Mr. Sondheim talks about the show. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sondheim in Paris, With ‘Sunday in the Park’', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lapine, James', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sondheim, Stephen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Sunday in the Park with George (Play)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T12:45:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bcf52ab-08cd-591e-98c3-aac3547c9ab6', 'word_count': 57, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bcf52ab-08cd-591e-98c3-aac3547c9ab6'}, {'abstract': 'Put your predictive skills to the test each week of the baseball season.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/triple-play-baseball-quiz-week-3-results/', 'snippet': 'Put your predictive skills to the test each week of the baseball season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Only 10 runners finished the Boston Marathon in under 2 hours 15 minutes, but the Rays and Red Sox had just four hits apiece on Patriots Day. The under was the winner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Triple Play: Week 3 Results', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content