he uneventful London Marathon and N.B.A. playoffs after the Boston Marathon bombings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/23/sports/rooting-for-routine-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'The sports world needed something like the uneventful London Marathon and N.B.A. playoffs after the Boston Marathon bombings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a sign of the week behind us that the highest hopes for Sunday’s London Marathon were for nothing to happen. Nothing truly awful, anyway. The sports world needed a day of nothing, of just an ordinary routine event, run under a cloud of sadness and anxiety and the now all-too-familiar flotilla of security cameras. There were winners and thousands and thousands of relieved finishers and sunny skies. There was a crash between a wheelchair athlete and one of the elite female runners, and that was the worst of it. For a while, the jet stream was fueled by the massive exhale.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/23leading1/23leading1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/23leading1/23leading1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/23leading1/23leading1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/23leading1/23leading1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1135, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/23leading1/23leading1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'heigh