blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/annual-giveaway-will-include-500000-books/', 'snippet': 'World Book Night is the publishing industry’s annual giveaway, with books going to nursing homes, schools and firehouses, among other places.', 'lead_paragraph': 'World Book Night, the publishing industry’s huge annual book giveaway, will be celebrated on Tuesday in 28 events across the country. This year, 500,000 books will be handed out in nursing homes, schools, firehouses and diners, among other places, in an effort to lure people who read rarely or not at all. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Annual Giveaway Will Include 500,000 Books', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T16:51:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f01ca26c-887c-54e5-808b-9463ec8ec164', 'word_count': 96, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f01ca26c-887c-54e5-808b-9463ec8ec164'}, {'abstract': 'Arthur Darvill and Joanna Christie will play Guy and Girl, as temporary replacements return to standby status in the hit musical.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/once-turns-to-britain-for-new-broadway-leads/', 'snippet': 'Arthur Darvill and Joanna Christie will play Guy and Girl, as temporary replacements return to standby status in the hit musical.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hit Broadway musical “Once” announced some unexpected casting news on Monday – the sort of news that tends to disappoint aspiring actors in New York theater. The musical’s lead performers, Ben Hope and Laura Dreyfuss, who were named to the roles of Guy and Girl in March, are being replaced by two British newcomers to Broadway, Arthur Darvill and Joanna Christie, who will make their debuts in the show on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Once’ Turns To Britain for New Broadway Leads', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dreyfuss, Laura', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hope, Ben', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kazee, Steve', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Milioti, Cristin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ACTORS EQUITY ASSN', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T16:56:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4fbf75f-da25-5768-a3e0-ecca18868fb3', 'word_count': 492, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4fbf75f-da25-5768-a3e0-ecca18868fb3'}, {'abstract': 'The author of this week’s cover article answers questions about the power struggle at NBC’s morning show — and why it matters.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/behind-the-cover-story-brian-stelter-on-the-drama-at-the-today-show/', 'snippet': 'The author of this week’s cover article answers questions about the power struggle at NBC’s morning show — and why it matters.', 'lead_paragraph':