 found poorly hidden in a Manhattan hotel lobby about the same time as the Boston Marathon bombing was traced to a North Carolina man whose family says he just acted in haste.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/a-disturbing-mystery-is-solved-and-a-tourist-is-in-custody/', 'snippet': 'A gun found poorly hidden in a Manhattan hotel lobby about the same time as the Boston Marathon bombing was traced to a North Carolina man whose family says he just acted in haste.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The man who inadvertently set off a sweeping police investigation when he hid his pistol under a cushion in a World Trade Center hotel lobby — minutes before the Boston Marathon bombing — was a tourist simply in a hurry to stow it and get back to his tour group, a relative said on Monday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/nyregion/22cityroom-crimescenextra/22cityroom-crimescenextra-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 522, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/nyregion/22cityroom-crimescenextra/22cityroom-crimescenextra-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 522, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/22/nyregion/22cityroom-crimescenextra/22cityroom-crimescenextra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/22/nyregion/22cityroom-crimescenextra/22cityroom-crimescenextra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/