kes deliveries by bicycle.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/the-small-picture-delivering-the-goods/', 'snippet': 'The Mattress Lot in Portland, Ore., makes deliveries by bicycle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We recently asked small-business owners to send us photographs that capture the soul of their businesses in a single shot.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Small Picture: Delivering the Goods', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mattresses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portland (Ore)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T19:47:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': "By You're the Boss Editors", 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a85ce15-9c9b-502c-b940-a3cce10cd645', 'word_count': 136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a85ce15-9c9b-502c-b940-a3cce10cd645'}, {'abstract': 'Rather than tough and fibrous, young ginger is juicy, plump and pink-blushed, and is mild and tender enough to eat raw in salads.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/dining/spring-ginger-the-mild-mannered-younger-sister.html', 'snippet': 'Rather than tough and fibrous, young ginger is juicy, plump and pink-blushed, and is mild and tender enough to eat raw in salads.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most of us know fresh ginger as that thick-skinned, aggressively spicy little fist in the winter greenmarket, or that shrunken knob in the crisper drawer of the refrigerator. But in April and May, if you look hard enough, you’ll discover a whole new root: spring ginger. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 595, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1191, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/dining/28GINGER_SPAN/28GINGER_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ginger’s Youthful Adventures', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ginger’s Youthful Adventures', 'name': None, 'seo'