a strengthening economy, the federal deficit is quickly contracting, as reflected in new estimates from Goldman Sachs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For four years, during and in the wake of the recession, the federal budget deficit ballooned to more than $1 trillion. But because of belt-tightening in Washington and a strengthening economy, it has started shrinking — and fast. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Incredible Shrinking Budget Deficit', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Monetary Fund', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T22:23:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Annie Lowrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lowrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7c3f12b-07f1-5061-90f5-27ef80f6d707', 'word_count': 620, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7c3f12b-07f1-5061-90f5-27ef80f6d707'}, {'abstract': 'San Antonio has begun Fiesta, a celebration whose high point is a flower parade meant to commemorate the Alamo and the Battle of San Jacinto.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/in-san-antonio-viva-la-fiesta/', 'snippet': 'San Antonio has begun Fiesta, a celebration whose high point is a flower parade meant to commemorate the Alamo and the Battle of San Jacinto.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Texans love to boast about the republic they enjoyed after divorcing Mexico, but no place celebrates the six flags over the state quite the way San Antonio does. The city has started its celebration of its history called Fiesta, whose signature event is the Battle of the Flowers parade on Friday.\xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In San Antonio, Viva la Fiesta!', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Antonio (Tex)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T22:24:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Millie Kerr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Millie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kerr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5cbb15c-36e2-5aa1-abf2-6c65a9c884ce', 'word_count': 415, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5cbb15c-36e2-5aa1-abf2-6c65a9c884ce'}, {'abstract': 'A summary of the winning submissions at the Editors’ Lab 2013 hack event at the Times building.', 'web_url': 'https://open.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/the-best-of-newsgaming-at-the-editors-lab/', 'snippet': 'A summary of the winning submissions at the Editors’ Lab 2013 hack event at the Times building.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This past weekend’s Editors’ Lab at the Times building was a lot of good fun — and it produced a lot of great work.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Best of Newsgaming at the Editors’ Lab', 'kicker': 'Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-22T22:37: