retch of Wyoming and became a billionaire whose assets included oil refineries and ski slopes, among them Sun Valley Resort in Idaho, died last Friday in Salt Lake City. He was 86. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1092, 'width': 786, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/HOLDING-obit/HOLDING-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert Earl Holding, Wide-Ranging Entrepreneur, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robert Holding Dies at 86; Held Vast Business Assets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yardley, William', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holding, Robert Earl (1926-2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sinclair Oil Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sun Valley Resort (Sun Valley, Idaho)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Snowbasin Resort (Huntsville, Utah)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-23T00:27:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d9b67a4-82c0-532d-bc12-95bff6a6eceb', 'word_count': 635, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d9b67a4-82c0-532d-bc12-95bff6a6eceb'}, {'abstract': 'Many writers label Wi-Fi and all that goes along with it a distraction, but the impulse to connect with the outside world is an ancient one.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/22/how-writers-interact-with-the-world/', 'snippet': 'Many writers label Wi-Fi and all that goes along with it a distraction, but the impulse to connect with the outside world is an ancient one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The image has been handed down throughout the long iconography of the West, most effectively transmitted in the image of Saint Jerome: the writer as a recluse, weaving spirited collocations of words in hushed seclusion. Jerome may have a lion at his feet, but he lacks other company — and, of course, he has no Wi-Fi. His condition is distinctly different from that of the modern writer; her room is not only well-lighted and likely lion-free, but also furnishes an Internet connection, through which the world’s tumult pours. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Writers Interact With the World', 'kicker': 'Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-23T00:30:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew Battles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dca943f3-f69d-5743-82cb-a1a8cb571b11', 'word_count': 1280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dca943f3-f69d-5743-82cb-a1a8cb571b11'}, {'abstract': 'The company’s stock passed $200 a share in after-hours trading for the first time since 2011 after it reported robust first-quarter earnings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/23/business/media/netflix-reports-strong-revenue-on-strength-of-subscribers.html', 'snippet': 'The company’s stock passed $200 a share in after-hours trading for the first time since 2011 after it reported robust first-quarter earnings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Ted Sarandos, the chief content officer for Netflix, told GQ in an interview published three months ago that “the goal is to become HBO faster than HBO can become us,” maybe he was on to something.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/business/Netflix/Netflix-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Subscribers Help Propel Netflix Gain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Subscribers Help Propel Netflix Gain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stelter, Brian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-23T00:36:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_na