tps://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/23/sports/basketball/bulls-edge-nets-to-win-round-2-on-points.html', 'snippet': 'Run over in the series opener, the Chicago Bulls wizened up, buckled down and handed the Nets a stern wake-up call.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The festive sounds of fireworks and drums in Saturday’s playoff-opening celebration at Barclays Center were replaced on Monday with the slap of a hand across the wrist, the thwack of a body landing firmly on the parquet floor. Forget a sea of blackouts by Nets fans. This was black-and-blue, Chicago Bulls basketball at its gritty best.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/sub-nets/sub-nets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/sub-nets/sub-nets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/sub-nets/sub-nets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/sub-nets/sub-nets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1301, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/sub-nets/sub-nets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/23/sports/sub-nets/sub-nets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/