3cc44c56027b'}, {'abstract': 'Representative Charles B. Rangel, a New York Democrat, claims his rights were violated in 2010 during the House ethics investigation and hearing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/nyregion/rangel-sues-to-overturn-2010-house-censure.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Charles B. Rangel, a New York Democrat, claims his rights were violated in 2010 during the House ethics investigation and hearing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Representative Charles B. Rangel is suing his colleagues in the House, claiming that his constitutional rights were violated in 2010 when lawmakers voted to censure him for a series of ethics violations, including failing to pay his taxes properly and accepting rent-stabilized apartments in Manhattan at below-market rent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 556, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 556, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy'