ut of classes Tuesday to protest what they called a weakening enforcement of educational standards, including a requirement that applicants have experience in a professional kitchen.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 302}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1032, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/dining/24CIA/24CIA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Students Protest at Culinary Institute', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Students Protest at Culinary Institute', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Culinary Institute of America', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moskin, Julia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Glenn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADMISSIONS STANDARDS', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chefs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-23T20:09:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Moskin and Glenn Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moskin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d858c4f8-d07e-5b88-8389-a6415caaec2f', 'word_count': 810, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d858c4f8-d07e-5b88-8389-a6415caaec2f'}, {'abstract': 'The combination of olive oil, garlic and clam broth boiled in a rich, briny sauce practically demands a lively white.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/23/wines-with-a-snap-for-clam-dish/', 'snippet': 'The combination of olive oil, garlic and clam broth boiled in a rich, briny sauce practically demands a lively white.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pasta with clams, one of the recipes in Mark Bittman’s new Flexitarian column, is one of my favorite dishes and is easy as can be when it comes to wine. The combination of olive oil, garlic and clam broth boiled in a rich, briny sauce practically demands a lively, lean, high-acid, somewhat austere white. Italy is full of good examples; just distinguish between mundane industrial bottles and those made with care. Good pinot grigio, Soave or Orvieto, to name three frequently abused wines, are fine choices, as are fianos and falanghinas from Campania. Avoid oakiness and lush textures; the wines want to have snap. Alternatives from farther afield? Chablis comes immediately to mind: a fresh, young modest Chablis. You have beauty in all these combinations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For a Clam Dish, Wines With a Snap', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Clams', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pasta', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-23T20:10:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Asimov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Asimov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b67a23b-bb89-5898-bbcd-aef52b7f22f1', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b67a23b-bb89-5898-bbcd-aef52b7f22f1'}, {'abstract': 'Our Time will offer after-school programs in Westchester County, Long Island, and northern New Jersey.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/23/theater-program-for-youth-who-stutter-will-expand/', 'snippet': 'Our Time will offer after-school programs in Westchester County, Long Island, and northern New Jersey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our Time, an arts organization in Manhattan for children and teenagers who stutter, announced on Monday night that it will expand to offer more after-school theater programs and speech therapy this fall and open new locations in Westchester County, Long Island, and northern New Jersey.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Theater Program For Youth Who Stutter Will Expand', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': 