 to the Metropolitan Museum of Art revel in their memories of a popular 1967 children’s novel set in the museum that was written by E. L. Konigsburg, who died last week.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/23/at-the-met-an-authors-legacy-lingers/', 'snippet': 'Visitors to the Metropolitan Museum of Art revel in their memories of a popular 1967 children’s novel set in the museum that was written by E. L. Konigsburg, who died last week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Walking up the granite stairs of the Metropolitan Museum of Art from the Great Hall on Tuesday, Alison Watts immediately thought about how she had taken the same steps as the luckiest brother and sister duo in literature. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/23cityroom-museum/23cityroom-museum-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 845, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/23cityroom-museum/23cityroom-museum-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 845, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/23cityroom-museum/23cityroom-museum-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/23cityroom-museum/23cityroom-museum-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/nyregion/23cityroom-museum/23cityroom-museum-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}]