91-57e3-5881-95a1-35acd3166a06'}, {'abstract': 'In testimony before a Senate Judiciary subcommittee, a Yemeni man who had studied in the United States said the strikes turned Yemenis against America.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/world/middleeast/judiciary-panel-hears-testimony-on-use-of-drones.html', 'snippet': 'In testimony before a Senate Judiciary subcommittee, a Yemeni man who had studied in the United States said the strikes turned Yemenis against America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A Yemeni man who studied at an American high school told Congress on Tuesday that a drone strike on his village in Yemen last week terrified his neighbors, turning them against the United States in a way that terrorist propaganda had failed to do.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drone Strikes Turn Allies Into Enemies, Yemeni Says ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drone Strikes Turn Allies Into Enemies, Yemeni Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Durbin, Richard J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Targeted Killings', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-24T00:34:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44e107f4-d97c-51a2-bca3-077358bff257', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44e107f4-d97c-51a2-bca3-077358bff257'}, {'abstract': 'Last year, the Lahontan cutthroat trout became the first confirmed catch of a fish that for decades was believed to have gone extinct.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/04/23/us/20130424_TROUT.html', 'snippet': 'Last year, the Lahontan cutthroat trout became the first confirmed catch of a fish that for decades was believed to have gone extinct.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, the Lahontan cutthroat trout became the first confirmed catch of a fish that for decades was believed to have gone extinct.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/us/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/23/us/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/us/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/us/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/23/us/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP/20130424_TROUT-slide-EBQP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_