rom Chicago’s downtown, hopes to shake up the city’s retail scene.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROSEMONT, Ill. — A new outlet mall under construction here — the first enclosed mall to be built in the Chicago area in over a decade — is both a departure for the outlet industry and a major new attraction for this close-in Chicago suburb long known as a convention and business hub.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 236, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 236}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/SUB-CHICAGO-1/SUB-CHICAGO-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', '