elays began to build up at airports around the country. Travelers had to wait, but nothing delayed Republicans from scurrying away from all responsibility. Speaker John Boehner started using the Twitter hashtag #ObamaFlightDelays, the latest effort in his party’s campaign to blame all the pain of the sequester on the Obama administration while claiming all the credit for its effect on reducing the deficit.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Budget Cuts, Minus the Inconvenience', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Budget Cuts, Minus the Inconvenience', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Aviation Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIR TRAFFIC CONTROL', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Delays (Transportation)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Welfare (US)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-24T01:31:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d797443-f641-57e3-bd50-2883ddd5ca66', 'word_count': 588, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d797443-f641-57e3-bd50-2883ddd5ca66'}, {'abstract': 'Gunfire, pressure cookers, tweets, vigilantes and talking heads who can’t stop talking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/opinion/dowd-lost-i