m-size companies, as the nation struggles to avert another recession.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With Britain’s moribund economy struggling to avert a return to recession, a government-backed lending program was extended and reworked Wednesday in the hope of freeing up borrowing to credit-starved small and medium-size companies.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/Pound/Pound-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/25/business/Pound/Pound-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 640}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/Pound/Pound-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 961, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/Pound/Pound-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1877, 'width': 1760, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain Offers Hand to Smaller Businesses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain Extends Lending Program for Small Business', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castle, Stephen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of England', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and De