: 'nyt://article/a937cf37-937b-552c-85d2-5b68aa371da5', 'word_count': 763, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a937cf37-937b-552c-85d2-5b68aa371da5'}, {'abstract': 'Several technology writers who reviewed the Samsung Galaxy S4 agree that the device is good, but not great. Many felt the new software features were gimmicky and cumbersome.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/samsung-galaxy-s4-review-roundup/', 'snippet': 'Several technology writers who reviewed the Samsung Galaxy S4 agree that the device is good, but not great. Many felt the new software features were gimmicky and cumbersome.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Samsung’s new flagship smartphone, the Galaxy S4, will arrive in stores over the next week in the United States. Analysts expect this phone to be a potent challenger to the iPhone, but several technology writers who got the device early agree that the Galaxy S4 is good, but not great. Many felt the new software features were gimmicky and cumbersome.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/24bits-galaxy/24bits-galaxy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/24/business/24bits-galaxy/24bits-galaxy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/24bits-galaxy/24bits-galaxy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/business/24bits-galaxy/24bits-galaxy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1550, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image