ts collapse squarely on Jon S. Corzine, the former chief executive, and two of his top lieutenants. And unlike in many other suits, Mr. Freeh has not named other groups like a company’s directors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Strategic Posturing Behind the Suit Against Corzine', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corzine, Jon S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Freeh, Louis J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MF Global', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-24T15:47:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon and Peter J. Henning', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Henning', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62e45a62-c79a-5ee4-8e56-6119826e876f', 'word_count': 1228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62e45a62-c79a-5ee4-8e56-6119826e876f'}, {'abstract': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has been flooded with calls to require publicly traded corporations to disclose to shareholders all of their political donations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000002189365/fight-over-political-donations.html', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has been flooded with calls to require publicly traded corporations to disclose to shareholders a