settings with interchangeable stones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In honor of this week’s celebration of Earth Day, T is feeling for the Swiss jeweler Gilbert Albert’s rings with interchangeable stones. The bands, available in silver or gold, hold pearl-shaped gemstones that can be swapped out on a whim. There are more than 80 different precious stones to choose from, ranging from the standard amethyst, tiger’s-eye and lapis lazuli to the more grand leopard jasper, chrysoprase and mother-of-pearl. This collection gives “recycle, reuse, reduce” a whole new meaning.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling For | Gilbert Albert Interchangeable Rings', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Feeling For: Chameleon On a Finger', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earth Day', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-24T17:06:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a963328d-cf61-5e29-b96f-68dc923edcea', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a963328d-cf61-5e29-b96f-68dc923edcea'}, {'abstract': 'Are there any treatments that help to reduce the pain of plantar fasciitis? The Phys Ed columnist Gretchen Reynolds answers readers’ questions.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/ask-well-healing-plantar-fasciitis/', 'snippet': 'Are there any treatments that help to reduce the pain of plantar fasciitis? The Phys Ed columnist Gretchen Reynolds answers readers’ questions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Question:', 's