low-up to “Gangnam Style” made it only to No. 5 on the singles chart, despite its online popularity. Pink’s “Just Give Me a Reason” took the top spot.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/24/follow-up-to-gangnam-style-hits-no-5/', 'snippet': 'Psy’s follow-up to “Gangnam Style” made it only to No. 5 on the singles chart, despite its online popularity. Pink’s “Just Give Me a Reason” took the top spot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two months ago, Billboard began incorporating YouTube views in the formula for computing its all-important Hot 100 singles chart, allowing viral-video smashes to reach No. 1 even if they trailed other songs in sales and airplay, two of the chart’s other criteria. Sure enough, Baauer’s “Harlem Shake,” a huge hit online, sailed to No. 1 in the first week of the new chart.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/arts/24artsbeat-psy/24artsbeat-psy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 887, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/24/arts/24artsbeat-psy/24artsbeat-psy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 887}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/arts/24artsbeat-psy/24artsbeat-psy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/arts/24artsbeat-psy/24artsbeat-psy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1386, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/24/arts/24artsbeat-psy/24artsbeat-psy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l