ight Fitzgerald Suite in honor of the new “The Great Gatsby” film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/garden/the-plaza-introduces-the-fitzgerald-suite.html', 'snippet': 'The Plaza in Manhattan is offering its $2,795-a-night Fitzgerald Suite in honor of the new “The Great Gatsby” film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fans of “The Great Gatsby” may recall that the novel’s title character frequented the Plaza in Manhattan. So did F. Scott Fitzgerald, and in homage to the author and to the new Baz Luhrmann movie remake of his masterpiece, the hotel has created the Fitzgerald Suite.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/garden/25ROOMS/25CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/25/garden/25ROOMS/25CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 840}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/garden/25ROOMS/25CURR3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/garden/25ROOMS/25CURR3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/garden/25ROOMS/25CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/25/garden/25ROOMS/25CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/gard