t’s Hospital in Greenwich Village to close three years ago. The critics’ political committee, called NYC Is Not For Sale 2013, says that its mission is to defeat Ms. Quinn’s mayoral bid and that it does not represent any particular candidate. Its leaders are from Local 1180, which represents communications workers; an animal rights group which opposes horse-drawn carriages; and Wendy Kelman Neu, chief executive of Hugo Neu Corporation, a recycling company. The ad is to air on television. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Ad Campaign: Quinn, Development Interests and the Closing of a Hospital', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rudin Management Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "St Vincent's Hospital Manhattan", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-24T23:20:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anemona Hartocollis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anemona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartocollis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db4ec818-ef91-588c-a2ab-321849975fe7', 'word_count': 635, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db4ec818-ef91-588c-a2ab-321849975fe7'}, {'abstract': 'Beyond the energy and cost savings, new types of lighting are now envisioned as ways to heal, soothe, invigorate or protect people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/business/energy-environment/new-technology-inspires-a-rethinking-of-light.html', 'snippet': 'Beyond the energy and cost savings, new types of lighting are now envisioned as ways to heal, soothe, invigorate or protect people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AFTER the joy of the birth itself, parenthood sometimes brings the unwelcome news that a newborn has jaundice and must wear goggles and be placed under special lights. Imagine how different this experience might be if there were no goggles, just a warm blanket covering the tiny body, a healing frequency of blue light emanating from its folds.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/business/LIGHT/LIGHT-thumbLarge-v2.j