.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The situation is not sustainable. We need an exit strategy.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, Apr. 25, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-25T01:45:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/33e118ba-1443-5190-a77e-96a7f8beebb1', 'word_count': 30, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33e118ba-1443-5190-a77e-96a7f8beebb1'}, {'abstract': 'If Janet Yellin is not selected as the next chief of the Federal Reserve, three widely known men are possibilities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/business/possible-favorites-for-chief-of-the-federal-reserve.html', 'snippet': 'If Janet Yellin is not selected as the next chief of the Federal Reserve, three widely known men are possibilities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Handicapping the candidates to succeed Ben S. Bernankeas Federal Reserve chairman has much in common with predicting the outcome of a golf tournament: There’s a good chance that the winner will not be one of the early favorites.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'If Not Yellen at the Fed, Perhaps One of These', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'If Not Yellen at the Fed, Perhaps One of These', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Appelbaum, Binyamin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Summers, Lawrence H', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Geithner, Timothy F', 'rank':