ing against the Bulls in the playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Tom Thibodeau, the coach of the Chicago Bulls, is known as a taskmaster who can run his key players into the ground. In his team’s Game 2 victory over the Nets, Thibodeau used nine players who each had at least 10 minutes of action and made important contributions. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carlesimo and Nets Searching for Right Combinations', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Carlesimo and Nets Searching for Right Combinations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bulls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carlesimo, P J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thibodeau, Tom', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-25T02:55:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jake Appleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jake', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2af0b75b-58a9-50c9-b464-34992b4cf521', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2af0b75b-58a9-50c9-b464-34992b4cf521'}, {'abstract': 'As Islamists increasingly fill the ranks of Syrian rebels, President Bashar al-Assad is waging an energized campaign to persuade the United States that it is on the wrong side of the war.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/world/middleeast/syria-campaigns-to-persuade-us-to-change-sides.html', 'snippet': 'As Islamists increasingly fill the ranks of Syrian rebels, President Bashar al-Assad is waging an energized campaign to persuade the United States that it is on the wrong side of the war.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAMASCUS, Syria — As Islamists increasingly fill the ranks of Syrian rebels, President Bashar al-Assad is waging an energized campaign to persuade the United States that it is on the wrong side of the civil war. Some government supporters and officials believe they are already coaxing — or at least frightening — the West into holding back stronger support for the opposition.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/world/25damascus_337/25damascus_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 253, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/world/25damascus_337/25damascus_337-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 253, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/world/25damascus_337/25damascus_337-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/25/world/25damascus_337/25damascus_337-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Syria Plays on Fears to Blunt American Support of Rebels', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Syria Campaigns to Persuade U.S. to Change Sides', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 