nd the president of the lobbying group Common Cause.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/us/politics/bob-edgar-pennsylvania-congressman-dies-at-69.html', 'snippet': 'A six-term Pennsylvania congressman, Mr. Edgar was also a general secretary of the National Council of Churches and the president of the lobbying group Common Cause.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Edgar, a Methodist minister who pushed for liberal reforms as a six-term Pennsylvania congressman, a leader of American churches and president of the lobbying group Common Cause, died Tuesday at his home in Burke, Va. He was 69. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/us/EDGAR-obit/EDGAR-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/25/us/EDGAR-obit/EDGAR-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/us/EDGAR-obit/EDGAR-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/us/EDGAR-obit/EDGAR-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1972, 'width': 1420, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/25/us/EDGAR-obit/EDGAR-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/25/us/EDGAR-obit/EDGAR-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'