e9f1d7d9-ce75-54dc-acfb-2647864e7432'}, {'abstract': 'Dzhokhar Tsarnaev told investigators of intentions to strike New York City, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg and Police Commissioner Raymond W. Kelly said, but some federal officials discounted the notion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/26/nyregion/new-york-was-boston-blast-suspects-next-target-officials-say.html', 'snippet': 'Dzhokhar Tsarnaev told investigators of intentions to strike New York City, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg and Police Commissioner Raymond W. Kelly said, but some federal officials discounted the notion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not long before they engaged in a fevered shootout with the police, the suspects in the Boston Marathon bombing discussed heading to New York to detonate their remaining explosive devices in Times Square, city officials said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/nyregion/26nycthreat/26nycthreat-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '2 Tied to Boston Bombings Talked of Times Sq. Attack, Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Tied to Boston Bombing Talked of Times Sq. as Next Target, Officials Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Times Square and 42nd Street (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Dzhokhar A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Tamerlan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-25T18:35:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80c54048-8928-5db7-9183-a64db6c8ec84', 'word_count': 676, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80c54048-8928-5db7-9183-a64db6c8ec84'}, {'abstract': 'Teresa Fazio, then a 23-year-old Marine lieutenant, describes her affair with a man who worked in the battalion’s mortuary affairs unit in Anbar Province, Iraq.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/a-mortuary-affair-in-iraq/', 'snippet': 'Teresa Fazio, then a 23-year-old Marine lieutenant, describes her affair with a man who worked in the battalion’s mortuary affairs unit in Anbar Province, Iraq.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I never meant to be a wartime hussy. Unlike Paula Broadwell, I was not buff and beautiful; I was a shy Catholic girl from White Plains, N.Y., with a calligraphed physics diploma. As a 23-year-old Marine lieutenant just a year and a half out of R.O.T.C., my plan for a seven-month Iraq deployment included laying fiber-optic cable underground, not taking up with a comrade 12 years my senior. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mortuary Affair in Iraq', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Broadwell, Paula', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ANBAR PROVINCE (IRAQ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-25T18:51:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Teresa Fazio', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Teresa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fazio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99beb536-c2e7-50e9-8403-dba6b8056388', 'word_count': 1077, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99beb536-c2e7-50e9-8403-dba6b8056388'}, {'abstract': 'John le Carré appears in the trailer for his new novel, “A Delicate Truth.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/spymaster-makes-cameo-in-his-book-trailer/', 'snippet': 'John le Carré appears in the trailer for his new novel, “A Delicate Truth.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trailer for John le Carré’s new novel, “A Delicate Truth,” is a stylish new example of a form (art form, advertising form or both, depending on your perspective) that is still finding its feet. The book is being published in the United States next week, and the video appeared for the first time on Thursday on Mr. le Carré’s Web site.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spymaster Makes Cameo in His Book Trailer', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'A Delicate Truth (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Le Carre, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-25T18:51:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a16bef7d-162e-5546-941e-5d86b4cac64e', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a16bef7d-162e-5546-941e-5d86b4cac64e'}, {'abstract': 'As a pregnant school manager, I never imagined that seven weeks after giving birth, I would be working at a specialty foods store, slinging food for people whose lives no longer resembled mine.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/25/a-new-mom-is-downsized-but-not-down-and-out/', 'snippet': 'As a pregnant school manager, I never imagined that seven weeks after giving birth, I would be working at a specialty foods store, slinging food for people whose lives no longer resembled mine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Halfway through my pregnancy, I could not have imagined that seven weeks after giving birth, I would be behind the counter at a specialty foods store, slinging pricey cheeses and cutting fresh pasta for busy people whose lives no longer resembled mine, learning the difference between a Kalamata olive and a Castelvetrano, and pumping in the bathroom during my breaks. But there I was, with swollen breasts and an aching heart. I needed the insurance, the pay and the opportunity to venture alone into the world. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Mom Is Downsized, but Not Down and Out', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Working Hours', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-25T18:55:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zoe Ripple Burgess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zoe', 'middlename': 'Ripple', 'lastname': 'Burgess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0050c5ac-a8f3-5c66-b94e-fad373b1c251', 'word_count': 843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0050c5ac-a8f3-5c66-b94e-fad373b1c251'}, {'abstract': 'Foreign banks are pushing back against a Federal Reserve proposal to tighten rules on their American subsidiaries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/26/business/foreign-banks-in-us-face-greater-restrictions.html', 'snippet': 'Foreign banks are pushing back against a Federal Reserve proposal to tighten rules on their American subsidiaries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was a time,