send portraits of the doors on their fridges, with all the stuff on them. She was making a video to go with a song that she loved, called “Christine’s Refrigerator.” She did not write the song. Nor is she the Christine attached to the refrigerator. In fact, no Christine is associated with the refrigerator in question. There was a Bernadette, but the man who wrote the lyrics, Don Rosler, said he didn’t think “Bernadette’s Refrigerator” would have sounded right.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taking Inspiration From Song and Pictures on Refrigerator', 'kicker': 'About New York', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taking Inspiration From Song And Pictures on Refrigerator', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dwyer, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lavin, Christine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosler, Don', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Margolis, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refrigerators', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-26T02:02:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dwyer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dwyer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4164a53c-bd92-5ccd-a5de-8a20cc4f3257', 'word_count': 779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4164a53c-bd92-5ccd-a5de-8a20cc4f3257'}, {'abstract': 'The president praised the courage of firefighters and others who responded after an explosion at a fertilizer plant last week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nyt