icle/13dcd3cf-c65e-556a-b400-a48ea1aca998', 'word_count': 1809, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13dcd3cf-c65e-556a-b400-a48ea1aca998'}, {'abstract': 'The actor on playing scary and failing to achieve a childhood goal of getting on “Letterman.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/magazine/michael-shannon-cannot-understand-why-hes-a-late-night-reject.html', 'snippet': 'The actor on playing scary and failing to achieve a childhood goal of getting on “Letterman.”', 'lead_paragraph': ' In “The Iceman,” you’re pretty scary as Richard Kuklinski, the contract killer who claimed to have killed more than 200 people. Ray Liotta and Robert Davi, who can be pretty scary too, are also in the film. Did you guys ever talk about being scary? Not really. Robert Davi talks a lot about his singing career. He was playing the Venetian, and he kept asking me if I was going to be in Vegas any time soon. Ray Liotta really didn’t say much, except every once in a while he would complain about something. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/magazine/28talk/mag-28Talk-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 394, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/magazine/28talk/mag-28Talk-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 541, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/28/magazine/28talk/28talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capti