d-54a8-b934-ed02b5501331'}, {'abstract': 'George Jones’s baritone singing, universally respected, found vulnerability and doubt behind the cheerful drive of honky-tonk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/27/arts/music/george-jones-country-singer-dies-at-81.html', 'snippet': 'George Jones’s baritone singing, universally respected, found vulnerability and doubt behind the cheerful drive of honky-tonk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'George Jones, the definitive country singer of the last half-century, whose songs about heartbreak and hard drinking echoed his own turbulent life, died on Friday in Nashville. He was 81.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/jpJONES1-obit/jpJONES1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/jpJONES1-obit/jpJONES1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/jpJONES1-obit/jpJONES1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/jpJONES1-obit/jpJONES1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/jpJONES1-obit/jpJONES1-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/jpJONES1-obit/jpJONES1-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'sub