'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc8186b8-23c8-59e5-8972-19c35b3e2b1b'}, {'abstract': 'Inside a four-story, four-bedroom town house in Cobble Hill, Brooklyn, is a two-story-high wall composed entirely of plants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/realestate/305-degraw-street-a-brooklyn-oasis.html', 'snippet': 'Inside a four-story, four-bedroom town house in Cobble Hill, Brooklyn, is a two-story-high wall composed entirely of plants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After an adventurous gut renovation that replicated its prim brick frontage but transformed its rear walls into a four-story curtain of glass and created a two-story-high internal wall composed entirely of plants, a former parking garage/office in Cobble Hill, Brooklyn, has been reimagined as a single-family oasis and is about to enter the market at $8 million. And, yes, it offers the consummate amenity in this car-clogged, child-friendly borough: a one-car garage spacious enough to accommodate the owner’s S.U.V. and a battalion of scooters and bicycles.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/realestate/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/28/realestate/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/realestate/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/realestate/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN/28EXCLUSIVE_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 's