eek, Tom Perrotta talks about the letters of Willa Cather; Julie Bosman has notes from the field; Alexandra Starr discusses T. D. Allman’s “Finding Florida”; and Gregory Cowles has best-seller news. John Williams is the host, filling in for ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, Tom Perrotta talks about the letters of Willa Cather; Julie Bosman has notes from the field; Alexandra Starr discusses T. D. Allman’s “Finding Florida”; and Gregory Cowles has best-seller news. John Williams is the host, filling in for Pamela Paul.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Book Review Podcast', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-26T16:12:56+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/022117af-5738-517d-acdc-51b1213d8eef', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/022117af-5738-517d-acdc-51b1213d8eef'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Jones was the definitive country singer of the last half-century, and his songs about heartbreak and hard drinking echoed his own turbulent life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/04/26/arts/music/20130427-JONES.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Jones was the definitive country singer of the last half-century, and his songs about heartbreak and hard drinking echoed his own turbulent life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Jones was the definitive country singer of the last half-century, and his songs about heartbreak and hard drinking echoed his own turbulent life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/ar