ashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graham, Heather', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'At Any Price (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tribeca Film Festival (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-26T22:43:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bee-Shyuan Chang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bee-shyuan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/173852cd-3505-5349-93a3-3077454a4d19', 'word_count': 670, 'uri': 'nyt://article/173852cd-3505-5349-93a3-3077454a4d19'}, {'abstract': 'The redesigned 2013 MKZ sedan, meant to herald a new era for Lincoln, hit the market with a big advertising and public relations push, but the vehicles didn’t arrive in showrooms as scheduled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/automobiles/a-troubled-introduction-for-a-crucial-new-model.html', 'snippet': 'The redesigned 2013 MKZ sedan, meant to herald a new era for Lincoln, hit the market with a big advertising and public relations push, but the vehicles didn’t arrive in showrooms as scheduled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — The redesigned 2013 MKZ sedan was meant to herald a new era for Lincoln, the longtime luxury division of Ford that was recently rechristened the Lincoln Motor Company. The MKZ’s arrival, originally set for the late fall of 2012, was ballyhooed in an expensive advertising campaign and an insistent public relations blitz. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/automobiles/Lincoln1/Lincoln1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xl