b_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/27/arts/music/beach-boys-win-legal-fight-but-must-still-sell-a-collection.html', 'snippet': 'The Beach Boys may have won a battle over their memorabilia, but they must sell it and split the money with others who said they had a claim to it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Beach Boys have won an eight-year legal battle over a collection of their memorabilia, including more than 50 handwritten scores for hits like “Good Vibrations” and “Surfin’ U.S.A.” But it is a partial victory, as binding arbitration has forced the band to agree to sell the memorabilia and split the money with other investors, lawyers and corporate entities who say they have a legal claim to it, court records show.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/27BEACHjp1/27BEACHjp1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 492, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/27BEACHjp1/27BEACHjp1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 492}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/27BEACHjp1/27BEACHjp1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 839, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/27BEACHjp1/27BEACHjp1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 955, 'width': 1165, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/27BEACHjp1/27BEACHjp1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/27/arts/27BEACHjp1/27BEACHjp1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg