researchers could predict whether the Dow Jones industrial average would rise or fall the following week.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/26/google-search-terms-can-predict-stock-market-study-finds/', 'snippet': 'A new study found that by tracking certain search terms in Google Trends, researchers could predict whether the Dow Jones industrial average would rise or fall the following week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The terms people search for on Google have been used to forecast how many Americans have the flu, travel plans and the price for which cars sell. Now a scientific study shows that Google search can be used to predict the stock market.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/technology/bits-googlesearch/bits-googlesearch-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 105, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/technology/bits-googlesearch/bits-googlesearch-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 105, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/26/technology/bits-googlesearch/bits-googlesearch-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/26/technology/bits-googlesearch/bits-googlesearch-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Google Search Terms Can Predict Stock Market, Study Finds', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dow Jones Stock Average', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 