e way for him to step down, according to several people familiar with the idea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/27/nyregion/democrats-said-to-discuss-plan-for-bronx-district-attorney-to-resign.html', 'snippet': 'With Robert T. Johnson under fire, party leaders have been discussing a proposal that would ease the way for him to step down, according to several people familiar with the idea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the prosecution record of the longtime Bronx district attorney, Robert T. Johnson, under fire, the borough’s Democratic leaders have been discussing a plan that would ease the way for him to step down within months, according to several people familiar with the idea. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/johnson/johnson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/johnson/johnson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/johnson/johnson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/johnson/johnson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/johnson/johnson-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/johnson/johnson-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh