3a-5f57-b7c9-f3d1e26199aa'}, {'abstract': 'Led by Carmelo Anthony, who seemed to enjoy silencing Celtic fans, the Knicks routed the Celtics and took a three-games-to-none lead in their first-round series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/27/sports/basketball/knicks-rout-celtics-in-game-3.html', 'snippet': 'Led by Carmelo Anthony, who seemed to enjoy silencing Celtic fans, the Knicks routed the Celtics and took a three-games-to-none lead in their first-round series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The suspense had long since dissipated, along with the Boston Celtics’ spirit, but Carmelo Anthony was still on the parquet floor late Friday, dribbling, firing, skipping with a childlike glee and then, finally, making a slow, purposeful walk to the bench.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/sports/basketball/27knicks1-img/27knicks1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/27/sports/basketball/27knicks1-img/27knicks1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/sports/basketball/27knicks1-img/27knicks1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/sports/basketball/27knicks1-img/27knicks1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1391, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/sports/basketball/27knicks1-img/27knicks1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp