ive redevelopment project.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/nyregion/queensboro-motorcycle-clubs-engines-revving-for-103-years-now.html', 'snippet': 'The clubhouse of the Queensboro Motorcycle Club, perhaps the city’s oldest such group, may have to make way for a massive redevelopment project.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few clubs would want their headquarters in the Willets Point section of Queens, a massive, muddy cluster of auto repair shacks — but the Queensboro Motorcycle Club is perfectly happy wedged in there among the junkyards and salvage shops.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/nyregion/28MOTORCYCLE_SPAN/28MOTORCYCLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/28/nyregion/28MOTORCYCLE_SPAN/28MOTORCYCLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/nyregion/28MOTORCYCLE_SPAN/28MOTORCYCLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/nyregion/28MOTORCYCLE_SPAN/28MOTORCYCLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/nyregion/28MOTORCYCLE_SPAN/28MOTORCYCLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/28/nyregion/28MOTORCYCLE_SPAN/28MOTORCYCLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLar