th Carolinian some time to warm up to New York, though he had a head start on liking the Knicks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/sports/basketball/knicks-and-new-york-are-acquired-tastes-for-one-fan.html', 'snippet': 'It has taken a transplanted North Carolinian some time to warm up to New York, though he had a head start on liking the Knicks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most of my adult life, I have hated New York City.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 671}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 916, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1831, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Acquired Ta