ug Kickback Scheme', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Alleged Drug Kickback Scheme', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Novartis AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bharara, Preet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-27T17:32:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bb6311f-834c-51de-aa46-6145c0dd2e84', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bb6311f-834c-51de-aa46-6145c0dd2e84'}, {'abstract': 'Cancers have long been categorized by the tissue where they originate in the body, but new tools and tests are helping doctors tailor treatment to specific gene mutations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/business/in-cancer-treatment-new-dna-tools.html', 'snippet': 'Cancers have long been categorized by the tissue where they originate in the body, but new tools and tests are helping doctors tailor treatment to specific gene mutations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CANCERS were once named strictly for the tissue where they originated in the breast, prostate or other part of the body. Now, in the age of genetically informed medicine, cancers may also come with a more specific lexicon: the names of mutated genes deep within tumors that cause cells to become cancerous.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/busines