raph': 'ROME — Ending a crushing two-month political stalemate that had spooked European leaders, Prime Minister-elect Enrico Letta formed a rare coalition government on Saturday uniting left and right — and including a record number of women and Italy’s first nonwhite minister — to steer Italy, with the euro zone’s third-largest economy, out of the doldrums.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/world/28Italy_2/28Italy_2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/world/28Italy_2/28Italy_2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/world/28Italy_2/28Italy_2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/28/world/28Italy_2/28Italy_2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Italy Forms New Coalition Government to End Months of Political Stalemate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Italy Forms New Coalition Government to End Months of Political Stalemate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donadio, Rachel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Letta, Enrico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party (Italy)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'People of Liberty Party (Italy)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name