cle/fc1880c8-53c2-5edd-91ba-b35482e28fa2'}, {'abstract': 'Contestants in the Eastern Surf Association’s state championships Saturday in Rockaway found a neighborhood in recovery, as well as a different — and some say improved — pattern of waves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/sports/after-sandy-surfers-return-to-rockaway-to-find-better-waves.html', 'snippet': 'Contestants in the Eastern Surf Association’s state championships Saturday in Rockaway found a neighborhood in recovery, as well as a different — and some say improved — pattern of waves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Walking down Beach 90th Street in Rockaway offers a glimpse of a neighborhood in the midst of an uphill battle: windows are shuttered, lawns are littered with debris and a beach is unprotected by its boardwalk. Yet as Rockaway slowly recovers, block by block, one crucial element is back, and, according to some, better: the wave.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/28surf3-img/28surf3-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/28surf3-img/28surf3-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/28surf3-img/28surf3-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/28surf3-img/28surf3-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/28/sports/28surf3-img/28surf3-img-thumbStandard-v2.jp