f picnic tables, and now a parks department supervisor and his staff must assemble 500 tables by Memorial Day, about twice the normal number they make each spring.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/28/replacing-picnic-tables-taken-by-hurricane-sandy/', 'snippet': 'Hurricane Sandy damaged or ruined hundreds of picnic tables, and now a parks department supervisor and his staff must assemble 500 tables by Memorial Day, about twice the normal number they make each spring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This spring has been no picnic for Chris Gruber and his staff of carpenters, who work for New York City and make much of the equipment used at its parks and beaches.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/26cityroom-picnic/26cityroom-picnic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/26cityroom-picnic/26cityroom-picnic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/26cityroom-picnic/26cityroom-picnic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/26cityroom-picnic/26cityroom-picnic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/26cityroom-picnic/26cityroom-picnic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/27/nyregion/26cityroom-picnic/26cityroom-picni