': 'nyt://article/c755dacb-e43d-5456-a077-90b27e6ec079'}, {'abstract': 'The election will allow the return of the center-right parties that many blame for causing the economic meltdown in 2008.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/world/europe/iceland-voters-oust-government.html', 'snippet': 'The election will allow the return of the center-right parties that many blame for causing the economic meltdown in 2008.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Voters in Iceland have ousted the center-left government that restored the country to solvency after the 2008 financial crisis, paving the way for the return to power of the center-right parties that many people blamed for causing the crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iceland Ousts Government That Steered It Out of Crisis', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iceland Ousts Government That Steered It Out of Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lyall, Sarah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iceland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Independence Party (Iceland)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Progressive Party (Iceland)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Social Democratic Alliance (Iceland)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benediktsson, Bjarni (1970- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-28T19:56:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Lyall', 'p