o man. But one night, partying with a couple of friends in his basement apartment in Brooklyn, the combination and volume caused him to overdose. One of his friends called 911.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calling 911 Shouldn’t Lead to Jail', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Calling 911 Shouldn’t Lead to Jail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sheff, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nine-One-One (911) (Emergency Phone Number)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Good Samaritans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T01:02:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Sheff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sheff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/0264f3e3-f870-567d-80cf-d44dbb13a93d', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0264f3e3-f870-567d-80cf-d44dbb13a93d'}, {'abstract': 'Under the most recent proposal, Valeant would have paid more than $13 billion in stock to acquire Actavis. It is unclear whether negotiations will be revived.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/business/valeant-actavis-merger-talks-are-said-to-fall-through.html', 'snippet': 'Under the most recent proposal, Valeant would have paid more than $13 billion in stock to acquire Actavis. It is unclear whether negotiations will be revived.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Merger talks between Valeant Pharmaceuticals and another drug maker, Actavis, have fallen through, ac