rom Facebook, Comcast and General Motors, as well as vehicle sales and unemployment numbers for April.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/business/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-april-29.html', 'snippet': 'Reports include quarterly earnings from Facebook, Comcast and General Motors, as well as vehicle sales and unemployment numbers for April.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ECONOMIC REPORTS Data to be released include personal income and spending, pending home sales and the Dallas Fed’s manufacturing activity (Monday); the Standard & Poor’s/Case-Shiller Home Price Index, the Chicago Purchasing Managers’ Index and consumer confidence for April (Tuesday); A.D.P. employment for April, the I.S.M. manufacturing index for April and United States vehicle sales for April (Wednesday); the trade deficit for March and weekly initial jobless claims (Thursday); and unemployment for April (Friday). ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'kicker': 'Looking Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Behavior', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T02:20:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/317c0a69-85e8-5e76-a29e-c9aef4297735', 'word_count': 407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/317c0a69-85e8-5e76-a29e-c9aef4297735'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks fought their way back from 20 points down on Sunday, but failed to put away the Celtics while playing without the suspended J.R. Smith.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/sports/baske