o Ireland and Scotland, the perfumer David Seth Moltz created three unisex scents for D. S. & Durga.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/scent-notes-highland-breeze/', 'snippet': 'Inspired by his travels to Ireland and Scotland, the perfumer David Seth Moltz created three unisex scents for D. S. & Durga.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Obsessed with W. B. Yeats’s epic poem “The Wanderings of Oisin,” the perfumer David Seth Moltz traveled to Ireland and Scotland to collect inspiration for HYLNDS, his latest collection for the Brooklyn-based D. S. & Durga. What emerged from his travels are three unisex scents that each evoke the lands in the Celtic myths Yeats drew upon: one is Isle Ryder, an accord of jasmine, gorse and poplar bud that conjures Finlaggan, ruins of a castle in the middle of a lake on the peaty island of Islay.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scent Notes | Highland Breeze', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T13:20:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Felsenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Felsenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a656bd2-1dd9-52dc-9ae1-1bf08735a54d', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a656bd2-1dd9-52dc-9ae1-1bf08735a54d'}, {'abstract': 'The automaker said first-quarter earnings fell because it spent heavily to prepare to introduce new vehicles, and it reaffirmed earlier full-year forecasts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/business/chrysler-reports-a-profit-drop-of-65.html', 'snippet': 'The automaker said first-quarter earnings fell because it spent heavily to prepare to introduce new vehicles, and it reaffirmed earlier full-year forecasts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT – Chrysler Group said Monday that its net income fell 65 percent in the first quarter, to $166 million, as the automaker spent heavily to prepare for new product introductions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chrysler Reports a Profit Drop of 65%', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chrysler Group LLC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T13:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Vlasic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vlasic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c39ef106-de82-5308-8408-a68f63e9c1bd', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c39ef106-de82-5308-8408-a68f63e9c1bd'}, {'abstract': 'The e-commerce giant Alibaba agreed on Monday to pay $586 million for an 18 percent stake in the Sina Corporation’s Weibo, the most popular of China’s microblogging services.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/alibaba-buys-stake-in-sina-weibo-a-chinese-answer-to-twitter/', 'snippet': 'The e-commerce giant Alibaba agreed on Monday to pay $586 million for an 18 percent stake in the Sina Corporation’s Weibo, the most popular of China’s microblogging services.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:32 p.m. | Updated ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Alibaba Buys a Stake in China’s Twitter', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Alibaba Buys a Stake in China’s Twitter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ALIBABA.COM', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SINA Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sina Weibo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T13:31:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b92ab77-3bfe-5e10-b3d4-66228dd316d4', 'word_count': 296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b92ab77-3bfe-5e10-b3d4-66228dd316d4'}, {'abstract': 'The Times’s horse racing experts, Joe Drape and Melissa Hoppert, break down this year’s story lines and make their picks for the 2013 Kentucky Derby.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/sports/100000002197605/derby-dartboard-2013-race-preview.html', 'snippet': 'The Times’s horse racing experts, Joe Drape and Melissa Hoppert, break down this year’s story lines and make their picks for the 2013 Kentucky Derby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times’s horse racing experts, Joe Drape and Melissa Hoppert, break down this year’s story lines and make their picks for the 2013 Kentucky Derby.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/29/sports/video-derby/video-derby-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'lega