s the way ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kodak said on Monday that it would spin off its document and personal imaging units to its British pension plan for $650 million in cash and noncash considerations, a move that paves the way for Kodak’s exit from bankruptcy protection.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kodak Spinoffs Clear the Path for Emergence From Bankruptcy', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kodak Spinoffs Clear Path For Exit From Bankruptcy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eastman Kodak Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T15:46:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0aa29cb-afb9-59ec-b7bc-bb9c01620a48', 'word_count': 274, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0aa29cb-afb9-59ec-b7bc-bb9c01620a48'}, {'abstract': 'From Ethiopia to Kenya, local manufacturers have partnered with Western brands to make stylish shoes produced and sourced entirely on the African continent.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/made-in-africa-2/', 'snippet': 'From Ethiopia to Kenya, local manufacturers have partnered with Western brands to make stylish shoes produced and sourced entirely on the African continent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From Ethiopia to Kenya, a flurry of local manufacturers and craftsmen have partnered with Western apparel brands to make stylish shoes produced and sourced entirely on the African continent. There are rubber-soled cotton canvas low-tops from Mombasa, suede tennis shoes from Addis Ababa and crepe-soled nubuck loafers that incorporate materials from Mauritius, Liberia and South Africa.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '35', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Made in Africa', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Made in Africa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ethiopia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T15:55:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a18cbad4-5617-55d2-b031-c72bf88d59fb', 'word_count': 56, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a18cbad4-5617-55d2-b031-c72bf88d59fb'}, {'abstract': 'Youths not involved in murders should not be sentenced to die in prison, the justices ruled in 2010, but does a 100-year term violate that decision?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/us/supreme-court-ruling-on-sentencing-yields-split-interpretations.html', 'snippet': 'Youths not involved in murders should not be sentenced to die in prison, the justices ruled in 2010, but does a 100-year term violate that decision?', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — If people who are too young to vote commit crimes short of murder, the Supreme Court said in 2010, they should not be sentenced to die in prison.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{