': 'nyt://article/322e60b9-19c2-5413-988c-9a0b36ec0be4'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Kermit Gosnell, 72, who operated a clinic, is facing four charges of first-degree murder related to late-term abortions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/us/trial-abortion-doctor-kermit-gosnell.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Kermit Gosnell, 72, who operated a clinic, is facing four charges of first-degree murder related to late-term abortions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHILADELPHIA — They are known as Baby Boy A, Baby C, Baby D and Baby E, all of whom prosecutors call murdered children and the defense calls aborted fetuses — the very difference in language encapsulating why anti-abortion advocates are so passionate about drawing attention to the trial of Dr. Kermit Gosnell, which wrapped up here on Monday with summations by both sides. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/us/GOSNELL/GOSNELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/30/us/GOSNELL/GOSNELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 633}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/us/GOSNELL/GOSNELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 971, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/us/GOSNELL/GOSNELL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1423, 'width': 1348, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/us/GOSNELL/GOSNELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images