y. Rather than actively pursue new projects from the ground up, Loh waits for the right situation to present itself. And his newest hotel, One Leicester Street in London’s Chinatown, which opens May 1, is no exception.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Table Talk | One Leicester Street', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Henderson, Fergus', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Leicester (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T21:23:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Chang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb3ceb77-4fbd-5101-b498-938570511ccd', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb3ceb77-4fbd-5101-b498-938570511ccd'}, {'abstract': 'Readers of the Disruptions column this weekend were alarmed about a nascent technology through which you can control computers and smartphones with your mind.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/29/your-brain-on-computers-reader-response-to-mind-reading-computers/', 'snippet': 'Readers of the Disruptions column this weekend were alarmed about a nascent technology through which you can control computers and smartphones with your mind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My Disruptions column this weekend looked at a nascent technology through which you can control computers, smartphones and robotic arms with your mind.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 