ys done: she used her influence to step on the lower born. Witnesses said that when she was not given the table she wanted on Friday at Maximo Bistrot, a popular Mexico City restaurant, she called in inspectors who worked for her father at the country’s main consumer protection agency to shut it down.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bad Reviews for Patron at Restaurant in Mexico', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bad Reviews For a Patron At an Eatery In Mexico', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico City (Mexico)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cave, Damien', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Maximo Bistrot (Mexico City, Mexico, Restaurant)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benitez, Andrea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benitez Trevino, Humberto', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-29T23:37:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Damien Cave', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Damien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cave', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6eb960f4-34e6-576c-a4d0-cd1dbed7a1e1', 'word_count': 548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6eb960f4-34e6-576c-a4d0-cd1dbed7a1e1'}, {'abstract': 'Throughout much of the euro zone’s financial crisis, the bank was criticized for not doing enough. In Cyprus, it is accused of doing too much.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/business/global/blaming-europes-central-bank.html', 'snippet': 'Throughout much of the euro zone’s financial crisis, the bank was criticized for not doing enough. In Cyprus, it is accused of doing too much.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANKFURT — There are certainly plenty of people who could be blamed for the economic crisis in Cyprus that caused worldwide anxiety last month. The potential culprits include Cypriot bankers who bet too heavily on Greece and a communist-led government that dithered as the losses piled up.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/business/ECBCyprus/ECBCyprus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/30/business/ECBCyprus/ECBCyprus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/business/ECBCyprus/ECBCyprus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/business/ECBCyprus/ECBCyprus-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/30/business/ECBCyprus/ECBCyprus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/30/business/ECBCyprus/ECBCyprus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': 