ns without operator input in certain situations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Semiautonomous Cadillacs Hit the Road for Testing', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roads and Traffic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cadillac Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massachusetts Institute of Technology', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-30T13:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Stenquist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stenquist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d92536a1-4ed1-5e83-be0a-3827c9567cae', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d92536a1-4ed1-5e83-be0a-3827c9567cae'}, {'abstract': 'The methodology of the New York Times/CBS News poll on the public’s view on American intervention in Syria and North Korea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/us/how-the-poll-was-conducted.html', 'snippet': 'The methodology of the New York Times/CBS News poll on the public’s view on American intervention in Syria and North Korea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest New York Times/CBS News poll is based on telephone interviews conducted from April 24 to April 28 with 965 adults throughout the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Poll Was Conducted', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How the Poll W