/01/business/media/hulu-says-it-has-4-million-paid-subscribers-double-last-years-total.html', 'snippet': 'The online video site said it now has four million paid subscribers, up from two million last year, even as two of its owners are weighing whether to sell the company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hulu, the online video Web site that has both free and paid services, said Tuesday that it had doubled its number of paying subscribers in the last year, to four million.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hulu Says Number of Paid Subscribers Has Doubled', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hulu Says Number of Paid Subscribers Has Doubled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meyers, Seth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Upfronts (Television)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-30T14:13:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c0bb9bc-38f6-5b98-8788-e4865558e83d', 'word_count': 598, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c0bb9bc-38f6-5b98-8788-e4865558e83d'}, {'abstract': 'Deutsche Bank’s stock rose on Tuesday on expectations that a $3.87 billion share sale would clear the way for higher dividend payments.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/deutsche-bank-shares-rise-as-bank-executives-look-past-financial-crisis/', 'snippet': 'Deutsche Bank’s stock rose on Tuesday on expectations that a $3.87 billion share sale would c