stitutions reported strong first-quarter results in recent days, helped by cost-cutting and better performance of major units.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/during-earnings-season-european-banks-show-signs-of-health/', 'snippet': 'After years of painful job cuts and moves to make portfolios less risky, several large European institutions reported strong first-quarter results in recent days, helped by cost-cutting and better performance of major units.', 'lead_paragraph': '4:55 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Earnings Season Rolls On, European Banks Show Signs of Health', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Credit Suisse Group AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Bank AG', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lloyds Banking Group Plc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UBS AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-30T14:33:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Werdigier and Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Werdigier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/094b2235-1cf0-519a-a3ad-81d75d0d335c', 'word_count': 736, 'uri': 'nyt://article/094b2235-1cf0-519a-a3ad-81d75d0d335c'}, {'abstract': 'The applause after Jason Collins announced that he is gay signified that a new generation has moved in.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/sports/a-sudden-change-that-took-years-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'The applause after Jason Collins announced that he is gay signified that a new generation has moved in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a meaningful day in any world when you can stand back and watch progress happen. Thanks to Jason Collins, Monday was that day in sports. Here was an athlete in a men’s team sport willing to be the first to acknowledge he is gay. But the progress is what happened next. Applause. Almost universal, at least from all meaningful corners. A call from the president. N.B.A. teammates lauding his courage. It was like watching a generational change happen in five minutes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/basketball/01leadingpic/01leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/basketball/01leadingpic/01leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 822}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/basketball/01leadingpic/01leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 748, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/basketball/01leadingpic/01leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1496, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/basketball/01leadingpic/01leadingpic-thumbS