tname': 'Kim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/e24f2e94-8be5-5804-b6f8-8c6127c7d22f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/e24f2e94-8be5-5804-b6f8-8c6127c7d22f'}, {'abstract': 'Harry Winston’s latest sunflower collection features diamonds, platinum, and – soon – colorful gemstones fitting of spring.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/feeling-for-harry-winston-sunflower-collection/', 'snippet': 'Harry Winston’s latest sunflower collection features diamonds, platinum, and – soon – colorful gemstones fitting of spring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The late jeweler Harry Winston was quoted as saying (in a 1954 article in The New Yorker) that fine jewelry represents “what man has done to perfect nature.” In the jewelry house’s latest interpretation of the sunflower, which is being introduced this week, his words ring true. Drawing inspiration from the motif initially conceived in the 1950s as a one-of-a-kind high jewelry piece, the current iteration features a central diamond (the seeds) flanked by smaller diamonds (the petals), all of which is set in platinum. The collection includes a pendant necklace, drop earrings and studs. Also sprouting this spring are colorful versions of the sunflower earring, featuring a ruby, sapphire or emerald center stone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling For | Harry Winston Sunflower Collection', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diamonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winston, Harry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-30T15:58:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byl