eries with the Nets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/sports/basketball/bulls-defense-bears-the-brunt-of-mounting-injuries.html', 'snippet': 'Chicago has been forced to play comparatively poor defenders like Nazr Mohammed, Carlos Boozer and Nate Robinson for more minutes in its playoff series with the Nets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few teams soldier through injuries with the pride and confidence of the Chicago Bulls, but even they were not be able to handle the mounting body count in Game 5. The Nets overwhelmed the Bulls’ depleted defense and raided the lane in a 110-91 victory, staving off elimination and sending the series back to Chicago for Game 6 on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/01beckley/01beckley-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/01beckley/01beckley-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/01beckley/01beckley-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/01beckley/01beckley-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1373, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/01beckley/01beckley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/01beckley/01beckley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 