a starts feeling aggrieved. After practice here on Tuesday the Rangers coach was answering a routine question about team chemistry entering the playoffs when he embarked on an R-rated tangent that accused reporters of misrepresenting his relationship with Marian Gaborik, who was dealt to Columbus at the April 3 trade deadline.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/sports/hockey/01tortorella/01tortorella-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Season, a More Measured Tortorella', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gaborik, Marian', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Staal, Marc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tortorella, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-30T20:47:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1243b0f9-a793-5fb1-8584-78314464c8e2', 'word_count': 645, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1243b0f9-a793-5fb1-8584-78314464c8e2'}, {'abstract': 'A recent Delaware court case is a reminder that the founders of start-ups backed by venture capital often end up with nothing even if their company is sold.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/in-venture-capital-deals-not-every-founder-will-be-a-zuckerberg/', 'snippet': 'A recent Delaware court case is a reminder that the founders of start-ups backed by venture capital often end up with nothing even if their company is sold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s the dream of entrepreneurs to sell their company for millions of dollars. But the dirty secret of venture capital is that the dream can be dashed as the venture capitalists make millions in a sale, leaving the founders with nothing.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Venture Capital Deals, Not Every Founder Will Be a Zuckerberg', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Venture Capital Deals, Not Every Founder Will Be a Zuckerberg', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venture Capital', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carsanaro, Joseph A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Laster, J Travis', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zuckerberg, Mark E', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bloodhound Technologies Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-04-30T20:52:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19b04201-630c-51f0-9ef5-f4b43fdfb902', 'word_count': 1134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19b04201-630c-51f0-9ef5-f4b43fdfb902'}, {'abstract': 'The northern snakehead, an invasive, predatory fish that can live on land in the right conditions, has been reported in Harlem Meer in Central Park.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/04/30/searching-for-the-snakehead-fish-fierce-and-entirely-unwelcome/', 'snippet': 'The northern snakehead, an invasive, predatory fish that can live on land in the right conditions, has been reported in Harlem Meer in Central Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Harlem Meer, in the northeastern corner of Central Park, has long been a refuge for city people looking to indulge their inner Huck Finns, whiling away a lazy summer afternoon fishing for bass, yellow perch and black